case "ohh <3, Ms honney is the best just by seeing me she knew the real me, oh I almost forgot she also helped me to get information. ": return "哦哦<3，霍妮女士真棒，一眼就看穿了真正的我。啊，差点忘了，她还帮我打听到了消息。";
case "Rynn Draken": return "琳恩·德雷肯";
case "Oh Rynn I remember she was super drunk in the tavern and babbling something about the empire erasing part of history or something, well I didn't pay much attention I got distracted looking at her abs.": return "哦，琳恩！记得她在酒馆喝得烂醉，嘟囔着什么帝国抹去了部分历史之类的。嗯，我没仔细听，光顾着看她的腹肌了。";
case "Star": return "斯塔";
case "Oh I remember this poor shortstack, Lili mistook her for a little girl and she exploded with rage. ahh why does this fairy always get me in trouble...": return "哦，想起这个可怜的小个子了。莉莉把她当成小女孩，气得她当场炸毛。唉，这小妖精怎么老给我惹麻烦……";
case "Alina": return "阿莉娜";
case "Alina is still waiting for her friend, hopefully she will be able to see her soon.": return "阿莉娜还在等她的朋友，希望她们很快就能见面。";
case "Siness": return "西妮丝";
case "She was a very aggressive and territorial demon. The only way to beat her was to suck her energy out with my succubus powers hehe, I would not mind seeing her again, but Lili would kill me.": return "她是个攻击性很强、领地意识极重的恶魔。唯一的取胜办法，就是用魅魔之力吸干她的能量，嘿嘿。我倒不介意再见她一面，可莉莉会杀了我的。";
case "Callie": return "卡莉";
case "I regret Callie so much, I made her fall in love with me when I just wanted to be with her to experiment and she even wants to introduce me to her children. Sometimes I wish I was not half succubus, I hurt people so much.": return "我对卡莉特别内疚。本来只是想跟她试试，结果却让她爱上了我，她甚至想把我介绍给自己的孩子。有时候真希望自己没有一半魅魔血统，我伤害了太多人。";
case "Baina Salasaki": return "拜娜·萨拉萨基";
case "Baina Salasaki, a dream in life even my mother knew about her and I got to be with her <3 although I still found it a bit expensive.": return "拜娜·萨拉萨基，我梦寐以求的人，连妈妈都知道她！居然真能跟她共度一夜<3，就是还是觉得有点贵。";
case "Melina": return "梅莉娜";
case "Ohh this cat! because of her I am now curious about erotic asphyxiation, good thing Lili is always by my side if something bad happens.": return "哦，这只猫！都怪她，害我现在对窒息性爱也好奇起来了。还好莉莉一直陪着我，真出事也有人救。";
case "Pussiel": return "普茜尔";
case "Poor Pussiel because of me I made her work three times harder :c.": return "可怜的普茜尔，都怪我，害她工作量翻了三倍:c。";
case "Lina": return "莉娜";
case "Lina was so angry about losing to that slime cat, she even asked me to help her train even though I don't think my fighting style will help her.": return "莉娜输给那只史莱姆猫后气坏了，甚至求我陪她训练。不过，我的战斗方式恐怕帮不上她。";
case "Hynoxia": return "海诺克希娅";
case "Hynoxia I think she is the woman who sold the hypnotic gun to Lili, I wonder what else she has for sale?": return "海诺克希娅，应该就是把催眠枪卖给莉莉的那个女人。不知道她还有什么东西卖？";
case "Sam": return "萨姆";
case "My heroine of Tricotex, I can't believe we found her on the island. I hope someday to help her again but in her city <3.": return "我在特里科特克斯的女英雄！真不敢相信，竟然在这座岛上找到她了。希望哪天还能帮上她的忙，不过这回要去她的城市<3。";
case "Sieki": return "茜姬";
case "Sieki is the one who controls all the women in the VIP part of the bar, I wonder how someone gets to that position.": return "茜姬管着酒吧VIP区的所有女人。真好奇，要怎么才能坐上那个位置。";
case "Elena": return "艾蕾娜";
case "Vasuki": return "瓦苏基";
case "Vasuki came to this dimension by chance, I helped her to find the dimensional rifts so that she could return home. But she decided to stay here with me for some reason, it dos not bother me really, maybe I am a horrible person.": return "瓦苏基偶然来到这个次元，我帮她找到了次元裂隙，好让她回家。可不知为什么，她决定留在这里陪我。其实我还挺乐意的，也许我是个坏人吧。";
case "Kristoff": return "克里斯托夫";
case "How can I forget her, she has the perfect combination of dominance and delicacy, I hope she finds the cigarettes she likes, although if she does not find them maybe we could meet again hehe.": return "怎么可能忘了她，那股强势和温柔简直结合得恰到好处。希望她能找到喜欢的烟。不过找不到的话，说不定我们又能见面了，嘿嘿。";
case "Kamiko": return "神子";
case "kamiko is exactly the same as lili the only difference is that she is my size, well not so much the same Lili does have her good side.": return "神子跟莉莉简直一模一样，唯一的区别就是个头和我差不多。好吧，也没那么像，莉莉毕竟还是有优点的。";
case "Choco": return "巧可";
case "Sakura": return "樱";
case "She wanted to help me become a better succubus, although she spends most of her time having sex that I hardly see her. Maybe she is teaching me not to waste my time as a succubus? ahh why everything must be so complicated!": return "她想教我成为更出色的魅魔，可她大部分时间都忙着做爱，我几乎见不到她。难道是在教我，身为魅魔就别浪费时间？啊，为什么什么事都这么复杂！";
case "Maruia": return "玛露娅";
case "Maruia is a very honest orc she kept her word when I beat her in a fight. Mmm if somehow I get us to fight noo, what am I thinking bad thought out out OUT!": return "玛露娅是个守信用的兽人。被我打败后，她兑现了承诺。嗯，要是想办法让我们再打一场……不对！我在想什么！坏念头，出去出去，快出去！";
case "Naoki": return "直树";
