case "Lemmy told Lili that apparently ZONE-tam is a famous news reporter. Mmm now that I think about it why do Lili and Lemmy get along so well?": return "雷米跟莉莉说，ZONE-tam好像是个很有名的新闻记者。嗯，仔细一想，莉莉和雷米怎么这么合得来？";
