case "Magic Broom": return "魔法扫帚";
case "I love this broom <3, my little feet won't hurt anymore.": return "好喜欢这把扫帚<3，我的小脚终于不用再受罪啦。";
case "Tricotex money": return "特里科特克斯的钱";
case "Sam gave me this money, it is 10 dollars to use in Tricotex. I will keep it, who knows if i ever pass by.": return "萨姆给我的钱，是能在特里科特克斯花的10美元。先留着吧，说不定哪天就去那边了。";
case "Autographed photo of Sam": return "萨姆的签名照";
case "I still can not believe Sam gave me a picture with his autograph <3.": return "萨姆居然送了我一张签名照，还是觉得难以置信<3。";
case "BDSM Master/Slave Contract": return "BDSM主人／奴隶契约";
case "My contract with Lili, because of my problems I begged her to be my master and help me to practice my succubus powers and force me to try new things <3.": return "我和莉莉的契约。因为自己的那些毛病，我求她做我的主人，帮我练习魅魔能力，还要逼我尝试新事物<3。";
case "Raspberry pie": return "覆盆子派";
case "I am supposed to recognize the scent of this foot and then guide me through the forest to Marael's house.": return "我得记住这只脚的气味，靠它穿过森林，找到玛拉艾尔的家。";
case "Haigure Gun!": return "嗨古雷枪！";
case "This gun makes move in a very vulgar way, Just the thought of people watching me, moving uncontrollably while I make a fool of myself makes me so horny.": return "这把枪会让人扭出特别下流的动作。光是想到自己在众目睽睽下不受控制地扭来扭去、出尽洋相，我就兴奋得不行。";
case "Holy Grail": return "圣杯";
case "One of the relics of the islands. I can feel energy emanating from it.": return "岛上的圣遗物之一。我能感觉到，它正散发着能量。";
case "Crystal sphere": return "水晶球";
case "I found this half buried next to some cats, it looks like something valuable, maybe it will be useful for something.": return "在几只猫旁边找到的，半埋在土里。看着挺值钱，说不定能派上用场。";
case "Oniric incense": return "入梦熏香";
case "This is the best thing in the world! If I use it before I go to sleep I can have lucid dreams of things that happened to me <3.": return "这简直是世界上最棒的东西！睡觉前用一下，就能做清醒梦，重温以前经历过的事<3。";
case "Gilfried briefcase": return "吉尔德弗里德的公文包";
case "I have to return this briefcase to Gilfried immediately.": return "我得立刻把这个公文包还给吉尔德弗里德。";
case "Golden Key": return "金钥匙";
case "There is something strange about this key, I feel like it takes my energy somehow.": return "这把钥匙有点古怪，感觉它在以某种方式吸走我的精力。";
case "Smoosher uniforms": return "斯慕舍餐厅制服";
case "The uniform of the Smoosher restaurant smells a little funny.": return "斯慕舍餐厅的制服，闻起来有点怪。";
case "Aphrodisiac mushroom.": return "催情蘑菇。";
case "Moo Premium Milk": return "哞哞特级牛奶";
case "Fura Fura Fruit": return "弗拉弗拉果";
case "The fura fura fruit has the effect of creating a penis if eaten by a woman.": return "女性吃下芙拉芙拉果，就会长出阴茎。";
case "Hea Hea Fruit": return "嘿呀嘿呀果";
case "The hea hea fruit has a very powerful aphrodisiac effect that will make anyone who eats it come into heat.": return "荷亚荷亚果有极强的催情效果，谁吃了都会发情。";
case "Smuggled fabrics": return "走私布料";
case "I understand there was a convict who wanted to sell this, they ended up taking it from her and reselling it themselves (speaking of irony).": return "听说有个囚犯想卖这些东西，结果被人没收，对方又自己拿去卖了。真够讽刺的。";
case "Sewing machine": return "缝纫机";
