case "Nun Boots": return "修女靴";
case "Pelletclad Blade": return "弹甲之刃";
case "Place Holder Quest": return "占位任务";
case "Finally, you muster the courage to embark on an adventure with your fairy familiar to find and bring back your childhood best friend.": return "你终于鼓起勇气，带着妖精使魔踏上冒险之旅，要找回自己儿时最要好的朋友。";
case "Check the cat woman's shop; there might be something that interests you.": return "去猫女的商店看看，也许有你感兴趣的东西。";
case "The cat woman who runs the shop is somewhat grumpy because she hasn't had the chance to eat lunch.": return "看店的猫娘还没来得及吃午饭，所以有点烦躁。";
case "You managed to read the sinful thoughts of the fisherman. Perhaps this is your chance to explore your powers.": return "你成功读到了渔夫那些不正经的心思。也许，这正是探索自身能力的机会。";
case "Lili pushes you to be more proactive in training your succubus powers, so she sends you to try to seduce the cat woman who runs the shop. It should be easier since you know her.": return "莉莉催你更主动地练习魅魔能力，要你试着勾引看店的猫娘。毕竟已经认识她，应该更容易一些。";
case "There is a high-rank demon who has been stealing alcohol shipments. You decide to find and defeat her to see if you can get information about Ava.": return "一只高阶恶魔一直在偷酒。你决定找到并打败她，看看能否问出艾娃的消息。";
case "You're very lucky! You recognized one of the women who appeared in your mother's XXX magazines! She says she'll give you a special service for old times' sake.": return "真走运！你认出了妈妈那些色情杂志上出现过的一位女郎！她说，看在老交情的份上，会给你特别服务。";
case "You found a woman with violet pigtails at the corner of the bar. She says she can lend you money, but you must pay her back with an additional ten percent.": return "你在酒吧角落遇到了一位梳着紫色双马尾的女人。她愿意借钱给你，但归还时，要额外收取百分之十的利息。";
case "There's a cat woman playing very mean pranks on the villagers, and they're blaming Callie's daughter. Find the real culprit and save Callie's daughter!": return "有个猫娘正在对村民恶作剧，闹得很过分，大家却怪到了卡莉女儿头上。找到真正的罪魁祸首，救救卡莉的女儿！";
case "The plant woman from the shop told you she's very thirsty, and Lili suggested buying her beer to see if she'll give you discounts while drunk.": return "商店里的植物女说她渴坏了，莉莉提议买啤酒给她，看看灌醉之后能不能讨点折扣。";
case "A dragon woman fell from the sky among the prisoners and seems to be fighting to prevent a crystal from being stolen. Lili suggests we help her; maybe they'll reward us with something valuable.": return "一个龙女从天而降，落在囚犯中间，似乎在拼命保护一块水晶，不让它被抢走。莉莉提议帮她，也许能得到值钱的谢礼。";
case "There's a strange woman with pink hair hiding in a corner of the circus. Find out why people are talking about her.": return "马戏团角落藏着一个奇怪的粉发女人。弄清大家为什么都在谈论她。";
case "You found your favorite heroine! Sam, the protector of Tricotex. Prove that you have what it takes to embark on a capture mission with her.": return "你找到了最喜欢的女英雄——特里科特克斯的守护者萨姆。向她证明，你有实力和她一起执行抓捕任务。";
case "Someone is impersonating a knight of Elira to scam people. Catch them and be the heroine you always wanted to be!": return "有人冒充艾莉拉的骑士行骗。抓住骗子，成为你一直向往的女英雄！";
case "Kristoff, a VIP customer at the bar, is very angry and asks if you can buy him some premium cigarettes to help him calm down.": return "酒吧的贵宾克里斯托夫正在发火，问你能不能买些高档香烟，帮他消消气。";
case "The hotel secretary informs you that you've caught the attention of a woman who will be waiting for you on the top floor of the hotel. Hmm, what could she want? It might be important.": return "酒店前台告诉你，一位女士注意到了你，会在酒店顶层等你。嗯，她想干什么？说不定很重要。";
case "You've become a minion of a seemingly powerful individual! They order you to bring the dimensional fracture, which looks like a floating crystal, to leave this dimension.": return "你成了一位看起来很强大的家伙的跟班！对方命令你带回那个形似漂浮水晶的次元裂隙，好离开这个次元。";
case "There was a collapse in the cave, leaving many miners trapped. Wait until the knight of Elira clears the passage.": return "洞窟发生坍塌，许多矿工被困在里面。等艾莉拉骑士清开通道吧。";
case "There are some rumors of strange sounds coming from the Silent Forest at night. What could it be?": return "传闻寂静森林一到夜晚就会传出怪声。会是什么呢？";
case "An Onahole is desperate to buy a boat and is selling her body to do so. As an act of charity, help her.": return "一个肉便器为了买船，正拼命卖身赚钱。发发善心，帮帮她吧。";
case "Ivy, a honey slime, recognizes you as an adventurer who helps people and asks if you can help her find a part of herself that hasn't returned.": return "蜂蜜史莱姆艾薇认出你是个乐于助人的冒险者，想请你帮忙，找到她一直没有归来的那部分身体。";
case "You heard the Grand Captain of the Elira Guards arguing with a woman about the ineptitude of the knights. Maybe if you help them, they can assist you in your quest.": return "你听见艾莉拉卫队的大队长，正和一名女子争论骑士们有多无能。也许帮帮他们，他们也能在你的寻找之旅中助你一臂之力。";
case "You encountered Faye, a space-dimensional traveler trapped in your dimension. You decided to help her because you felt sorry for her.": return "你遇到了被困在此处的跨次元旅行者菲伊。觉得她可怜，便决定伸出援手。";
case "Vasuki tells you that something bad is happening at the mushroom house in the magenta swamp. Upon investigating, it seems that there may be human trafficking and drug activities occurring there.": return "瓦苏基告诉你，洋红沼泽的蘑菇屋里出了坏事。调查之后，那里似乎涉及人口贩卖和毒品交易。";
case "You found someone smelling the flowers, but as soon as you spoke to them, they attacked you. Find out what's really going on!": return "你发现有人在闻花香，可一开口，对方就攻击了你。弄清究竟发生了什么！";
case "There's something about Marael that doesn't quite convince you. Look into what she's really hiding.": return "玛拉艾尔总有些地方让你不太放心。查清楚她到底藏着什么。";
case "A letter addressed to Marael gives you clues that a woman named Willow also contacted Ava. Look for her to gather more information.": return "一封写给玛拉艾尔的信透露，有个叫薇洛的女人也联系过艾娃。去找她，多打听些消息。";
case "There's a bard woman looking for an adventurer to inspire her. Show her that you're a worthy adventurer capable of inspiring others!": return "一位女吟游诗人正在寻找能激发她灵感的冒险者。向她证明，你就是值得歌颂、能鼓舞他人的那个人！";
case "After being attacked by a pervert who opened his leather coat and showed you everything, something awakened inside of you.": return "一个变态向你敞开皮大衣，把里面露了个精光。遭遇这次袭击后，你心里的某样东西觉醒了。";
case "The island is cordoned off because someone stole the relics from the church. As part of the deal to stay on the island, you agree to help the knights of Elira search for the relics.": return "有人偷走了教堂圣物，整座岛因此被封锁。作为获准留在岛上的交换条件，你答应帮艾莉拉骑士寻找失窃的圣物。";
case "An Onahole stuck to the wall in the VIP area of the bar tells you that if you buy her entire outfit, she'll give you a rimjob!": return "酒吧VIP区有个被固定在墙上的人形飞机杯。她说，只要买齐她全身那套衣服，就给你舔肛！";
case "Lili says you're very stinky and need a bath.": return "莉莉说你臭死了，得赶紧洗澡。";
case "The librarian is lost, and no one knows where she is. Look for her, and perhaps you'll find more information about the people who go missing on the island.": return "图书管理员失踪了，谁也不知道她去了哪里。找到她，也许能进一步查清岛上的失踪事件。";
case "Gildfried, a businessman on vacation on the island, unfortunately lost his briefcase, which is very important to him.": return "来岛上度假的商人吉尔德弗里德，不幸弄丢了对他非常重要的公文包。";
case "Lemmy, a green monster outside an automated carriage, talks to Lili and asks for help because his mistress is having trouble.": return "自动马车外，一只名叫雷米的绿皮怪物找上了莉莉。它的女主人遇到了麻烦，想请你们帮忙。";
case "Sakura is working at the renowned fast food restaurant Smooshers! She asks for your help in searching for the lost uniforms.": return "樱正在著名的快餐店斯慕舍打工！她请你帮忙找回丢失的制服。";
case "One of Vasera's clones has gained autonomy. Vasera will go search for it and neutralize it. She advises you to kill it if you encounter it.": return "瓦瑟拉的一个克隆体有了自主意识。瓦瑟拉会去寻找并处理掉它，还提醒你，一旦遇到就杀了它。";
case "Sieki got angry with you because even though she already paid the debt to MsHonney, you're still in the VIP area. Now you follow her orders to avoid making her angrier.": return "茜姬已经替你还清了欠蜜糖女士的债，你却还赖在贵宾区，惹她生气了。现在，你只能乖乖照她的话做，免得她火上浇油。";
case "The farmer confesses that she would like to work with less clothing. How could you help her work more comfortably?": return "农场女工坦言，想穿得少一点干活。怎样才能让她干活时更舒服呢？";
case "The fortune teller confessed to you that she would like to have a red crystal orb because with it she could see her own future.": return "占卜师向你坦白，她想要一个红色水晶球，因为那样就能看见自己的未来。";
case "The water nymph who works at the bar is looking for love but is insecure because she doesn't know if people approach her for the beer or if they genuinely want something with her.": return "酒吧里的水仙女渴望爱情，却又缺乏安全感：她不知道别人接近她，究竟是为了啤酒，还是对她真有意思。";
case "Accidentally, you ruin Naoki's concoction just as he's entering mating season, so you decide to help him.": return "你不小心毁了直树的药剂，偏偏他正要进入发情期，于是决定帮帮他。";
case "Lucy the bard is having trouble with an Onahole, so you decide to help her with whatever she needs.": return "吟游诗人露西遇到了一个人形飞机杯引发的麻烦，你决定帮她解决。";
case "There are portals for self-satisfaction in the VIP area of the bar, but a witch won't let you use them.": return "酒吧贵宾区设有能让人自我满足的传送门，可一个女巫不让你使用。";
case "Sieki has a big problem and makes you a deal you can't refuse: you just have to attend to the clients in the VIP area while she's away, and you'll become a VIP customer.": return "茜姬遇到了大麻烦，提出一个让你无法拒绝的交易：她不在的时候，你只需招待VIP区的客人，就能成为VIP。";
case "A hospital robot offers anal cleaning services for just three thousand Arcs. It's not a bad idea to keep clean every now and then.": return "医院机器人提供肛门清洁服务，只需三千阿克。偶尔清理一下，也挺不错。";
case "A story you read in the library seems strange to you, so you decide to look for more information about it.": return "图书馆里读到的一则故事让你觉得很奇怪，于是决定寻找更多线索。";
case "There's a guy offering his services to make fursuits, which catches your attention, so you decide to save up for one.": return "有人提供兽装订制服务，你很感兴趣，决定攒钱买一套。";
case "There's an Onahole that has the same tone as you, which strangely excites you.": return "有个飞机杯的肤色和你一模一样，这居然让你莫名兴奋。";
case "In a nightclub, you find two gothic girls with big butts dancing, something you can't let pass in your life.": return "你在夜店遇到了两个扭着大屁股跳舞的哥特女孩，这种机会，一辈子都不能错过。";
case "Upon entering the usually closed public restroom, you find an idol vomiting, with many people screaming and demanding the show. What could be happening?": return "走进平时关着的公共厕所，你发现一个偶像正在呕吐，外面还有许多人尖叫着要求开演。到底怎么回事？";
case "There is a proliferation of slimes attacking and kidnapping women. Do your best to help and get to the bottom of this!": return "大量史莱姆四处袭击、绑架女性。尽力帮助她们，查清事情的真相！";
case "A being living in the pond enters Line's mind and psychologically strips her bare with questions she's not prepared to hear or face.": return "池塘里的某个存在进入莱茵的内心，问出她毫无准备、不愿听到也不愿面对的问题，将她的心理防线层层剥开。";
case "You don't know what's happening; you have mental gaps, and days and nights seem to pass in seconds.": return "你不知道自己怎么了，记忆出现空白，白天黑夜仿佛几秒钟就过去了。";
case "You have committed serious mistakes that haunt you at night, so you decide to confess to expiate your sins.": return "你犯下的严重错误让你夜不能寐，于是决定去忏悔，赎清罪孽。";
case "Callie invites you to meet her family, which seems more serious than what you're looking for, but it would be rude not to go.": return "卡莉邀请你认识她的家人，关系好像比你想要的更认真了，可不去又太失礼。";
case "You found a place that can serve you for sleeping while you investigate the island.": return "你找到了一个调查岛屿期间，可以歇脚过夜的地方。";
case "You need more power, so you beg Marael to help you unlock your succubus powers.": return "你需要更强大的力量，于是恳求玛拉艾尔帮你解放魅魔之力。";
case "The thieves on the island aren't just any criminals; they were actually stealing to maintain an orphanage, without which everything would collapse.": return "岛上的小偷并非普通罪犯。他们偷东西，是为了维持孤儿院的运转；没有他们，这里的一切都会垮掉。";
case "You met Futaba your trusted futanari in the forest, what could she be doing?": return "你在森林里遇到了信得过的扶她伙伴双叶，她在那里做什么呢？";
case "The barn is very busy due to the issues happening on the island. Help them however you can so that the barn can open.": return "岛上的种种事件让谷仓忙得不可开交。尽可能帮忙，让谷仓能重新开门吧。";
case "Rynn is frustrated because the last fight with you didn't end, so she challenges you to a beer drinking duel.": return "琳恩对上次和你没打完的架耿耿于怀，要和你比喝啤酒，一决胜负。";
case "Lili is angry with Line because she believes Line is completely ignorant about sex, and challenges her to a competition to see who is the better onahole.": return "莉莉觉得莱茵对性一窍不通，为此大为光火，还向她下了战书：比比谁才是更棒的肉便器。";
case "The milk on this island has very strange properties.": return "这座岛上的牛奶，有着非常奇怪的功效。";
case "A fat ugly bastard bothering Rynn at the bar he leaves but you can't stop thinking about him.": return "酒吧里，有个丑陋的胖混蛋纠缠着琳恩。他虽然走了，你却怎么也忘不掉他。";
