case "6 AM": return "早上六点";
case "* Marael tests you, in some way makes you feel like she wants you to fail.": return "* 玛拉艾尔在考验你，某种程度上，她似乎巴不得你失败。";
case "* I do not like the presence of those hands.": return "* 我不喜欢那些手的存在。";
case "* They are becoming more and more aggressive": return "* 他们越来越咄咄逼人了";
case "* They are everywhere, they do not leave me alone.": return "* 到处都是，它们就是不肯放过我。";
case "* Is a lot of money for just one person.": return "* 只给一个人，这笔钱可不少。";
case "* Is it really worth it?": return "* 这真的值得吗？";
case "* If I change, I will become something less than what I am now?": return "* 要是改变了，我会变得比现在更不堪吗？";
case "* She never managed to connect with anyone.": return "* 她始终没能跟任何人建立联系。";
case "* If I continue down this path, will the same thing happen to me?": return "* 再这样下去，我也会落得同样的下场吗？";
case "* Maybe I will end up the same way as Ms. Marael, but I still want to continue.": return "* 也许我会变得跟玛拉艾尔女士一样，但我还是想继续走下去。";
case "Succubus Gates Open ": return "魅魔之门已开启 ";
case "HP": return "生命";
case "Hi, there will be a free show next to the bar fluid heaven go and see it <3": return "嗨，流蜜天堂酒吧旁边有免费演出，快去看看吧<3";
case "Oh, sorry I forgot that I had already given you a pamphlet": return "哦，不好意思，忘了已经给过你传单了。";
case "Cutscene.": return "过场。";
case "pupu caca.": return "便便。";
case "For my friend": return "为了朋友";
case "There is a man behind the nightclub.there is a man behind the nightclub.there is a man behind the nightclub.": return "夜总会后面有个男人。夜总会后面有个男人。夜总会后面有个男人。";
case "The Man": return "那个男人";
case "Chikawaga!": return "奇卡瓦加！";
case "Lili Bj.": return "莉莉的口技。";
case "Line Bj.": return "莱茵的口技。";
case "Do the best bj ever and beat Lili!": return "献上有史以来最棒的口交，赢过莉莉！";
case "Line Vs Lili!": return "莱茵对莉莉！";
case "Cutscene3.": return "过场三。";
case "Cutscene2.": return "过场二。";
case "Cutscene1.": return "过场一。";
case "Win the beer drinking competition against Rynn.": return "在拼酒比赛中战胜琳恩。";
case "Beer Fight!": return "拼酒！";
case "Visit Kamiko at the Jailfarm": return "去监牢农场找神子。";
case "Look for the criminal who is impersonating a guard on the bridge that connects to the magenta swamp.": return "找到那个冒充守卫的罪犯，他就在通往洋红沼泽的桥上。";
case "Help Sam catch the criminal.": return "帮萨姆抓住罪犯。";
case "Look for the heroin that appears in the jail-farm.": return "寻找出现在监牢农场的女英雄。";
case "Defeat the white demon.": return "击败白色恶魔。";
case "Help Elira's guards to open the barn: Go towards the bar and talk to the guards.": return "帮助艾莉拉的卫兵打开谷仓：前往酒吧，与卫兵交谈。";
case "Help the guards.": return "帮助卫兵。";
case "Cutscene": return "过场";
case "Defeat Futaba.": return "击败双叶。";
case "DickDickenson": return "迪克·迪肯森";
case "Hope for the best.": return "往好处想吧。";
case "Go talk to Marael.": return "去和玛拉艾尔谈谈。";
case "Get 10.000 Arcs to sleep with Red, Naga and Cuervo.": return "凑齐10.000阿克币，和蕾德、娜迦、库埃尔沃共度春宵。";
case "Collect 3.000 Arcs to help Red, Naga and Cuervo.": return "攒够3,000阿克，帮助雷德、娜迦和库埃尔沃。";
case "Red's orphanage": return "蕾德的孤儿院";
case "Pass Marael's challenge and awaken your succubus powers.": return "通过玛拉艾尔的考验，唤醒你的魅魔之力。";
case "Go back to Marael.": return "回去找玛拉艾尔。";
case "Power awakening": return "力量觉醒";
case "SaveHause": return "安身之所";
case "At night he goes to the window adjoining Aldo's room.": return "晚上去与阿尔多房间相邻的窗边。";
case "After sleeping with callie you feel dirty go take a bath in her shower.": return "跟卡莉睡过后，你觉得自己脏兮兮的，去她的浴室洗个澡吧。";
case "It looks like Callie wants to talk to you, go to her.": return "卡莉似乎想找你说话，去见见她吧。";
case "Explore Callie's home..": return "探索卡莉的家……";
case "Callie invited you to have lunch, go to her house during the day.": return "卡莉邀请你吃午饭，白天去她家。";
case "A beautiful family": return "美满的一家人";
case "Where will the sister be?": return "修女会在哪里呢？";
case "What do I do now? I want her to think of me, I want her to hate me, I want her to think of me, I want her to hate me, I want my image to never leave her head again!.": return "现在该怎么办？我要让她想着我，我要让她恨我，我要让她想着我，我要让她恨我，我要让我的身影再也离不开她的脑海！";
case "Go to church for confession with the sister.": return "去教堂，向修女告解。";
case "The confession": return "忏悔";
case "Who am I?": return "我是谁？";
case "Who am I?.": return "我是谁？";
case "Inside my mind!": return "我的内心世界！";
case "sexminigame.": return "性爱小游戏。";
case "Defeat the Slime Mother Eleonor!": return "击败史莱姆之母埃莉诺！";
case "Find out why Conscious Slimes are appearing in the hospital!": return "调查医院里出现有意识的史莱姆的原因！";
case "Defeat the pink slime that is trying to enter the hospital.": return "击败想闯进医院的粉色史莱姆。";
case "According to the information from the guards, there is a slime near the hospital.": return "根据卫兵提供的消息，医院附近有一只史莱姆。";
case "Defeat the slime that is trying to capture the plant woman.": return "击败想抓住植物娘的史莱姆。";
case "Go to the entrance of the village where there is another slime wreaking havoc.": return "去村口，那儿还有一只史莱姆在捣乱。";
case "Defeats the pink slime that appeared in front of the Big Dream.": return "击败出现在大梦酒吧前的粉色史莱姆。";
case "Us": return "我们";
case "Go to the middle of the people in the pee pit.": return "走到尿池里那群人中间。";
case "Defeat Limon.": return "击败利蒙。";
case "GoldenTime": return "黄金时刻";
case "Go to the club's bathroom.": return "去俱乐部的洗手间。";
case "Hearts in sync": return "心心相印";
case "Bla bla bla!.": return "叽里呱啦！";
case "Golden voice": return "金嗓子";
case "No deberias leer esto :V": return "你不该看到这个:V";
case "Go home to masturbate like crazy in your new furrsuit.": return "回家，穿上新兽装，尽情自慰。";
case "Go home and sew your first furrsuit.": return "回家，缝制你的第一套兽装。";
case "My first fursuit <3": return "我的第一套兽装<3";
case "Get the sacred sword from the forest south of the hospital! Directions : up, down, left, left, right, down and finally up.": return "从医院南边的森林里取得圣剑！路线：上、下、左、左、右、下，最后向上。";
case "look for a gorilla to teach you how to channel the force like them.": return "找只大猩猩，学学它们是如何驾驭力量的。";
case "Look for a rabbit that can help you to be innocent.": return "找到一只兔子，让她帮你变得纯洁。";
case "Search for the novelist who is on the island.": return "寻找岛上的小说家。";
case "Read the book again for more information on the sword.": return "再读一遍那本书，了解更多关于剑的事。";
