case "encontro alcohol ": return "找到了酒。";
case "buys the bunny suit from the woman in the glory hole": return "向荣耀洞里的女人购买兔女郎装。";
case "Bunny bitch": return "兔女郎骚货";
case "Beat lina in a sparring match": return "在切磋中击败莉娜。";
case "Suka blyat": return "妈的，操";
case "Help Pussiel clean the second floor.": return "帮助普茜艾尔打扫二楼。";
case "Cleaning time": return "清扫时间";
case "You got a broom to move faster in town.": return "你获得一把扫帚，能在镇上更快地移动。";
case "Broom-roomroooom": return "扫帚，轰隆隆";
case "you asked for a loan for the first time.": return "第一次申请借款。";
case "I love The jail outfit <3": return "我超喜欢囚服<3。";
case "A true elf": return "真正的精灵";
case "you paid your first loan.": return "你还清了第一笔贷款。";
case "The first loan": return "第一笔贷款";
case "Save your game the for the first time.": return "第一次保存游戏。";
case "Goodnight": return "晚安";
case "Win the fight against Siness.": return "赢下与西妮丝的战斗。";
case "The secret of the forest": return "森林的秘密";
case "Win the fight against Star.": return "赢下与丝塔的战斗。";
case "The angry shortstack": return "暴躁的矮个大胸妹";
case "Win the fight against Alina.": return "战胜阿莉娜。";
case "The lost girl": return "迷途少女";
case "Win the fight against Rynn Draken.": return "赢下与琳恩·德雷肯的战斗。";
case "The hero berserker": return "狂战士英雄";
case "Complete all stages.": return "完成所有关卡。";
case "Thank for playing <3": return "感谢游玩<3";
case "Complete the Waifsteary.": return "完成老婆图鉴。";
case "Master Waifu": return "老婆大师";
case "Complete a stage with all positive stats.": return "在所有属性为正的状态下完成一个关卡。";
case "Perfect being": return "完美生命";
case "Give the fish to the cat woman.": return "把鱼交给猫娘。";
case "Good approach": return "好的开始";
case "Buy your first garment.": return "购买第一件衣服。";
case "First of many": return "万事开头难";
case "Swallow the fisherman's cum.": return "吞下渔夫的精液。";
case "Sweet energy": return "甜蜜能量";
case "Win your first stage.": return "赢下第一场关卡战斗。";
case "First win": return "首胜";
case "Take off all Line clothes in the equipment.": return "在装备栏里脱掉莱茵的所有衣服。";
case "Natural clothing": return "天然衣装";
case "See a monster naked in the Waifsteary.": return "在魔物娘图鉴中查看一只魔物的裸体。";
case "Shameless": return "不知羞耻";
case "Waifsteary": return "美人图鉴";
case "Hola este es el contexto de la quest como te va a mi me va muy bien <3 tiene que ser largo igual mas o menos dos lineas xd :v": return "你好呀，这是任务说明，最近怎么样？我过得很好<3。得写长一点，差不多两行吧，哈哈:v。";
case "Do you need help? Don't worry, I will explain what you need to know to win all your fights.": return "需要帮忙吗？别担心，我会教你怎样赢下战斗。";
case "First, the basics: align three or more cubes to make them explode and deal damage.": return "先讲基础：把三个或更多相同方块连成一线，就能消除它们，造成伤害。";
case "If you align four cubes at the same time, the hit will be stronger and a cube will evolve.": return "同时连起四个方块，攻击会更强，还会让一个方块进化。";
case "If you align five or more cubes, a maximum cube will be created, and I will come out to fight!": return "连成五个或更多方块，就会生成一个极限方块，我就能出来战斗了！";
case "Oh, and I almost forgot! When the cubes explode, all adjacent cubes of the same type will also explode and add up to deal more damage.": return "哦，差点忘了！方块爆炸时，相邻的同类方块也会一起爆炸，累积造成更多伤害。";
case "Don't worry, I'll explain the graphic to you. First of all, there are cubes with specific requirements, like the magic cube (hat) and the nature cube (leaf).": return "别担心，我会给你解释这张图。首先，有些方块需要满足特定条件才能使用，比如魔法方块（帽子）和自然方块（叶子）。";
case "If you align them, they will explode like any other cube, but the difference is that if you don't have mana, they won't have any effect.": return "连起来时，它们也会像普通方块一样消除。不过，如果魔力不足，就不会产生效果。";
case "Now, this restriction might seem bad, but it has a reason: these cubes are more powerful.": return "这个限制看起来可能不太好，但事出有因：这些方块威力更强。";
case "For example, the magic cube deals double damage and the nature cube allows you to recover health.": return "比如，魔法方块造成双倍伤害，自然方块则能帮你恢复生命。";
case "The chart in the middle indicates which type of damage has an advantage over another.": return "中间的图表表示不同伤害类型之间的克制关系。";
case "Both Line and the monsters have their own elements, which can be either weak or strong.": return "莱茵和怪物都有各自的属性，彼此之间可能克制，也可能被克制。";
case "To see a monster's damage affinity, you can check it in the Waifsteary.": return "想了解魔物对各种伤害的抗性，可以查看魔物娘图鉴。";
case "Line will have the affinity of the strongest element they possess, whether it's slash, pierce, impact, or magic.": return "莱茵的属性取决于目前最强的元素，可以是斩击、穿刺、冲击或魔法。";
case "These special cubes are really simple, so let's explain them.": return "这些特殊方块其实很简单，现在就来说明吧。";
case "The potion cube will restore mana. The broken heart cube reduces the enemy's damage, attack interval, and healing.": return "药水方块可以恢复法力。碎心方块会降低敌人的伤害、攻击间隔和治疗效果。";
case "To heavy to run or fly": return "太重，无法奔跑或飞行";
case "Equipment": return "装备";
