case "A wena :D.": return "好耶 :D。";
case "Wena cochino larry.": return "嘿，拉里，你这色鬼。";
case "Why is this girl taking so long?": return "这姑娘怎么去了这么久？";
case "Oh, cutie I can upgrade a block of hearts every so often on the grid in addition to doing some cut damage.": return "小可爱，我每隔一段时间，都能把棋盘上的一个爱心方块强化，另外还能造成少量斩击伤害。";
case "No but, could you tell me again how you fight?": return "不过，能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "No right now actually.": return "现在确实不行。";
case "Yes Big sis <3!": return "好的，姐姐 <3！";
case "You want a little break cutie": return "想稍微休息一下吗，小可爱？";
case "No thanks, could you tell me again how you fight?": return "不用了，谢谢。能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "Sorry big sis not rigt now.": return "对不起，大姐姐，现在不行。";
case "Yes, Big Sis.": return "好的，姐姐。";
case "Do you want me to help you in battles?": return "要我帮你战斗吗？";
case "So do your best Line <3.": return "所以，莱茵，加油哦<3。";
case "A training battle will do.": return "来场训练战就行。";
case "First of all I need to see your current status as a succubus in a more precise way.": return "首先，得更准确地了解你目前作为魅魔的实力。";
case "So how do we start?": return "那我们怎么开始？";
case "Well said! <3": return "说得好！<3";
case "I know .. I guess it will hurt my mother if I never get better as a succubus.": return "我知道……如果作为魅魔一直没进步，妈妈大概会很难过。";
case "But line, beautiful, it is your culture we gain power and energy having sex, you must start thinking about yourself.": return "可是莱茵，小美人，这就是你的种族习性啊。我们靠性爱获得力量和能量，你也该为自己着想了。";
case "And my father is a very respectable elf. What would he think of me, I don't want to hurt him?": return "而且爸爸是一位德高望重的精灵。他会怎么看我？我不想伤他的心啊。";
case "But I was always such a shy girl, that I never asked my mother to teach me.": return "可我一直特别害羞，从来没开口请妈妈教我。";
case "I ... I want to be a better succubus": return "我……我想成为更好的魅魔。";
case "hey quiet fairy, I just want to teach your friend some tricks so that she is a little more prepared for the world.": return "喂，妖精，安静点。我只是想教你的朋友几招，让她出去闯荡时，多一点准备。";
case "Hey! What's wrong? Line is a great succubus!": return "喂！怎么了？莱茵明明是个很棒的魅魔！";
case "You are a succubus but I see that you have a long way to go, your power is minimal compared to others.": return "你是个魅魔，不过还有很长的路要走。跟其他魅魔比，你的力量微不足道。";
case "Help me with what?": return "帮我什么？";
case "I made this little meeting to help you.": return "我安排这次小聚，就是想帮你。";
case "Why did you want to see me?": return "你为什么想见我？";
case "Mmm?( this woman does not give me confidence )": return "嗯？（这个女人，感觉不太可靠。）";
case "If only you knew what I was my little fairy.": return "我的小仙女，你要是知道我以前是什么样就好了。";
case "How do you know who Line is and what she is?": return "你怎么知道莱茵是谁，还知道她的身份？";
case "Oh.. thanks hehe.": return "哦……谢谢，嘿嘿。";
case "Yes, and you are a cute little half succubus you right Line.": return "没错，你是个可爱的小半魅魔，对吧，莱茵。";
case "Lili": return "莉莉";
case "E-excuse me, did you leave a message to the receptionist for me?": return "打、打扰一下，是你在前台给我留了话吗？";
case "Come on Line try again I need to know better your current state I know you can do more.": return "来，莱茵，再试一次。我得更了解你现在的状态，我知道你不止这点本事。";
case "Just give me one second.": return "稍等我一下。";
case "Mmmm... Hehe ok big Sis I will do my best <3": return "嗯……嘿嘿，好呀，大姐姐，我会努力的<3";
case "Great Line you already know something about the case more than I do find them and I'll give you a prize Tehehehe.": return "太好了，莱茵，看来你知道的案情已经比我还多。找到它们，我就给你奖励，嘻嘻嘻。";
case "I already know that story.": return "那个故事我已经听过了。";
case "A Slime Cat is apparently stealing it.": return "好像有只史莱姆猫在偷它。";
case "Well, if you want me to help Line become a better succubus, first help me recover the clothes from the restaurant.": return "好吧，既然想让我教莱茵成为更好的魅魔，就先帮我把餐厅里的衣服拿回来。";
case "The truth is that I do know but I hope you don't do it simply because it's moral 101.": return "其实我知道，不过就算只是出于最基本的道德，也希望你别这么做。";
case "It's for the greater good plus I eat well here if you know what I mean.": return "这是为了大家好嘛。而且我在这里也吃得不错，懂我的意思吧。";
case "Oh, don't get mad, I'm working so I don't always sleep in that pigsty you call a house.": return "哎，别生气嘛。我在打工，这样就不用总睡在你管它叫家的那个猪窝里。";
case "I mean, weren't you supposed to help Line become a better succubus or something?": return "你不是该帮莱茵成为更厉害的魅魔之类的吗？";
case "Big Sis, what are you doing here?": return "大姐姐，你怎么来了？";
case "Did you find the Outfits?": return "找到那些制服了吗？";
case "I will give you a prize, just come behind the counter.": return "给你个奖励，来柜台后面吧。";
case "Oh... it is ok.": return "哦……没关系。";
case "That cat is a thief and we need them for the waitresses as we are full.": return "那只猫是个小偷，我们店里都忙满了，女服务员还等着制服穿呢。";
case "Oops, you look great but I'll need them back.": return "哎呀，穿着真好看，不过这些衣服得还给我。";
case "Mmmm yeah, I took it from a slime cat, I think it looks pretty good on me.": return "嗯，是啊。从一只史莱姆猫那里拿的，我觉得还挺适合我。";
case "Wow Line those Smoosher outfits?": return "哇，莱茵，那是斯慕舍餐厅的制服？";
case "All right, come behind the counter.": return "行，来柜台后面。";
case "Big Sis found them! Wh-which ones my prize hehe?": return "大姐姐找到了！那、那我的奖励呢，嘿嘿？";
case "I do the basics, cut damage and every so often I upgrade a cut cube.": return "我会些基础招数，造成斩击伤害，偶尔还能升级一个斩击方块。";
case "No.": return "不。";
case "Yes.": return "好。";
case "You are tired alredy?": return "这就累了？";
case "Sorry, I cant right now u.u.": return "抱歉，现在不行u.u。";
case "mmm ok.": return "嗯，好吧。";
case "Hey I am bored Wanna do something?": return "喂，我好无聊，要不要一起做点什么？";
case "Is that you Line? c'mon in": return "是莱茵吗？进来吧。";
case "Moo": return "哞";
case "I recommend you to improve your life so you don't die with one of my attacks.": return "建议你先提升生命值，免得挨我一下就死。";
case "My way of fighting is normal, I do a lot of magic damage but big of the damage I do to the enemy you get it too, sadly I'm not good at team fighting.": return "我的战斗方式挺普通，魔法伤害很高，可我对敌人造成的伤害，有很大一部分你也得挨。可惜，我不太擅长团队作战。";
case "No thanks.": return "不用了，谢谢。";
case "Yes I need to do something by my own sorry :c": return "是，我得自己去办点事，对不起:c";
case "You look tired, do you want to rest?": return "你看着很累，要休息吗？";
case "I recommend you to improve your life and nature so that I am the one doing the damage while you concentrate on surviving my attacks and those of the enemies.": return "建议你提升生命值和自然属性。这样我来负责输出，你就专心扛住我和敌人的攻击。";
case "My way of fighting is normal, I do a lot of magic damage but half of the damage I do to the enemy you get it too, I'm not good at team fighting.": return "我的战斗方式很普通，能造成大量魔法伤害，但我对敌人造成的伤害，你也会承受一半。我不擅长团队作战。";
case "Not really hehe but thanks.": return "也不是啦，嘿嘿，不过谢谢。";
case "Can you help me in my adventure <3?.": return "能帮我一起冒险吗<3？";
case "Thanks for the help, you need something?": return "谢谢帮忙，有什么需要的吗？";
case "That depends on them and their resistance.": return "那要看他们自己，还有他们的抵抗能力。";
case ".... Mhmm Sir? please don't kill anyone.": return "……嗯，先生？请别杀人。";
case "Ohh you are so kind and thoughtful <3 hehe.": return "哦，你真温柔，又体贴<3嘿嘿。";
case "I told your fairy that I would get money.": return "我跟你的妖精说过，会去搞点钱。";
case "Mr. Vasera, what are you doing here?": return "瓦瑟拉先生，你怎么在这里？";
case "If you want to go with me to look for him, I won't stop you, but I won't defend you either, you should take care of yourselves.": return "想跟我去找它，我不会拦着，但也不会保护你们。你们得照顾好自己。";
case "How thoughtful. <3": return "真贴心<3。";
case "The truth is I am already looking for it, I just told them to be careful.": return "其实我已经在找了，只是提醒她们小心一点。";
case "Hey wait we could help you look for it so you can absorb it again and get your full strength.": return "哎，等等，我们可以帮你找啊！找到后再吸收回去，不就能恢复全部力量了吗？";
case "Oh this is not good.": return "哦，这可不妙。";
case "Somehow got consciousness and I don't know what it is capable of but if it has a part of my strength it is better to prepare yourself.": return "它不知道怎么有了自我意识，我也不知道它会干什么。不过它有我的一部分力量，最好做好准备。";
case "Mmm there is something wrong with this godless dimension the clones I previously used on you, they all came back to me and I absorbed them except for one.": return "嗯，这个没有神明的次元，出了点问题。之前在你身上用过的分身，都回来被我吸收了，唯独少了一个。";
case "What wh-why!": return "什么，为、为什么！";
case "Line I must inform you that if you see me again you must kill me if you get the chance.": return "莱茵，我得告诉你。如果再看见一个我，有机会就一定要杀掉。";
case "si quieren acompañarme a buscarlo no las detendre pero tampoco las defendere deben cuidarse por utedes misma": return "想跟我去找它，我不会拦着，但也不会保护你们。你们得照顾好自己。";
case "Que considerado <3": return "真体贴<3";
case "yo ya lo estoy buscando la verdad solo les dije que tengan cuidado": return "其实我已经在找了，只是提醒她们小心一点。";
case "oye espera no puede ayudarno a buscarlo asi lo vuelves a absorver y consigues toda tu fuerza": return "喂，等等，我们可以帮你找回来，让你重新吸收，恢复全部力量啊。";
case "pe-pe pero.": return "可、可是。";
case "de alguna forma consiguio consencia y nose de que es capaz pero si tiene una parte de mi fuerza mejor es que te preparez.": return "它不知道怎么有了自主意识，我也不清楚它能做到什么。不过，只要有我的一部分力量，就最好提前做好准备。";
case "Mmm hay algo malo en esta dimension sin dioses los clones que anteriormente use contigo todos volvieron a mi y los absorvi excepto uno.": return "嗯，这个没有神明的次元，出了点问题。之前在你身上用过的分身，都回来被我吸收了，唯独少了一个。";
case "Que porque!": return "为什么啊！";
case "Line debo informarte que si me ves denuevo debes matarme si esque tienes la oportunidad.": return "莱茵，我得告诉你，如果再见到我，只要有机会，你就必须杀了我。";
case "Please... Help me, I need those crystals to go back home.": return "求求你……帮帮我，我需要那些水晶才能回家。";
case "Well I do moderate piercing damage and upgrade a piercing cube on the grid every so often.": return "我能造成中等穿刺伤害，还会每隔一段时间强化棋盘上的一个穿刺方块。";
case "I still want you to accompany me.": return "我还是想让你陪着我。";
case "Yes please, I have other things to do.": return "好的，拜托了，我还有别的事。";
case "Do you want me to stay here for a while?": return "要我在这里待一会儿吗？";
case "Sorry, I have other things to do.": return "抱歉，我还有别的事。";
case "join me vasuki <3.": return "和我一起吧，瓦苏基<3。";
case "Oh you need something?": return "哦，你需要什么？";
case "The quest will be available in later updates.": return "这个任务会在后续更新中开放。";
case "Great ... I ran out of cigarettes.": return "太好了……我的烟抽完了。";
case "Here, it's 100 Arcs just... dont blow it.": return "给，100阿克……别搞砸了就行。";
case "Of course there is no problem, count on me.": return "当然没问题，包在我身上。";
case "If you can bring some premium cigarettes, you would do me a favor, since this is my last day on the island.": return "能帮我带点高级香烟来吗？毕竟今天是我留在岛上的最后一天了。";
case "This day has been terrible, my personal onahole is sick and I also ran out of cigarettes.": return "今天真糟，我的专属肉便器病了，香烟也抽光了。";
case "Wh-what?": return "什、什么？";
case "Hey wait.": return "喂，等等。";
case "But its ok, im leaving.": return "不过没事，我要走了。";
case "Oh so-sorry I am good helping people.": return "哦，对、对不起，我很擅长帮助别人。";
case "What do you care.": return "关你什么事。";
case "So-so something happend?": return "所、所以，发生什么事了吗？";
case "hurry up i'm running out of patience.": return "快点，我快没耐心了。";
case "To the ground now!": return "立刻趴下！";
case "What?!": return "什么？！";
case "Hey, what I'm saying we'll do right here, right now.": return "喂，我说的事，就在这里，马上做。";
case "Oh its ok.": return "哦，没关系。";
case "Oh, haha I like the idea but I don't have much time left I have to leave now.": return "哦，哈哈，这主意不错，不过我没时间了，必须走了。";
case "I could b-be your onahole fo-for wasting your time.": return "因、因为耽误了你的时间，我可、可以给你当肉便器。";
case "In what way?": return "怎么个说法？";
case "Wh-wait im very sorry maybe i ca-can help in another way.": return "等、等等，真对不起，也许我能用别、别的方法帮忙。";
case "Damn this is all a waste of time, thanks for nothing.": return "妈的，纯粹浪费时间，真是白谢你了。";
case "I regret to inform you that the cigarettes you are looking for do not exist on the island :c.": return "很遗憾地告诉你，岛上没有你要找的香烟:c。";
case "Please don't bring me bad news.": return "拜托，别给我带来坏消息。";
case "Umm kristoff.": return "呃，克里斯托夫。";
case "What are you looking at!": return "看什么看！";
case "What are you looking at!?": return "看什么看！？";
case "Well lady have a good day.": return "那女士，祝你今天愉快。";
case "*Kamiko grabs Line tightly and kisses her for a long minute*": return "*神子紧紧抱住莱茵，足足吻了她一分钟*";
case "Oh ok. (at least it's something)": return "哦，好吧。（至少聊胜于无。）";
case "But the kiss will be a french kiss.": return "不过，得法式湿吻。";
case "Oh ok great. (I thought, she would think of something better :/ )": return "哦，好，挺好。（我还以为，她会想出点更好的东西:/。）";
case "Hmmm, Aren't you the cutest thing?, just a kiss from you would be enough.": return "嗯，你怎么这么可爱？给我一个吻就够了。";
case "isn't there some other way to pay it? *wink wink*": return "就没有别的付款方式吗？*眨眼，眨眼*";
case "You don't have enough arcs, get out of here and let people with money pass.": return "阿克不够，滚开，让有钱人过去。";
case "Excellent lady, have a nice day <3.": return "太好了，女士，祝你今天愉快<3。";
case "Do you really think you idiots can catch me? Haha, I have done this all over Elira. I'll just have to shut you up.": return "你们这群白痴，真觉得抓得住我？哈哈，整个艾莉拉我都这么干过。看来只能让你们闭嘴了。";
case "I told you Line, let's capture her maybe the guards give us money.": return "莱茵，我就说吧，把她抓起来，说不定守卫会给我们赏钱。";
case "Stop ... Haha looks like you're not the smart one on the team Line.": return "等等……哈哈，看来莱茵不是你们队里负责动脑子的那个啊。";
case "No Line! I will bring the great captain, she is the criminal they are looking for.": return "不，莱茵！我去找大队长，她就是通缉的那个罪犯。";
case "O-oh ok i will pay.": return "哦、哦，好，我会付钱。";
case "Look... I hate taking people there, we can make a deal, if you give me the rate plus the fine and 200 arcs to keep our little secret, I'll let you go.": return "听着……我讨厌送人去那里，不过可以做笔交易。付清路费、罚款，再加200阿克，替我们保守这个小秘密，我就放你过去。";
case "Lili! Do you see what you have done!": return "莉莉！看看你干的好事！";
case "It's over now, I'll have to take you to the jail-farm, for repeated harassment to Elira's authority.": return "到此为止。你一再妨碍艾莉拉执法，我必须把你带到监狱农场。";
case "Line don't be so naive, she has only a glove and a shoulder pad from the outfit of a guard.": return "莱茵，别那么天真。她不过是戴了只卫兵手套和一块护肩。";
case "Whaaat!?": return "什——么！？";
case "The truth is that it is too late, I will have to fine you with 100 arcs for lack of respect for authority.": return "说实话，已经太迟了。藐视执法，罚款100阿克。";
case "LiLi do not offend the guard.": return "莉莉，别冒犯卫兵。";
case "What? Ha ha? just look at my guard outfit you must be mistaking me with someone else.": return "什么？哈哈？看看我的卫兵制服，你肯定认错人了。";
case "Exit": return "离开";
case "Bribe her with something. (Lili's idea)": return "拿点东西贿赂她。（莉莉的主意。）";
case "Pay the fare. (500 Arcs)": return "付通行费。（500阿克币。）";
case "This is the bitch from the wanted poster! (Lili say)": return "她就是通缉令上的那个婊子！（莉莉说。）";
case "Line": return "莱茵";
case "Due to the high use of the bridge, it started to require maintenance, so I'm here to collect the toll.": return "这座桥往来的人太多，开始需要维护了，所以我在这里收过路费。";
case "I'm not very good at fighting is not my style but I do what I can since I'm half wyvern I use poison, it's not very powerful but I cut their healing by 50% and I strike a punch or two even though I'm not very strong.": return "我不擅长打架，这不是我的强项。不过，作为半翼龙，我会尽力用毒。毒性不强，但能让敌人的治疗效果降低50%，再打上几拳，虽然我力气也不大。";
case "No, could you tell me again how you fight?": return "不用，能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "You wanna quit for the day?": return "今天就到这里吗？";
case "Sorry, I cant right now.": return "对不起，现在不行。";
case "Of course <3.": return "当然 <3。";
case "Ready to make some mess?": return "准备大闹一场了吗？";
case "Come back when you have Arcs.": return "有阿克了再来。";
case "There you have it, you little rascal.": return "给你，小淘气。";
case "Not now.": return "现在不行。";
case "Ok": return "好";
case "Unfortunately I can't find him, I'll sell it to you for a thousand Arcs if you want it so badly.": return "可惜找不到他。既然你这么想要，就一千阿克卖给你好了。";
case "You want to buy the briefcase I have? I was thinking of blackmailing the guy who lost it.": return "想买我手里的公文包？我本来打算拿它敲丢包的人一笔。";
case "And don't even think of taking a single Arc out of here, don't you see that why we have worked so hard, so that I can sleep like my ancestors. Yep Surrounded by money.": return "别想从这里拿走哪怕一个阿克。我们辛辛苦苦这么久，就是为了让我像祖先一样睡觉，懂吗？没错，睡在钱堆里。";
case "Hey Line you figured out where I keep all my Arcs.": return "嘿，莱茵，你猜到我把阿克全藏在哪儿了吗？";
case "Umm eh em. h-hi.": return "嗯，呃，那个。你、你好。";
case "Theres nothing to explain, you blew up those girls!": return "还解释什么，你把那些姑娘炸飞了！";
case "Please let me explain.": return "请听我解释。";
case "Well the truth is that I don't like to fight, but I can support you by recovering 10% of your life from time to time.": return "其实我不喜欢打架，不过能帮忙，时不时给你恢复10%的生命。";
case "No never.": return "不，绝不。";
case "you want to rest?": return "要休息吗？";
case "Actually yes,could you tell me again how you fight?": return "其实要的。能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "This Quest is only for patreons.": return "此任务仅向Patreon支持者开放。";
case "Remember, if you find her, bring her with me in the sencond Floor of the hotel even if she doesn't want to.": return "记住，找到她后，把她带到旅馆二楼来见我，就算她不愿意也一样。";
case "How annoying you are!.": return "你可真烦！";
case "Oh you still have the strength to fight? I guess it will be a second round.": return "哦，还有力气打？那就再来一轮吧。";
case "Yes, yes I understand you, sorry for wasting your time :c.": return "嗯嗯，我明白。对不起，耽误你时间了:c。";
case "Thanks Line but I'm looking for an adventurer a little more mmmm.... recognizable one that wherever he goes, people will recognize him, you know what I mean right?": return "谢谢，莱茵，不过我在找那种……嗯……更有名的冒险者，走到哪儿都有人认识的那种，明白我的意思吧？";
case "Oh well, I don't know, but still, if you need help, uh a-here I am.": return "哦，那个，我不知道，不过你要是需要帮忙，我、我就在这儿。";
case "Really? I don't see you being the adventurous type.": return "真的？你看着可不像爱冒险的人。";
case "Oh.. ehmm h-hi i am Line I am adventurer": return "哦……呃，你、你好，我叫莱茵，是个冒险者。";
case "Uff this novel will practically write itself.": return "呼，这小说简直能自己写出来。";
case "I am also half succubus :v.": return "还有一半魅魔血统:v。";
case "OHh, an orthodox elf who discovers her sexuality, Line your life is gold.": return "哦，一个发现自身性欲的传统派精灵！莱茵，你的人生，简直是金矿。";
case "Hey, hey hey  she is not a whore she is just exploring her sexuality.": return "喂，喂喂！她又不是婊子，只是在探索自己的性取向。";
case "Wow Line you are such a whore you must have a million stories please let me join you on your journey.": return "哇，莱茵，你可真骚，肯定有一百万个故事！求你让我加入旅程吧。";
case "Lili! ( Please someone kill me )": return "莉莉！（谁来杀了我吧。）";
case "HAHAHA because they don't have it, she defeated the demon by taking her energy by giving her a rimjob.": return "哈哈哈，因为她们没有那玩意儿。她是给那恶魔舔肛、吸走精力，才把对方打败的。";
case "Wow I had no idea that elves could summon sacred fires.": return "哇，我都不知道精灵还能召唤圣火。";
case "Well you know... fire ehh sacred ... of elf (Iam a terrible liar :C).": return "那个，你懂的……火，呃，神圣的……精灵的火。（我可真不会撒谎:C。）";
case "OHHH and what is this super attack?!": return "哦——这又是什么超级攻击？！";
case "OHh. that, I ahemm. We fought an epic battle where I was on the verge of losing but luckily I channeled all my strength into one last attack and BAM I knocked her down and she fell unconscious.": return "哦，那个，我，咳咳。我们打了一场史诗级的大战，我都快输了，幸好把全部力量灌进最后一击，砰！一下把她打倒，昏了过去。";
case "How did you defeat the white demon in the forest? The whole town is talking about you winning her but nobody knows exactly how?": return "你是怎么打败森林里的白色恶魔的？整个镇子都在议论，你赢了她，可没人知道究竟是怎么赢的。";
case "OHh hu-hu-hu wha-what kind of experiences do you need.": return "哦，呵、呵呵，你、你需要什么样的经历？";
case "PLEASE let me join you on your journey my novel depends on you I need all the experience you can give me.": return "求求你，让我跟你一起冒险！我的小说就指望你了，你能给我的经历，我全都需要。";
case "Ehh yes I am she hehe.": return "呃，对，就是我，嘿嘿。";
case "Hey, are you the traveler who defeated the demon that stole the alcohol supplies?!": return "嘿，你就是打败了那个偷酒恶魔的旅行者？！";
case "Well I do moderate magic damage and upgrade a magic cube on the grid every so often.": return "我能造成中等魔法伤害，偶尔还能升级棋盘上的一个魔法方块。";
case "Yes I need to do something by my own sorry. :c": return "是，我得自己去办点事，对不起。:c";
case "You want to rest?": return "想休息一下吗？";
case "Can you help me in my adventure. <3?.": return "能帮我一起冒险吗<3？";
case "Oh hehe thanks <3.": return "哦，嘿嘿，谢谢<3。";
case "The world is a better place with you in it, whether you like it or not.": return "不管你愿不愿意承认，有你在，这个世界就更美好了。";
case "Really? well that would help me a lot and don't worry it's the first time I've seen a fairy like that haha.\nWell, if you find it, please do not view its content, it is classified from my work.": return "真的？那可帮大忙了。别担心，我也是第一次见到这样的妖精，哈哈。\n不过，找到后请别查看里面的东西，那是我的工作机密。";
case "Lili! \n Oh I am so-sorry she is a bit aggressive but she has a good heart if you want we can help you look for your briefcase.": return "莉莉！\n哦，对、对不起。她有点凶，但心地很好。你愿意的话，我们可以帮你找公文包。";
case "Ya great but I didn't ask you about your life": return "行，真棒，可我没问你的人生故事。";
case "Sorry I had a horrible day I lost my briefcase and I had a lot of important information in it now I have to start from scratch.": return "抱歉，今天糟透了。我把公文包弄丢了，里面有好多重要资料，现在一切都得从头来。";
case "Lili do not say it like that!": return "莉莉！别那样说！";
case "Hey shut up, you're in a library.": return "喂，安静点，这儿是图书馆。";
case "AHh I'll have to start all over again.\nWhere can my briefcase be?": return "啊，我得从头再来了。\n我的公文包到底在哪儿？";
case "Did you find my briefcase?": return "找到我的公文包了吗？";
case "My briefcase should be here somewhere": return "我的公文包应该就在这附近。";
case "Well I do moderate Impact damage to the enemy and between each fight I can try to win more Arcs.": return "我能对敌人造成中等打击伤害，还能在每场战斗之间试着多赚点阿克。";
case "Actually could you tell me again how you fight?": return "能再跟我说说，你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "No now.": return "现在不行。";
case "Yes please I am a little tired.": return "是的，麻烦了，我有点累。";
case "Are we done for the day?": return "今天就到这里吗？";
case "In a fight I do moderate impact damage plus I can make the enemy give us double the Arcs for the trouble he gave us..": return "战斗时，我能造成中等冲击伤害，还能让敌人为惹出来的麻烦付出双倍阿克币。";
case "Do you need something line?": return "莱茵，你需要什么？";
case "But once they atone for their sins they will be returned to them is the law of the island.": return "不过等他们赎清罪孽，就会归还。这是岛上的法律。";
case "Oh no, hahaha that would be crazy. I just steal their eyes and place them on my body.": return "哦，不不不，哈哈哈，那也太疯狂了。我只是偷走他们的眼睛，再装到自己身上。";
case "And how are you supposed to do your justice, you don't kill them... right?": return "你打算怎么伸张正义？不会杀掉他们……对吧？";
case "As I pray I can hear the prayers of women in trouble and bring justice.": return "祈祷时，我能听见遇难女子的祈求，然后前去伸张正义。";
case "I am Ragnuda the dodomeki and I judge men who cheat on their wives.": return "我是百目鬼拉格努妲，专门审判背着妻子偷腥的男人。";
case "Oh I am sorry it's just weird to see someone here at night... and naked. :v": return "哦，不好意思。只是晚上在这里遇到别人，还是光着的……有点奇怪。:v";
case "You interrupted my prayers.": return "你打断了我的祈祷。";
case "What a brave boy ;c": return "真勇敢的孩子;c";
case "MOooOOOo!": return "哞——！";
case "Line Look": return "莱茵，看呀";
case "A somewhat ironic ending I guess Hahaha.": return "这结局，还真有点讽刺啊，哈哈哈。";
case "Shale vale :v.": return "哎呀，好吧 :v。";
case "I was told that I can earn some money by selling my own 'milk'.": return "听说卖自己的“奶”，就能赚点钱。";
case "And now I have no money to go back home ;c.": return "现在，我连回家的钱都没有了;c。";
case "Well... I came on vacation to this island but I spent my money driking milk.": return "嗯……我是来岛上度假的，结果喝牛奶把钱花光了。";
case "What happened to you?": return "你怎么了？";
case "Ah I really don't want to do this.": return "唉，我真的不想这么做。";
case "Oh he doesn't have a cow outfit.": return "哦，他没有奶牛装。";
case "Haha its ok take care.": return "哈哈，没事，保重。";
case "Oh, yeah sorry it will have to be for another day :c.": return "哦，嗯，对不起，只能改天了:c。";
case "Line! focus on your objective, we are looking for your friend.": return "莱茵！专心点，我们是来找你朋友的。";
case "Oh I am not really a drinking person hehe but if you want I can.... join you you know.": return "哦，我平时不怎么喝酒，嘿嘿。不过你愿意的话，我可以……陪你，你懂的。";
case "Hi, sweetie, would you like to join me for a drink?": return "嗨，宝贝，要陪我喝一杯吗？";
case "make me bitch": return "来呀，臭婊子";
case "Get the hell out of my territory you thot": return "滚出老娘的地盘，贱货。";
case "It may already be time to get back to work, I miss announcing the news.": return "也该回去工作了，真想念播报新闻的日子。";
case "I wouldn't miss it for anything in the world.": return "说什么我都不会错过。";
case "Mmm.. hi there will be a mini show at the circus I would appreciate it if you could go.": return "嗯……你好，马戏团要办个小演出，能来捧场就太好了。";
case "*blushed* th-thank you it is a relief that you liked it.": return "*脸红*谢、谢谢，你能喜欢，我就放心了。";
case "That was a great show.": return "真是场精彩的演出。";
case "Sorry (but I didn't do anything :c).": return "对不起。（可我明明什么都没干:c。）";
case "She is very sorry, say sorry *covers Line's mouth*": return "她非常抱歉，快道歉。*捂住莱茵的嘴*";
case "Oh, well if you wan..": return "哦，要是你想……";
case "Excuse me? that no way of speaking if I were your mother I would punish you.": return "什么？怎么能这样说话！我要是你妈妈，非罚你不可。";
case "Shit! Line look at that ass.": return "操！莱茵，快看那个屁股。";
case "Finally I finished cleaning this floor, Mr.Cabello will be happy <3.": return "这层楼终于打扫完了，卡贝洛先生会高兴的<3。";
case "Thanks Line for the help <3.": return "莱茵，谢谢你帮忙<3。";
case "MMm where to go next, what place will inspire me? to write my next hit.": return "嗯，接下来去哪儿呢？什么地方能激发灵感，让我再写出一本畅销书？";
case "But, what?...well whatever. I hope you can accomplish your mission miss but if it gets too dangerous run away please I don't want my book to be tainted by someone dying or getting lost in the woods.": return "可是，什么？……算了。希望你能完成任务，小姐。不过太危险就请逃跑，我可不想自己的书，沾上害人死掉或迷失森林的事。";
case "I will do my best I will be worthy of the sword *reverence*.": return "我会尽力，不辜负这把剑。*行礼*";
case "What are you talking about? I never said you were going to look for her, and I don't really care either, no one has taken her out so far.": return "你在说什么？我从没让你去找她。说实话，我也不在乎，反正迄今还没人把它拔出来过。";
case "Thank you very much I will not let you down and I will bring the sword.": return "太感谢了！我不会让你失望，一定会把剑带来。";
case "Well one enters the forest and must follow these directions up, down, left, left, left, right, down and finally up. But beware that even if I am not here, the spiritual energy of one of my ancestors may try to deny you passage..": return "进入森林后，按这个方向走：上、下、左、左、左、右、下，最后再向上。不过小心，即使我不在，我某位先祖的灵力也可能阻挡你。";
case "And how I got there!": return "那我又是怎么进去的！";
case "Yes, but there came a time when I really understood that she didn't need me to take care of her, she was quite lost in the forest and to get her out you have to have the requirements I wrote down, even so I don't understand how that helps to get the sword out.": return "是，不过后来我终于明白，她根本不需要我照顾。她迷失在森林深处，想把她取出来，就必须满足我写下的条件。即便如此，我还是不懂，这些跟拔剑有什么关系。";
case "What the heck?!": return "搞什么鬼？！";
case "Oh relax you will be surprised to know that it is true my family was the one who took care of the sword although we never managed to get it off the anvil.": return "哦，别紧张。说来你可能不信，那是真的，我们家族一直守护着那把剑，只是始终没能把它从铁砧上拔出来。";
case "Uh sorry sir my friend fell out of the crib when she was a baby we won't bother you anymore eh hehe ehh..": return "呃，抱歉，先生，我朋友小时候从婴儿床里摔过。我们不打扰了，嘿嘿，呃……";
case "YES! You know that when I read your story I did not feel that the sword is true and I can feel it on the island.": return "没错！读你的故事时，我还不觉得那把剑真的存在，可现在，我能感觉到它就在岛上。";
case "Mmmm yes I am surprised to find fans here, was it because of the back cover?": return "嗯，在这里碰见粉丝，真是意外。是看了封底才来的吗？";
case "Hello sir, are you by any chance the author of The Pelletclad Blade?": return "你好，先生，请问你是《弹丸之刃》的作者吗？";
case "You say that because of the sheets in his hand...I guess it's worth a try.": return "就因为他手里拿着那些纸，你就这么说……？算了，试试也无妨。";
case "Looks like a writer?": return "他看着像作家吗？";
case "Ehh it must be because of the years it was stored out in the open hehe.": return "呃，应该是因为在露天放了太多年吧，嘿嘿。";
case "What, you managed to get the sword I'm glad it has a new owner but why does it smell so strange?": return "什么，你找到剑了？真高兴它有了新主人，不过为什么闻着这么奇怪？";
case "Hey do you want something really chingon?.": return "嘿，想要点真正牛逼的东西吗？";
case "Oh give me a second I'm getting my suit ready.": return "哦，等一下，我在准备兽装。";
case "Mmmhe MMMhe I understand I will have it ready when I bring the 5000 arcs leave it all to me.": return "嗯哼，嗯哼，我明白了。带来5000阿克币时，我就会准备好，放心交给我。";
case "Mmmm ok but I want this for my furrsuit *whispering* shp shp shp shapa shapa shapa.": return "嗯……行，不过我的兽装要这样……*低声耳语*嘘嘘嘘，沙巴沙巴沙巴。";
case "I know it's expensive but understand that the suit is custom made with all the specifications you want.": return "我知道很贵，可这套衣服是量身订做的，你想要什么细节都能做。";
case "Great it's only 5000 Arcs": return "太好了，只要5000阿克币。";
case "You've already convinced me how much it costs!": return "你已经把我说服了，多少钱！";
case "I'm not going to lie to you, it's expensive, but if it's any incentive Miss Marael says that sex in a furrisuit is quite an experience.": return "不瞒你说，是挺贵的。不过说点能让你心动的：玛拉艾尔女士说，穿兽装做爱可是别有一番滋味。";
case "Now I want to be a furry!": return "我现在也想当兽人控了！";
case "Yes haha she was part of the furry community before deciding to live life as a goat woman.": return "是啊，哈哈。在决定作为羊女生活之前，她也是兽圈的一员。";
case "Really?!": return "真的？！";
case "Oh you talk about Miss Marael what a nice woman she was my first time.": return "哦，你说的是玛拉艾尔女士啊。多好的女人，我的第一次就是给她的。";
case "Mmm... I am half succubus and I cannot even transform myself to the taste of others, I met a succubus who decided to live life as a black goat woman, I would really like to change my form and know how it would be like to be a real succubus.": return "嗯……我明明有一半魅魔血统，却连按别人的喜好变身都做不到。我认识一个魅魔，选择用黑山羊娘的样子生活。我也很想改变形态，体验一下真正的魅魔是什么感觉。";
case "Not all of us are lucky enough to be born as one or transform ourselves but with these costumes we have the opportunity to live life from a different perspective.": return "并不是每个人，都有幸天生如此，或能变身。但有了这些兽装，我们也能从另一个角度体验生活。";
case "Well, it all depends on whether you admire atropomorphic animals like wolves.": return "嗯，得看你喜不喜欢狼这一类拟人动物。";
case "Mmm I do not know what's in it for me?": return "嗯，不知道，我有什么好处？";
case "I don't know Line looks like a weirdo.": return "不知道，莱茵，他看着像个怪人。";
case "Would you like to be part of our community?": return "你愿意加入我们的圈子吗？";
case "OH how cute I love your fluffy little ears <3.": return "哦，好可爱！你毛茸茸的小耳朵，我太喜欢了<3。";
case "Indeed, I am an honorable member of the furry community.": return "没错，我是兽圈的光荣一员。";
case "... H-hi e- that's a costume?": return "……你、你好，呃，那是套扮装服？";
case "Ohmm HI I am Snugglepaws!": return "唔，你好，我叫绒绒爪！";
case "No I am still short of money :c.": return "没有，我的钱还不够:c。";
case "Did you get the money?": return "钱凑齐了吗？";
case "Thank you very much Mr. Snugglepaws.": return "非常感谢，绒绒爪先生。";
case "Let's go home Lili, I need your help!": return "莉莉，回家吧，我需要你帮忙！";
case "Ohhhh I love it I love it I love it I love it that's all I wanted <3!": return "哦——好喜欢，好喜欢，好喜欢，好喜欢！就是我想要的<3！";
case "Here it is, your furrsuit of rabbit woman with movable mouth, automatic blinking, with soft light blue magenta hair!": return "给，你的兔女兽装！嘴能动，还会自动眨眼，毛发是柔软的浅蓝色和品红色！";
case "Oh it's okay I'll wait here <3.": return "哦，没关系，我在这里等<3。";
case "Yes, everything is here. (pay 5000 Arcs)": return "是，都在这里。（支付5000阿克币。）";
case "Not yet.": return "还没有。";
case "Thank you very much but I am no longer Line now call me Bluebell.": return "非常感谢，不过我已经不叫莱茵了，现在请叫我蓝铃。";
case "Go Line I know what you want to do.": return "去吧，莱茵，我知道你想做什么。";
case "... good, thank you.": return "……好，谢谢。";
case "Oh Bluebell did you like the suit?": return "哦，蓝铃，喜欢这套兽装吗？";
case "Oh hehe we really have a very similar voice, masturbating thinking about my own voice will be something very strange hehe although something exciting.": return "哦，嘿嘿，我们的声音真的很像。想着自己的声音自慰，还挺奇怪的，嘿嘿，不过也有点刺激。";
case "Wow you sound a lot like me, haha ,well I have a fura fura fruit if you want to eat one.": return "哇，你说话跟我真像，哈哈。我有颗芙拉芙拉果，想吃一颗吗？";
case "No, no, no, no, I-I want to hehe sorry for overthinking it.": return "不不不，我、我愿意。嘿嘿，对不起，想太多了。";
case "If you don't want to, it's okay, lady.": return "你要是不愿意，也没关系，女士。";
case "Oh Mmmm (exactly, pretend to think so they don't find out you're desperate).": return "哦，嗯……（没错，装作在考虑，别让人看出自己已经急不可耐。）";
case "Hello Miss, by any chance do you want to use my hole?": return "你好，小姐，要不要用用我的洞？";
case "Only the family may enter this sanctuary.": return "只有家族成员能进入这座圣所。";
case "Come on Run! I bet 1000 Arcs on you Hu HU HU HU HUghg!.": return "快跑啊！我可在你身上押了1000阿克，呼哈哈哈哈！";
case "I'll do it sir, don't worry. Line now you've gone too far give it some space.": return "先生，我来吧，别担心。莱茵，这次你过分了，给她留点余地。";
case "Please someone get this girl out of my vital space.": return "谁来把这姑娘从我的私人空间里弄出去，拜托。";
case "OH! *approaches at too uncomfortable a distance* thank you thank you thank you very much sir I will use your wisdom with care.": return "哦！*凑近到让人非常不适的距离*谢谢，谢谢，太感谢了，先生！我会谨慎运用你的智慧。";
case "Eheee... I guess every time I'm going to do something that involves force I pound my chest for some reason it makes me feel stronger.": return "呃……每次要做使力气的事，我好像都会捶胸，也不知道为什么，就是会觉得更有劲。";
case "Can you tell me how to get the strength of a gorilla please please pleaseeeeee?": return "能教我怎么获得大猩猩的力量吗？拜托拜托，求求你啦？";
case "... The last time I checked, I was indeed.": return "……至少上次确认的时候，确实是。";
case "Ho hello are you a gorilla?": return "你、你好，你是大猩猩吗？";
case "No no no we are just travelers looking for our friend ;c.": return "不不不，我们只是来找朋友的旅人;c。";
case "Oh I *hip* see, you are allies of the empire trying to erase part of history.": return "哦，我*嗝*懂了，你们是帝国的同伙，想抹掉那段历史。";
case "hey miss hero we're a little busy it was good your story and all, but we have to keep moving.": return "喂，女英雄小姐，我们正忙着呢。你的故事挺精彩，不过我们得走了。";
case "doesn't matter! you should know this world is forgetting *hip*roes and I'll make them remember.": return "不重要！这世界正在遗忘英*嗝*雄，我会让他们想起来。";
case "Mmm ... n-no, i didn't know i'm half elf half succubus actually.": return "嗯……不、不是，其实我是半精灵、半魅魔。";
case "Thats nice really nice you *hip* know my father protect all the humanity and they dont even know *hip*t.": return "真好，真好啊。你*嗝*知道吗，我父亲保护着全人类，可他们根本不知道*嗝*。";
case "Eh, I'm not the bartender but if you want I'll call her.": return "呃，我不是调酒师，不过可以帮你叫她。";
case "Hey, yo skinny girl do something good and bring me some beer *hip*.": return "喂，那个瘦姑娘，做点好事，给我拿杯啤酒来。*嗝*";
case "You know what, I'm not going to go kill the demon that steals the beer shipments. it's my freaking vacation!": return "知道吗？偷啤酒货物的恶魔，我才不去杀。这可是老子的假期！";
case "AHHGG! I came to relax on the only island that has no alcohol.": return "啊——！我来放松一下，结果偏偏挑了唯一没酒的岛。";
case "Line ... let's get out of here.": return "莱茵……我们走吧。";
case "Oh don't worry i have being in this place before. i will repair it and problem solve.": return "哦，别担心，以前来过这里。我修好它，问题就解决了。";
case "I-it's not funny, you broke the table with the fight": return "这、这不好笑，你们打架把桌子弄坏了。";
case "And I think with this fight the effect of the beer were off Hahaha.": return "打完这场架，我感觉酒都醒了，哈哈哈。";
case "You fight very well, I don't think you're with the weaklings of the empire.": return "你很能打嘛，看来不是帝国那群窝囊废一伙的。";
case "I will repair it after a few drinks haha.": return "喝上几杯，我就去修，哈哈。";
case "it doesn't matter break his ass Line!": return "不管了！莱茵，揍烂他的屁股！";
case "Woomy!": return "呜咪！";
case "So you are the prankster!": return "原来你就是那个捣蛋鬼！";
case "Ngyes!": return "嗯耶！";
case "I need you to come with me because of you an innocent woman will go to jail!": return "你得跟我走！因为你，一个无辜的女人就要坐牢了！";
case "Woomy Woomy!": return "呜咪，呜咪！";
case "I guess as long as she doesn't make any more trouble it's okay for her to stay here.": return "只要她不再惹事，留在这里，应该也没关系。";
case "I guess when he fled he found this cave.": return "我猜，他逃跑的时候发现了这个洞窟。";
case "Why is it here anyway?": return "话说，它为什么会在这里？";
case "Oh... could happen to anyone.": return "哦……谁都有可能遇上。";
case "I also remember when you beat him, he attacked you and you fainted and pissed yourself, what a day.": return "我也记得那次你赢了他，然后他反击，你直接晕倒，还尿了裤子。真是难忘的一天。";
case "Look Lili is the cat that almost put Callie in jail, well, she end up in jail anyways but you know.": return "看啊，莉莉，就是那只差点害卡莉坐牢的猫。好吧，卡莉后来还是坐牢了，不过你懂我的意思。";
case "RAWR!": return "嗷！";
case "I hope Whipsie is doing well on Tricotex.": return "希望薇普茜在特里科特克斯过得好。";
case "This farm reminds me of home.": return "这个农场，让我想起了家。";
case "Take it for granted me and Line can against everything!": return "放心吧，我和莱茵联手，什么都能摆平！";
case "I guess a little help wouldn't hurt, but I'll have to see if they are both up to the task to be my partner.": return "有人搭把手也好，不过得先看看，你们两个够不够格做我的搭档。";
case "Sorry sam for her lack of delicacy, she a big fan of you.. and so am I, but I mean who doesn't hehe.": return "萨姆，抱歉，她说话太冒失了，她是你的超级粉丝……我也是。不过，谁又不是呢，嘿嘿。";
case "Wow really can we help to capture it ?!": return "哇，真的？我们能帮忙抓它吗？！";
case "For now she is the one who takes care of the city, I come to this island because a Tricotex criminal came here.": return "现在由她守护城市。我来这座岛，是因为有个特里科特克斯的罪犯逃到这里了。";
case "Yeah and where is your partner Whipsy :c?": return "是啊，你的搭档薇普西呢:c？";
case "Oh well, actually we are not from here, but we knew your stories of how you saved the streets of Tricotex while we travel.": return "哦，其实我们不是本地人，不过旅行时，听说过你拯救特里科特克斯街区的故事。";
case "Wow, I didn't think anyone would recognize me around here.": return "哇，没想到在这里会被认出来。";
case "H-hi you are Sa-Sam the hero o-of the Tricotex right :O?": return "你、你好，你是萨、萨姆，特、特里科特克斯的英雄，对吧:O？";
case "You come for the rematch?": return "来复仇了？";
case "Haha it's very simple, I do a lot of impact damage.": return "哈哈，很简单，我能造成大量冲击伤害。";
case "I still want to accompany you.": return "我还是想陪着你。";
case "sorry same I have other things to do.": return "对不起，萨姆，我还有别的事。";
case "If you don't have time to catch the criminal, we can part ways for a while.": return "你要是没空追捕罪犯，我们可以暂时分开一阵。";
case "No sorry, could you tell me again how you fight?": return "不了，抱歉。能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "Sorry same I have other things to do.": return "对不起，萨姆，我还有别的事。";
case "Let's catch that criminal <3.": return "去抓那个罪犯吧<3。";
case "Now you have time to help me catch the criminal?": return "现在有空帮我抓罪犯了吗？";
case "Come back as you were!": return "变回原样！";
case "I do a lot of magic damage that's all you need to know.": return "我会造成大量魔法伤害，你知道这些就够了。";
case "I am sorry I have to go to the bathroom :c.": return "抱歉，我得去趟厕所:c。";
case "Sorry but, could you tell me again how you fight?": return "抱歉，不过能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？";
case "I really want to help you Faye.": return "我真的想帮你，菲伊。";
case "Hey, if you don't have time to help me just say it, it will be faster for me to look for myself.": return "喂，没时间帮忙就直说，我自己找还快一点。";
case "Oh ok.. lets go.": return "哦，好……走吧。";
case "I don't want to waste your time. :c": return "我不想耽误你的时间:c。";
case "If you want to help me just don't waste my time.": return "想帮忙，就别浪费我的时间。";
case "I will rest a little here.": return "我在这里歇一会儿。";
case "I think it's southeast from here.": return "我想，应该在这儿的东南方。";
case "Where is she now?": return "她现在在哪儿？";
case "Yes, I think a cow that escaped from the farm ran into the idiot that did this to me.": return "是啊，好像有头从农场跑出来的牛，撞上了把我弄成这样的那个白痴。";
case "Do you know where he went or if anyone saw him?": return "知道他去哪儿了，或者有没有人见过他？";
case "Thanks, I came to buy some milk and something covered me in this stuff.": return "谢谢，我来买牛奶，结果被什么东西弄得满身都是。";
case "Calm down, I will help you.": return "冷静，我会帮你的。";
case "Shit somebody help me get this out": return "妈的，谁来帮我把这东西弄掉。";
case "Yeah, she went to the cultivation of nana leaves": return "嗯，她去种娜娜叶的地方了。";
case "Thanks, I came from buying some special milk and something covered me with this thing.": return "谢谢，我刚买完特制牛奶回来，就被什么东西弄得满身都是这玩意儿。";
case "Shit somebody help me get this out.": return "妈的，谁来帮我把这东西弄掉。";
case "Oh ok, if that is what you want but let me tell you that I fight a little different than the rest.": return "哦，好，既然你这么想，不过先说好，我的战斗方式和别人有点不一样。";
case "You beat him ?! Please fight me in a sparring match.": return "你打败他了？！拜托，跟我切磋一下。";
case "I know you will, with enough practice you will beat him like I did <3.": return "你会做到的。只要勤加练习，你也能像我一样打败他<3。";
case "I would like to be stronger to face it again.": return "我想变强，再去挑战它一次。";
case "I am happy to hear you are ok.": return "听到你没事，我就放心了。";
case "Thanks for the help, traveler.": return "谢谢帮忙，旅行者。";
case "*Line blushes* Y-yes probably not hehe.": return "*莱茵脸红*嗯、嗯，可能不太行，嘿嘿。";
case "Besides, I don't think your way of fighting will work for me anyway hahaha.": return "再说，我觉得你的战斗方式，反正也不适合我，哈哈哈。";
case "I need to practice more but thanks anyway.": return "我还需要多练练，不过还是谢谢。";
case "Proklyat'ye.": return "该死的。";
case "AHhh. my head how did I get here, Hi-Hikari is that you?": return "啊啊……头好痛，我怎么到这里来了？光、光，是你吗？";
case "I love this part of town, although playing pachinco nothing beats it. You should come to my store maybe you will win a prize <3": return "我喜欢镇子的这一带，不过，什么都比不上玩柏青哥。来我的店看看吧，说不定能赢个奖品<3。";
case "Isn't it precious? This river is so peaceful, a perfect view for my retirement.": return "是不是很美？这条河这么宁静，正适合让我退休后天天欣赏。";
case "When you have the money come see me on the top floor of the hotel.": return "钱凑够了，就来酒店顶层找我。";
case "If you can get 1000 arcs I'll give you a girlfriend deal hehe.": return "攒到1000阿克，我就给你来个女友套餐，嘿嘿。";
case "How much?": return "多少钱？";
case "Haha so cute I'm sorry but I charged large amounts of money.": return "哈哈，真可爱。不过不好意思，我收费可高了。";
case "hey she's a shy succubus why don't you help her out for old times.": return "嘿，她是只害羞的魅魔，看在老交情上，帮帮她吧。";
case "Yes but that was a long time ago.": return "是啊，不过已经是很久以前的事了。";
case "Yes- yes I think you were this escort for shy succubus.": return "对、对，我记得你是专门陪害羞魅魔的应召女郎。";
case "Oh so you do know me.": return "哦，原来你认识我。";
case "Oh! I remembered she was in the XXX magazines that your mother had.": return "哦！想起来了，你妈妈那些色情杂志里有她。";
case "I don't think a girl with such innocent looks knows who I am.": return "你看着这么清纯，不像会知道我是谁的姑娘。";
case "He-hello, do I know you from somewhere?": return "你、你好，我们是不是在哪儿见过？";
case "I can't wait for you to have the money line, haha I haven't done this for a long time.": return "莱茵，我都等不及你攒够钱了。哈哈，好久没做这个了。";
case "And you already know the prize <3.": return "奖品你也已经知道了<3。";
case "The first to undress the other wins.": return "谁先把对方脱光，谁就赢。";
case "If you fail to undress I will take off one of your clothes.": return "要是没能脱掉衣服，我就脱掉你身上的一件。";
case "You will have attempts to undress me and you have to pay attention to where to touch.": return "你有几次机会脱我的衣服，要留意该碰哪里。";
case "Oh you don't have enough Arcs.": return "哦，你的阿克不够。";
case "Oh ok i will waiting here.": return "哦，好，我在这儿等。";
case "Well to start heating things up we'll play a little game.": return "那就先玩个小游戏，热热身。";
case "No right now.": return "现在不行。";
case "So Line you want to buy ten minute in heaven <3?": return "所以，莱茵，想买十分钟的天堂之旅吗<3？";
case "sorry it's a bad habit from the past let's try again <3.": return "对不起，以前留下的坏习惯，再来一次吧<3。";
case "You left me alone and naked in bed, and the maid also saw me ;C.": return "你把我光着身子一个人留在床上，还被女佣看见了;C。";
case "haha it looks like you learned a lot <3.": return "哈哈，看来你学了不少嘛<3。";
case "Oh but something bad will happen but not to me.": return "哦，是会发生坏事，不过倒霉的可不是我。";
case "She says get out of this place oh you're an idiot something could happen to you.": return "她说，赶快离开这里。哎，你真是个白痴，万一出事怎么办。";
case "Excuse? What the fuck did you say.": return "不好意思？你他妈说什么？";
case "Hey, what are you doing here? This is not a place for children.": return "喂，你来这里干什么？这里可不是小孩子该来的地方。";
case "And Baku still hasn't come back from the bathroom I'm starting to lose my patience.": return "巴库上个厕所到现在还没回来，我快没耐心了。";
case "This sucks, there is no alcohol and everyone thinks I'm a minor.": return "糟透了，没酒喝，所有人还都以为我没成年。";
case "I think the next thing I'll do is go to the farm, dress like a cow and get milked.": return "接下来，我想去农场，扮成奶牛，让人挤奶。";
case "She says get out of this place something could happen to you.": return "她说，离开这里，不然你可能出事。";
case "Excuse me, What the fuck did you say?.": return "什么？你他妈刚才说什么？";
case "Fuck you.": return "去你妈的。";
case "Looks Like you have nowhere to run.": return "看来你没地方逃了。";
case "Hu-hu-hu.": return "呼、呼、呼。";
case "Mmm...": return "嗯……";
case "After this I hope you rectify what you said.": return "这之后，希望你会收回刚才的话。";
case "So she's probably fine.": return "那她应该没事。";
case "Well.. this is an island to free yourself and explore sexuality freely. Most likely, she's been fucking someone since yesterday.": return "嗯……这座岛就是让人解放自我、自由探索性欲的地方。她八成从昨天起，就一直在和谁上床。";
case "I guess you're right thanks that calms me down a bit.": return "我想你说得对，谢谢，听了心里舒服多了。";
case "Stay calm if something bad has happened, the most likely thing is that the guards would have already told you something.": return "冷静点。真出了什么坏事，卫兵多半早就来通知你了。";
case "LiLi calm Alina": return "莉莉安抚阿莉娜";
case "Line calm Alina": return "莱茵安抚阿莉娜";
case "I won a contest to travel to this island with my girlfriend but she went out yesterday to buy and has not returned yet.": return "我赢了比赛，和女朋友一起来这座岛旅行。可她昨天出门买东西，到现在都没回来。";
case "But why would it be a bad idea to come? seems like a nice place.": return "不过，为什么不能来？这里看着不错啊。";
case "Oh sorry I heard as I passing by.": return "哦，抱歉，我路过时听见了。";
case "Coming to this island was a bad idea.": return "来这座岛，真是个坏主意。";
case "Lili!! ok im sorry for everything ok bye.": return "莉莉！！好了，所有的事都对不起，行了吧，再见。";
case "Yeah there's no need to fight.": return "对，没必要打架。";
case "I'm sorry for making a fight, it was wrong.": return "抱歉，我不该跟人打架。";
case "Thank you you are nothing like your fairy friend.": return "谢谢，你跟你那个仙子朋友可一点也不像。";
case "While I'm looking for my friend I'll look for yours, don't worry, everything will be fine.": return "我找自己朋友时，也会帮你找朋友。别担心，一切都会好的。";
case "I'm so sorry for what my fairy said.": return "我的妖精说了那些话，实在对不起。";
case "It has been a tiring day I will go to look for her after a nap.": return "今天累坏了，我先睡一会儿，醒了再去找她。";
case "Oh poor little thing it's ok if it's true I will help you.": return "哦，小可怜，没关系。如果是真的，我会帮你的。";
case "Blub blub blip :c": return "咕噜，咕噜，哔:c";
case "AHHHH that's what he said! Believe me or not that's your problem.": return "啊啊啊，他就是这么说的！信不信随你。";
case "Mmm really he said? I do not believe you at all Lili, do you know the story of peter and the wolf?": return "嗯，他真这么说？莉莉，我一点也不信。听过狼来了的故事吗？";
case "He said that his owner is out of control, they went to drink but on the way someone stole the key that his mistress uses as a demonic seal.": return "它说，主人失控了。他们本来要去喝酒，可半路上，有人偷走了女主人用作恶魔封印的钥匙。";
case "What did he say?": return "他说什么？";
case "Bleb Bleb blub blub bleb,blub blub, blip blop blop.": return "咕噜，咕噜，咕噜咕噜，啵，咕噜咕噜，哔，啵啵。";
case "Ya easy, I'll take care of it \nHey what's going on? Why is that thing moving like crazy if you're having sex in there at least try to keep a low profile.": return "行，简单，交给我。\n喂，怎么了？那东西怎么晃得跟疯了一样？要是在里面做爱，至少低调一点。";
case "Blob blip blop D:!": return "咕噜咕叽咕噜D:！";
case "Oh Mmmm blup, blep blip?": return "哦，嗯，咕噜，咕叽咕叽？";
case "Bleb Bleb blub blub bleb.": return "咕叽咕叽咕噜咕噜咕叽。";
case "Blurpblupblip?": return "咕噜咕噜？";
case "Blupblurulip!": return "咕噜咕噜！";
case "Fuck it Line is fight or nothing!": return "管他呢，莱茵，要么打，要么没得谈！";
case "Dissa-what?!": return "消、消什么？！";
case "Bu-but I do not have much money ;c.": return "可、可我没多少钱;c。";
case "I'm sorry but you have to disappear or pay your bill as a member.": return "抱歉，要么消失，要么作为会员，把账付清。";
case "This is a secret place for members only, and the cost to be one is 10.000 arcs per month.": return "这是只对会员开放的秘密场所，会员费每月10,000阿克。";
case "I am Sieki and I really meant how you got here?": return "我叫茜姬，我问的是，你到底怎么进来的？";
case "Ohmm... a friend told me here I could get some information about the girls on the island? I am looking for Sieki.": return "唔……有个朋友说，在这里能打听到岛上姑娘们的消息？我在找茜姬。";
case "You are the traveler what are you doing here?!": return "你就是那个旅行者，怎么跑这里来了？！";
case "Wait for me in the forest south of the hospital.": return "到医院南边的森林等我。";
case "Dont worry I will take care of this demond": return "别担心，这个恶魔交给我。";
case "Thank you very much for helping us so much we started it for you when we started selling the special milk of these cows.": return "太感谢你一直帮忙了。我们开始卖这些奶牛的特制奶，都是因为你。";
case "Um, yeah, it is okay,": return "嗯，是啊，没关系。";
case "Can you return it to the church? I would appreciate it a lot since I'm still organizing the cases of the other relics.": return "能把它还给教堂吗？我会非常感激的，毕竟我还在整理其他圣遗物的案子。";
case "(Phew, how stressful.) Well, it does not matter. The important thing is that the relic is back.": return "（呼，压力真大。）算了，圣物找回来就好。";
case "Hmm, well, when the robbery happened, you weren't even on the island. I guess I can rule you out as a suspect.": return "嗯，案发时，你甚至还没到岛上。看来可以排除你的嫌疑。";
case "*Starts to sweat but maintains eye contact *... Crazy, right?": return "*开始冒汗，却仍强撑着直视对方*……挺离谱吧？";
case "But your story still seems strange...": return "可你的故事，听起来还是有点奇怪……";
case "Hmm, the witnesses said the thief went south of the church.": return "嗯，目击者说，窃贼往教堂南边去了。";
case "I-it's possible that the person got l-lost or went m-mad in the forest and ended up l-leaving it behind. I-I didn't find anything else besides the relic.": return "可、可能那个人在森林里迷、迷路，或者发、发疯了，最后把它落、落在那里了。除、除了圣遗物，我什么也没找到。";
case "Wait, but how is that possible? Why would it be lying there?!": return "等等，怎么可能？为什么会丢在那里？！";
case "Captain, I found a relic in the forest.": return "队长，我在森林里发现了一件圣物。";
case "Have you left the relic at the church already?": return "已经把圣物送到教堂了吗？";
case "Yes, we will be exemplary citizens of society!": return "没错，我们会成为社会的模范公民！";
case "We already know what to do Line!": return "莱茵，我们知道该怎么做了！";
case "Very well, I appreciate you staying safe.": return "很好，谢谢你平安回来。";
case "I won't even think about the place, that's how dedicated I am to not making trouble!": return "我连那个地方都不会想，绝对不惹麻烦，就是这么坚决！";
case "Lastly, there is a scammer posing as a guard you can see her description on the flyers around town and if I were to say one place you shouldn't go it would be the bridge that leads to the magenta swamp.": return "最后，有个骗子在冒充卫兵，镇上各处的传单都有她的描述。非要说哪里不能去，那就是通往洋红沼泽的桥。";
case "I think I'm familiar with your description, we'll stay out of it <3": return "你描述的情况，我好像有点印象。我们会避开的<3。";
case "Sometimes from time to time, a foreign heroine comes to catch criminals escaping from her sector, so if you see a lady in a bikini with light blue hair around here in the jail-farm, don't bother her.": return "偶尔会有外地的女英雄，来抓从她管区逃出来的罪犯。所以，要是在监狱农场附近，看见一个穿着比基尼、浅蓝色头发的女士，别去打扰她。";
case "Noted :O": return "记住啦 :O";
case "Right, first of all stay away from the group of guards in the bar where they are planning how to defeat a demon that steals supplies.": return "对，首先，离酒吧里那群卫兵远点。他们正计划怎么打败偷补给的恶魔。";
case "... and which places should we not go to stay out of the way :v?": return "……那我们要去哪些地方，才能不碍事呢:v？";
case "No, stay out of the issue, citizens.": return "不行，市民，请不要插手。";
case "Hey, what if we help solve those problems?": return "喂，要是我们能帮忙解决呢？";
case "The barn will be up and running again once we have dealt with the problems.": return "等我们把这些问题解决，谷仓就会恢复营业。";
case "We are at the limit because of the increase in crime on the islands.": return "岛上的犯罪活动激增，我们已经忙到极限了。";
case "Now you cannot enter the barn.": return "现在不能进谷仓。";
case "Remember, don't be heroes, not everyone can be a guard of Elira.": return "记住，别逞英雄，不是谁都能当艾莉拉卫兵的。";
case "But you can ask local owners or even artists on the streets.": return "不过，你可以问问本地店主，或者街头艺人。";
case "I see a lot of people a day, so I couldn't tell you that I did see her.": return "我每天见到那么多人，可说不准有没有见过她。";
case "Oh thank you very much, by chance you have seen a woman with wings on her head.": return "哦，非常感谢。对了，有没有见过一个头上长翅膀的女人？";
case "Welcome to the cariel town.": return "欢迎来到卡里尔镇。";
case "Oh-ok :c.": return "哦，好吧 :c。";
case "I'm sorry miss but it's closed for now.": return "抱歉，小姐，暂时不开放。";
case "The great captain gave the order to take care of the town while she searches for the demon.": return "伟大的队长下令，让我们照看镇子，她亲自去找那只恶魔。";
case "Then what do we do?": return "那我们怎么办？";
case "That bastard.": return "那个混蛋。";
case "Everything indicates that so far.": return "目前的线索都指向这个结论。";
case "Is the cause of alcohol not reaching the town?": return "这就是酒运不到镇上的原因？";
case "The traveler defeated a succubus but this is a high rank demon.": return "旅人确实打败过魅魔，但这次可是高阶恶魔。";
case "A demon? I heard a traveler beat her.": return "恶魔？听说有个旅行者打败她了。";
case "Yes, apparently there is something on the outskirts of town.": return "是啊，镇子外围好像出了什么情况。";
case "What seriously?": return "什么，认真的？";
case "This for you traveler!!!": return "为了你，旅人！！！";
case "I think this is the last beer in the bar.": return "这大概是酒吧最后一杯啤酒了。";
case "I'm finall *hip* drunk enough to tell Callie to go out with me.": return "我终于*嗝*喝够了，敢叫卡莉跟我约会了。";
case "No drinks.. no courage.": return "没酒……就没胆。";
case "Life makes sense again <3 !!": return "人生又有意义了<3！！";
case "I should patrol while I wait for the next shipment.": return "等下一批货到的时候，我应该去巡逻一下。";
case "Finally Beer!!!!": return "终于有啤酒了！！！！";
case "This is so boring.": return "无聊死了。";
case "yes unfortunately, that's why I must hurry": return "很遗憾，是的，所以我得抓紧。";
case "what and were there people there ?!": return "什么，那里还有人？！";
case "I'm sorry miss there was a landslide will be available when I manage to open the way.": return "抱歉，小姐，这里发生了塌方。等我把路挖通，就能走了。";
case "Please, can you go see how the miners are, I would go but I'm very tired.": return "拜托，能去看看矿工们怎么样了吗？我本来该自己去，可实在太累了。";
case "Sound cooler.": return "听着更酷。";
case "Why Lilian?": return "为什么叫莉莲？";
case "Lilian for you.": return "你就叫我莉莲。";
case "Understood Miss Faery.": return "明白，妖精小姐。";
case "The great captain told me to stay here until she came back.": return "大队长让我留在这里，等她回来。";
case "there is a dangerous demon prowling, I advise you to go to the town which is a safer place": return "附近有危险的恶魔游荡，建议你回镇上去，那里更安全。";
case "Sorry Miss the pass to the forest is closed.": return "抱歉，小姐，通往森林的路已经封锁。";
case "Now let us pass!": return "现在让我们过去！";
case "Excuse me? We are the bounty hunters hired by the great captain to kill the demond.": return "不好意思？我们是大队长雇来杀恶魔的赏金猎人。";
case "I'll stay here guarding.": return "我留在这里守着。";
case "I will rest here a little.": return "我在这里稍微歇会儿。";
case "Excuse me?": return "你说什么？";
case "these guards are idiots they didn't even see the trail.": return "这帮守卫真蠢，连痕迹都没看见。";
case "I will go see maybe we will find something.": return "我去看看，说不定能发现什么。";
case "Look Line there's a trace of this thing coming behind the red tent.": return "看，莱茵，那东西留下的痕迹，从红色帐篷后面过来了。";
case "Ok calm down I will help you get this thing off.": return "好，冷静点，我帮你把这东西弄下来。";
case "I would not know very well which of her children it could be, but I do know that it was a lady cat.": return "具体是她哪个孩子，我不太清楚，但我知道是个猫女。";
case "Sir, did you see where the culprit went, was it really the daughter of the cat that sells clothes the culprit?.": return "先生，你看到犯人去哪儿了吗？真的是那个卖衣服的猫娘，她女儿干的吗？";
case "Seems to be waking up.": return "好像要醒了。";
case "Hey look Lili.": return "嘿，莉莉，你看。";
case "Tell me something I do not know.": return "说点我不知道的。";
case "We are the best guards in town.": return "我们可是镇上最棒的守卫。";
case "Let's look for the guard who was left unconscious.": return "我们去找那个被打晕的卫兵吧。";
case "Yea even the culprit could know something about Ava and the strange things that happen on the island.": return "对，说不定犯人也知道艾娃的事，还有岛上这些怪事的线索。";
case "Lili we must help them they do not seem to be lying.": return "莉莉，我们得帮他们，他们看起来不像在说谎。";
case "Mama I swear I didn't it was a blue cat.": return "妈妈，我发誓不是我，是只蓝猫。";
case "What!!": return "什么！！";
case "Due  she is a minor, you will have to pay the fine at the jail-farm.": return "由于她尚未成年，罚款需要你到监狱农场缴纳。";
case "One of her daughter's pranks left one of the guards unconscious.": return "她女儿的一次恶作剧，把一名卫兵弄昏了。";
case "I'm afraid that is more serious than that.": return "恐怕不只是这样。";
case "Now leave if you are not going to buy something.": return "不买东西，就请离开。";
case "Oh c'mon are just pranks how serious it can be.": return "拜托，只是恶作剧，能有多严重。";
case "Miss I must inform your daughter she has been seen making pranks to the people of this town.": return "女士，得跟你说一声，有人看到你女儿在捉弄镇上的人。";
case "Mom!! are you listening to me? ;c Mom!!!.": return "妈妈！！你在听吗？;c妈妈！！！";
case "And the guards are blaming me.": return "卫兵却全怪到我头上。";
case "Mom there is a cat doing pranks to people.": return "妈妈，有只猫在捉弄别人。";
case "leave my mommy alone.": return "别欺负我妈妈。";
case "I'm not going to that place with that sucking milk machine 2000.": return "有那台吸奶机2000在，我才不去那个地方。";
case "Come on miss, accompany me to jail-farm.": return "来吧，小姐，跟我去监狱农场。";
case "Calm love, I'll be back in a few days.": return "别担心，亲爱的，我过几天就回来。";
case "But mommy ;c": return "可是妈妈 ;c";
case "I don't care, it's was worthed.": return "我不在乎，值了。";
case "I will take you to the jail-farm for assault on social security entities.": return "袭击维护社会治安的执法人员，我得把你带去监狱农场。";
case "And you fucking inoperative social parasite you should learn how to do your fucking job before you put people in jail.": return "你这他妈的废物、社会蛀虫！先学会怎么做好自己的破工作，再来把人关进牢里！";
case "Of course they are innocent, children cover your ears.": return "她们当然无辜。孩子们，捂上耳朵。";
case "Really? It seems her daughters were innocent after all.": return "真的？看来她的女儿们确实是无辜的。";
case "Wait there were new attacks on other people it couldn't be his daughters they were here with you.": return "等等，又有其他人遇袭，不可能是她的女儿们，刚才她们一直和你在这里。";
case "I'm sorry miss will you have to come with me or you will have increased the time in jail-farm.": return "抱歉，小姐，你得跟我走，不然在监狱农场待的时间，还得加长。";
case "Of course not, you closet slut.": return "当然不是，你这闷骚婊子。";
case "But, I don't really care much about those powers.": return "可是，我对那些能力其实没多大兴趣。";
case "Yes, but the good side is that you can buy clothes and absorb them into your sacred clothes, these will change in combat which will improve your half-succubus abilities <3.": return "是啊。不过好处是，你可以买新衣服，让圣衣将其吸收。战斗中圣衣会变换形态，增强你半魅魔的能力<3。";
case "What?! b-but these clothes are sacred, my father will be very angry :c.": return "什么？！可、可这些衣服是神圣的，爸爸会很生气的:c。";
case "Before going to chase the angel, your mother imbue succubus magic in the elven clothes your father gave you.": return "去追那个天使前，你妈妈给你父亲送的精灵衣服，注入了魅魔魔法。";
case "Oh no, Lili and now what have you done.": return "不好，莉莉，你这次又干了什么？";
case "Emmm. yes .. but there is something I didn't tell you.": return "呃，嗯……不过，有件事我没告诉你。";
case "But for what, the magic clothes that my father gave me are enough to fight.": return "可为什么？爸爸给我的魔法衣服，已经够用来战斗了。";
case "Line look a store maybe you can buy new equipment.": return "莱茵，看，有家店，说不定能买点新装备。";
case "Select the 'natural' option.": return "选择“天然”选项。";
case "Then you go to equipment and in the section where you have the boots on.": return "接着打开装备栏，找到装备靴子的那一格。";
case "You have to go to the menu press enter.": return "得先打开菜单，按回车键。";
case "Line to take off your boots.": return "莱茵，把靴子脱掉。";
case "Oh ok but that is within the normal :s but if it is required, I can could trie more things.": return "哦，好吧，不过这也算正常范围内的事:s。要是有必要，我也可以试试更多东西。";
case "Yeah shure, she seemed somewhat annoyed if we help her, she will most likely give us a price cut,are you with me Line?": return "当然啦。她看起来有点烦躁，帮她一把，说不定就能打折。莱茵，跟我一起吗？";
case "No! You're wrong, I just want to be a little stronger, nothing more.": return "不是！你想错了，我只是想稍微变强一点，没别的。";
case "Oh so now you want new stuff, don't pretend to be a saint you wanted to excite your opponents with new clothes.": return "哦，现在又想买新东西了？别装清纯了，你就是想穿新衣服勾得对手兴奋。";
case "What are we going to do Lili :s.": return "莉莉，我们要怎么办:s？";
case "What the hell! those prices.": return "什么鬼！这价格！";
case "AHHH FORGET WHAT YOU SAW!": return "啊啊啊，忘掉你看到的！";
case "Oh, I almost forgot, give these pamphlets to the people.": return "哦，差点忘了，把这些传单发给大家。";
case "I might know where he could be.": return "我也许知道他在哪儿。";
case "Of course, if she came to this island for the same reason that all tourists come.": return "当然，她来这里，跟其他游客都是同一个目的。";
case "If I help you, could you help us by getting information from my friend?": return "如果帮你，你能帮我们打听朋友的消息吗？";
case "People have to know that the red tent will open soon so im kinda busy.": return "得让大家知道红色帐篷快开张了，所以我现在有点忙。";
case "I'm sorry, sweetie but now I can't, I'm going to do stand up to attract some people.": return "抱歉，宝贝，现在不行。我要去说单口喜剧，招揽点观众。";
case "Hi, can you give me a little of your time? I'm looking for a friend.": return "你好，能耽误你一点时间吗？我在找一个朋友。";
case "Give those pamphlets to people while I get ready.": return "我准备的时候，你去把这些传单发给大家。";
case "You should have told me that you like these types of shows. we could one of us here <3.": return "早说你喜欢这种表演嘛，我们自己也能在这里来一场<3。";
case "You can see the place while we prepare all.": return "我们准备的时候，你可以先四处看看。";
case "oh You don't have to thank me, oh I almost forgot the circus is still in preparation but there a girl with pink hair near the stands that you might like.": return "哦，不用谢。对了，差点忘了，马戏团还在准备，不过看台附近有个粉头发女孩，你也许会感兴趣。";
case "I'm good , and thank for the information and the other thing hehe.": return "我很好，也谢谢你的消息，还有另外那件事，嘿嘿。";
case "*whisper* oh god the jokes of this bitch.": return "*低声*天哪，这贱人的笑话真是够了。";
case "Hi Line, how have you bee-n.": return "嗨，莱茵，最近过得怎——么样。";
case "Hi MsHonney.": return "你好，霍妮女士。";
case "welcome to the green hills hotel at the moment we do not have rooms available": return "欢迎来到青丘旅馆，目前没有空房。";
case "Welcome to the green hills hotel at the moment we do not have rooms available.": return "欢迎来到绿丘旅馆，目前客房已满。";
case "Go to the door on the left she will be waiting for you.": return "去左边那扇门，她在那里等你。";
case "Wow I never thought that a young girl who looks so innocent would go to see her.": return "哇，真没想到，这么个看着纯情的小姑娘，会去找她。";
case "Oh-sorry i havent sleep lately.": return "哦，对不起，最近一直没睡好。";
case "Geez Line control yourself.": return "老天，莱茵，克制一下。";
case "What?": return "什么？";
case "I love you.": return "我爱你。";
case "Mshonney have new workers.": return "蜜糖女士招了新员工。";
case "Welcome to the green hills hotel.": return "欢迎来到绿丘酒店。";
case "ok ok just give me a sec": return "好，好，等我一下。";
case "I will sell it and be free again.": return "我会把它卖掉，重新获得自由。";
case "I escaped from jail but I had no place to go or money, this place is my only option, I must win the golden key.": return "我越狱了，可既没地方去，也没钱，这里是唯一的选择。必须赢到黄金钥匙。";
case "I-I can't here callie, you know I'm shy, there are a lot of people here": return "我、我不能在这里，卡莉，你知道我害羞，这里人太多了。";
case "But your love, you can take it right here.": return "不过，你的爱意，可以就在这里给我。";
case "My children are the best <3 tell him that here it is not so bad, they even pay me to produce milk.": return "我的孩子们最棒了<3。告诉他，这里也没那么糟，他们甚至付钱让我产奶呢。";
case "Oh ok, your kids send you good vibes since they can't come.": return "哦，好吧，你的孩子们虽然来不了，也托我祝你一切顺利。";
case "Sorry here just let us say moo.": return "抱歉，这里只许我们说“哞”。";
case "Whaaat?.": return "什——么？";
case "Mooo.": return "哞。";
case "Hey Line come here.": return "嘿，莱茵，过来。";
case "Yes, she wants me to stay close to her since I am 18 years old and she doesn't want me to go to places that were previously restricted to me on the island.": return "对，她想让我一直待在她身边。我刚满18岁，她不想让我去岛上那些以前不准我去的地方。";
case "Wait are you the saleswoman's son?": return "等等，你是那个售货员的儿子？";
case "Bye I have to go": return "再见，我得走了。";
case "No, but I know that north from here they did the same to a fox girl.": return "没有，不过听说北边有个狐女，也被这样整了。";
case "Wait do you know who did this to you?": return "等等，你知道是谁把你弄成这样的吗？";
case "Thanks I have to go.": return "谢谢，我得走了。";
case "Oh do not worry I will take that thing from you.": return "哦，别担心，我帮你把那东西拿掉。";
case "yeah she went to the cultivation of nana leaves.": return "对，她去种娜娜叶的地方了。";
case "Thank you lady unicorn but be careful that cat likes to prank people :c.": return "谢谢你，独角兽女士，不过要小心，那只猫喜欢捉弄人:c。";
case "Oh I just got to the town but if I see it I'll let you know <3.": return "哦，我刚到镇上，不过看见的话，会告诉你的<3。";
case "Mmm no, and have you seen a blue cat by chance?": return "嗯，没有。话说，你见过一只蓝猫吗？";
case "Hello by chance have you seen someone with wings on their head?": return "你好，有没有见过一个头上长着翅膀的人？";
case "yeah just give use the money": return "对，把钱给我们就行。";
case "That is, if they do not return with the money on time you will have to work in the village dairy farm to pay it": return "就是说，如果没按时带钱回来，你就得在村里的奶牛场工作还债。";
case "We take the money": return "我们拿走钱。";
case "sounds really easy actually": return "听着还真挺简单。";
case "It's easy, I'll lend you money and you return it to me later with an extra 10%": return "很简单，我借你钱，你之后还我，再多付10%。";
case "Oh ok what do we have to do?": return "哦，好，我们要做什么？";
case "I don't know Line having money is always good": return "不知道，莱茵，有钱总是好的。";
case "Me mmm .. not really": return "我？嗯……还真没有。";
case "Hey you look like you need money.": return "喂，你看起来很缺钱。";
case "Great just sign here.": return "很好，在这里签字。";
case "Amazing, it's great to do deals with you.": return "太棒了，跟你做生意真愉快。";
case "I gave you 1000 arcs plus 10%, you should give me back 1100.": return "我借你1000阿克币，加10%的利息，你该还我1100。";
case "No, sorry you will have the money later.": return "抱歉，还不行，钱以后再给你。";
case "Yes, here is your money.": return "有，钱在这里。";
case "You are going to give my money back?": return "你是来还钱的？";
case "Sure just sign here": return "当然，在这里签字就行。";
case "He-hello could you lend me money again?": return "你、你好，能再借我点钱吗？";
case "Maybe later.": return "以后再说吧。";
case "Ask for money.": return "借钱。";
case "You need money again?": return "又缺钱了？";
case "Ok I even liked hehe.": return "好啊，我还挺喜欢的，嘿嘿。";
case "...sorry for getting you into this moo..": return "……对不起，把你卷进这件事，哞……";
case "Moo...": return "哞……";
case "Do not believe her little girl, she is joking.": return "小姑娘，别信她，她在开玩笑。";
case "Lili!": return "莉莉！";
case "That's true, especially someone like Line she is a freak.": return "那倒是真的，尤其莱茵这种怪胎。";
case "My mom told me not to talk to strangers.": return "妈妈说，不能跟陌生人说话。";
case "Please help miss traveler.": return "旅人小姐，请帮帮忙。";
case "And you fucking inoperative social parasite you should learn how to do your fucking job before you put people in jail-farm.": return "还有你，这个他妈的废物社会寄生虫，把人关进监狱农场之前，先学学怎么做好你的破工作吧！";
case "Could you say hello to my mommy if you go near the jail-farm the children can't go out beyond the town.": return "经过监牢农场时，能替我向妈妈问好吗？小孩子不能离开镇子。";
case "Thanks for helping my family.": return "谢谢你帮助我的家人。";
case "Those are weird clothes for an elf, come on in": return "对精灵来说，这身衣服倒挺奇怪，进来吧。";
case "Not now, I'm watching that none of these cows attempt a breakout.": return "现在不行，我得看着这些牛，免得有哪个又想越狱。";
case "It seems you like to see our cows.": return "看来，你很喜欢看我们的奶牛。";
case "Rawr": return "嗷";
case "Rawr.": return "嗷。";
case "Oh-ok.": return "哦，好吧。";
case "Be careful stepping on the mushrooms.": return "小心别踩到蘑菇。";
case "It seems that everything is back to normal hehe I'm going to make some money with these drunkards": return "看来一切都恢复正常了，嘿嘿，我去赚这些酒鬼的钱了。";
case "That... is... The most logical thing I've ever heard in my life thank you very much for the information <3!": return "这……是……我这辈子听过最有道理的话！非常感谢你的说明<3！";
case "*whispering* What a stupid thing to do.": return "*小声*真是蠢透了。";
case "MMmm if you want to be pure like a rabbit bring your hands to your head and move them like a bunny <3 oh and don't forget to say pyon pyon.": return "嗯，想像兔子一样纯洁，就把手举到头顶，学兔耳朵那样动一动<3。哦，别忘了喊“蹦蹦”哦。";
case "If you have anything you can help me with please let me know!": return "有什么我能帮忙的，尽管告诉我！";
case "Mmm looking for the purity of a rabbit and how to replicate it?": return "嗯，在研究兔子的纯洁，以及如何复制这种纯洁？";
case "Hey I hope my advice is helping you <3": return "喂，希望我的建议帮到你了<3";
case "Do me the favor of saying no if she talks to you about those things, she is my best friend but I wouldn't like her to come between us.": return "帮个忙，她再跟你提这种事，就拒绝她。她是我最好的朋友，但我不想让她插进我们之间。";
case "Oh I almost forgot Ms honney, she sometimes looks for people who want somewhat different experiences.": return "哦，差点忘了霍妮女士，她有时会找想体验不同玩法的人。";
case "She will be there don't worry Callie.": return "她会在那里的，卡莉，别担心。";
case "So I could introduce you to my children in a more appropriate way than now haha.": return "这样，我就能比现在更正式些，介绍孩子们给你认识了，哈哈。";
case "Haha I would also like you to come to my house for lunch.": return "哈哈，我也想请你来家里吃午饭。";
case "I love that you liked it.": return "你喜欢，我很开心。";
case "Well, hehe that was  awesome.": return "好吧，嘿嘿，刚才真棒。";
case "Come, join us for lunch.": return "来，陪我们一起吃午饭。";
case "You will love it, it is cheap, tasty and fast <3 .": return "你会喜欢的，便宜、好吃，还快<3。";
case "Oh sure, I've never eaten that kind of food before but it looks delicious.": return "哦，当然。我以前没吃过这种食物，不过看起来很好吃。";
case "Line! You arrived, did you see the feast I have prepared?": return "莱茵！你来了！看到我准备的这桌大餐了吗？";
case "Oh give me a second Honey, I'm doing the dishes.": return "哦，亲爱的，等我一下，我在洗碗。";
case "Thank you, to get to the library just follow this road to the west of town.": return "谢谢，去图书馆的话，沿着这条路，一直往镇子西边走就行。";
case "Mmmm I will see if I can find out anything, do not worry, you can go back to reading your favorite books.": return "嗯，我去看看能不能打听到什么。放心，你可以继续读你最喜欢的书了。";
case "I don't know, the librarian is missing so the library is closed.": return "不知道，图书管理员失踪了，所以图书馆关门了。";
case "Oh, why what happened?": return "哦，怎么了，出了什么事？";
case "Aw man, I wanted to go to the library.": return "唉，本来还想去图书馆呢。";
case "You find anything yet?": return "找到什么了吗？";
case "Mmmmm, oHhh, Ah ha wooooow.\nI forgot I can't read.": return "嗯，哦，啊哈，哇——。\n忘了，我不识字。";
case "I will have to show you what I want to save you from": return "我得让你看看，我究竟想救你远离什么。";
case "if you're going to trust that demon": return "你真要相信那个恶魔的话。";
case "I'm really sorry ava, I believe lili": return "真的对不起，艾娃，我相信莉莉。";
case "please line you have to believe me, I am part of you, if I say that something horrible will happen to you, it will happen to me anyway, stop it before it's too late": return "求你了，莱茵，一定要信我。我就是你的一部分。如果我说你会遭遇可怕的事，那我也逃不过。快停下，别等来不及了。";
case "calm Line let me continue with this and everything will be solved": return "冷静，莱茵，让我继续，一切都会解决的。";
case "but why ava, what have i done to you i thought we were best friends": return "可是为什么啊，艾娃，我做错了什么？我以为我们是最好的朋友。";
case "you do not talk to me like that, you are a mistake of nature you caused all this and I will try to fix it": return "不许这么跟我说话。你是自然的错误，这一切都是你造成的，我会想办法修复。";
case "don't believe this crazy bitch she she tries to murder you and your mother": return "别信这个疯婊子，她、她想杀了你和你妈妈！";
case "don't worry Line everything will be fine you don't need to do anything": return "放心，莱茵，一切都会好的，你什么都不用做。";
case "What's wrong with you, why do you escape from me?": return "你怎么了，为什么要躲着我？";
case "Line, I do this for you please understand me": return "莱茵，我都是为了你，请理解我。";
case "Ava please stop": return "艾娃，请住手";
case "I'm sorry but I haven't seen her around here.": return "抱歉，我没在这附近见过她。";
case "Oh okay, I wanted to ask, you have seen a woman with wings in her head around here?": return "哦，好吧。想问一下，你有没有在附近见过一个头上长着翅膀的女人？";
case "Unfortunately we ran out of alcohol a little while ago.": return "很遗憾，酒刚刚卖完了。";
case "Welcome to the bar fluid sky.": return "欢迎来到流液天空酒吧。";
case "This broom has been here for a long time, I don't think they will come looking for it, it will help you travel faster through the town <3.": return "这把扫帚在这里放很久了，应该没人会来找。给你用，能让你在镇上移动得更快<3。";
case "Well the truth haha I have nothing here but I had thought to give you something from the lost & found box.": return "其实，哈哈，我手头什么都没有，不过可以从失物招领箱里拿点东西给你。";
case "Thank you very much beating that demon was quite an odyssey but gestures like these make it worth it <3.": return "太感谢了，打败那个恶魔真是一波三折。不过看到这种心意，就觉得一切都值得了<3。";
case "*covers Line's mouth and murmurs* shut-up.": return "*捂住莱茵的嘴，小声说*闭嘴。";
case "Thanks.": return "谢谢。";
case "Thanks but i beat the Demond for reasons of my own.": return "谢谢，不过我是为了自己的事，才去打败那个恶魔的。";
case "Thanks but it's not necessary.": return "谢谢，不过不用了。";
case "Let me give you something for all the trouble.": return "给你点东西，补偿你受的麻烦。";
case "Hey wait you are the adventurer who defeated the demon that stole alcohol?": return "嘿，等等，你就是打败那个偷酒恶魔的冒险者？";
case "Go to the door on your left Sieki is waiting for you.": return "去左边那扇门，茜姬在等你。";
case "Then the rain washes it away.": return "随后，雨水将它冲走。";
case "Stones it brings.": return "它带来石头。";
case "When the river sounds.": return "无风不起浪。";
case "Leave uncomfortably without saying goodbye.": return "尴尬地离开，不说再见。";
case "Say the secret Password.": return "说出秘密口令。";
case "Nothing to do let's give her money back if you have an idea you can tell her.": return "没办法，把钱还给她吧。想到什么主意，也可以告诉她。";
case "B-but what if she gets angry?": return "可、可是，她要是生气了怎么办？";
case "We have to tell Kristoff there are no premium cigarettes on this island.": return "得告诉克里斯托夫，这座岛上没有高级香烟。";
case "Oh this is bad :c.": return "哦，这下糟了:c。";
case "Wow I know where to buy cigarettes, but some worth 100 Arcs... unfortunately I think there are no such cigarettes on this island.": return "我知道哪里卖烟，不过一包100阿克币的……很遗憾，岛上大概没有这种烟。";
case "Hello, by chance, do you know where you can buy premium cigarettes worth 100 Arcs?": return "你好，请问哪里能买到100阿克一包的高级香烟？";
case "Ahh?! I don't think you understand, the one who will have the enema will be you. I hope you can stand the alcohol well, babe.": return "啊？！你好像没听懂，要被灌肠的是你。宝贝，希望你酒量够好。";
case "Oh I've never done it to someone but I think I can do it.": return "哦，以前没给别人做过，不过，我应该可以。";
case "Great, because it means we both have similar tastes and I love fucking enemas, they turn me on so dam much.": return "太好了，说明咱俩口味一样。我超他妈喜欢灌肠，简直让我兴奋得不行。";
case "Ohh eh mmm yeah sure eh he-he.": return "哦，呃，嗯，对，当然，嘿、嘿嘿。";
case "I knew with the money you spent coming to see me I knew you were a vip!": return "我就知道！看你为见我花了那么多钱，我就知道你是贵宾！";
case "( Ahg, I'll have to use my reserve energy to grow in size otherwise I won't be able to win... shit I never thought I'd use it in something like this )": return "（啊，得用储备的能量把体型变大，不然赢不了……妈的，真没想到会用在这种事情上。）";
case "I am glad you reached a consensus I will bring Customers you can enter your holes.": return "很高兴你们达成共识，我会带客人来，你们可以进各自的洞位了。";
case "OHH YEAH, IF I'M LIKE THIS IT'S BECAUSE OF YOU! AND YOUR SORDID ENERGY THAT YOU TRANSMIT ON TO YOUR FAMILIAR!": return "哦，没错！我变成这样，都是因为你！还有你传给使魔的，那股肮脏能量！";
case "AHHHH! THIS IS HOW YOU REPAY ME AFTER DEFENDING YOU FROM ALL THOSE WHO SAID YOU WERE A ROTTEN FAIRY. COME ON LET'S FIGHT HERE NOW!": return "啊啊啊！那些人都说你是个烂妖精，我一直替你辩护，你就这么报答我？！来，现在就在这里打一架！";
case "You know I've seen you and you're no wonder at sex, I'd even say you're bad at it, the only thing that satisfies people is that you're half succubus!": return "你知道，我观察过你。论做爱，你没多了不起，甚至可以说很差劲。别人能满足，纯粹因为你是半魅魔！";
case "Lili stop joking you do not stand a chance.": return "莉莉，别开玩笑了，你根本没机会赢。";
case "Ahhh stop victimizing yourself, you know if you think you're so good at this let's compete!": return "啊，别再装可怜了。既然你觉得自己这么厉害，就比一场！";
case "... Looks like you finally show your true colors. You only did all this so that one day you could say it to my face.": return "……看来终于露出真面目了。你做这些，不过就是为了有一天能当面拿出来说。";
case "AHHHH stop being so condescending first I want to do all these things but with someone I love not complete strangers like you fucking bitch!": return "啊——别再摆出那副高高在上的样子！我也想做这些，但要跟我爱的人，而不是跟你这个臭婊子一样，随便找陌生人！";
case "It's okay Lili we know that fairies are born from the flower and there is no need to use their reproductive organs you have nothing to explain <3.": return "没事，莉莉，我们知道仙子是从花里出生的，不需要使用生殖器官，你不用解释<3。";
case "... Hey just because I don't do it as an addict like you doesn't mean I'm not interested in this world.": return "……喂，我不像你一样上瘾，不代表对这个世界没兴趣。";
