case "If you do everything right, all the succubus doors will open, and you will gain a new power. The rest you will discover over time.": return "只要一切做对，魅魔之门就会全部开启，你也会获得新的力量。剩下的，往后自然会明白。";
case "Dodge everything that is white. Also, a part of me will accompany you to prevent anything serious from happening to you, but you must also cover for me.": return "躲开所有白色的东西。另外，我的一部分会陪着你，免得真出事，不过你也得掩护我。";
case "Everything you see there is a part of me, but it doesn't mean it can't harm you.": return "你在那里看到的一切，都是我的一部分，但这不代表，它们不会伤害你。";
case "...What a misfortune, but okay, we'll start, but first, you need to know this.": return "……真是不幸。不过，好吧，我们开始。但你得先知道这件事。";
case "I do not know if I'm really prepared for this.": return "不知道自己是不是真的准备好了。";
case "Yes, I will do whatever it takes!": return "是，我会不惜一切！";
case "Now, hearing this, are you willing to go through this challenge?": return "听了这些，你还愿意接受这场考验吗？";
case "If you manage to pass each test, I will personally open the succubus doors that sleep within you.": return "如果通过每一项考验，我会亲自替你开启体内沉睡的魅魔之门。";
case "You will learn everything empirically. I will open my heart and my consciousness and connect with you. You will see all the bad that being succubus has brought into my life, and I hope you understand that you are making a mistake my baby.": return "一切都得亲身体验。我会敞开心扉和意识，与你相连。你会看见，魅魔身份给我带来了多少坏事。希望你能明白，你走错了，宝贝。";
case "I'm disgusted with everything related to being succcubs, so I won't teach you in the conventional way": return "我厌恶跟魅魔有关的一切，所以不会按常规方式教你。";
case "Ohh, my poor little girl, it truly hurts me that you're condemned like the rest of us. Alright, I'll help you in my way": return "哦，可怜的小姑娘，你注定和我们一样，真让我心痛。好吧，我会用自己的方式帮你。";
case "Please, we know you want to protect Line, just like me, but keeping her ignorant also harms her. As she said, there are people who falsely extended a hand to us, only to take advantage of us.": return "拜托，我们知道，你跟我一样想保护莱茵。但让她一无所知，也是在伤害她。正如她说的，有些人假装伸出援手，其实只是想利用我们。";
case "Please, many people have promised to help me... in the end, it amounts to nothing or they take advantage of me. I don't want to keep being a fool... plea...please, Miss Marael.": return "求你了，很多人都说过要帮我……可到头来，要么什么都没有，要么就是利用我。我不想再当傻子了……求、求求你，玛拉艾尔女士。";
case "I refuse to do it! Can't you see how much it has affected my life? You have the blessing of still being away from those powers, my child.": return "我不答应！看不出这对我的人生影响有多大吗？孩子，你还没沾上那些能力，这可是福气。";
case "No! It's not that. I need someone to help me unlock my succubus powers.": return "不！不是那样，我需要有人帮我唤醒魅魔之力。";
case "...? To be honest, I'm not in the mood for that.": return "……？说实话，现在没那个心情。";
case "The truth is, I know how you could help me.": return "其实，我知道你能怎么帮我。";
case "Thank you, Line... I owe you a lot. I don't know how to repay you for everything you've done.": return "谢谢你，莱茵……我欠你太多，不知道怎样才能报答你做的一切。";
case "Miss Marael, we returned the relic, and the captain believed my word. I do not think we will have any problems.": return "玛拉艾尔女士，我们归还了圣物，队长也相信我的话，应该不会有麻烦。";
case "I'll remind you of the instructions: avoid the white and protect my heart. That's all.": return "再提醒一次：避开白色，保护我的心。就这样。";
case "I will leave this for now": return "这个先放一放吧。";
case "I need to do this, Miss Marael, I am sorry.": return "我必须这么做，玛拉艾尔女士，对不起。";
case "Please stop my baby, I know what is best for you.": return "停下，宝贝，求你了。我知道，什么对你最好。";
case "Please Line, just go, do this for me,": return "求你了，莱茵，走吧，就当是为了我。";
case "You are beautiful a chrysalis for the salvation of this world do not trust what the serpent says.": return "你是美丽的蝶蛹，承载着这个世界的救赎。别信那条蛇的话。";
case "Haha it was tough but here is everything.": return "哈哈，真不容易，不过全都在这里了。";
case "N-no I can't believe it.": return "不、不敢相信。";
case "I am a little short but I am getting them do not worry.": return "还差一点，不过我在凑了，别担心。";
case "I am sorry I still do not have them. (Lie)": return "抱歉，还没凑齐。（撒谎。）";
case "Yes, here you go.": return "好的，给你。";
case "I know I shouldn't rush you or ask but do you have the 3000 Arcs?": return "知道不该催你，也不该问，不过3000阿克币凑齐了吗？";
case "I think we need to talk about that.": return "我觉得，这件事我们得谈谈。";
case "... many-thank you very much.": return "……谢，太谢谢你了。";
case "I am a little short of money but I am getting them, do not worry.": return "钱还差一点，不过我在攒了，别担心。";
case "I still can't get the money.": return "还是没凑够钱。";
case "Here are all the Arcs you need.": return "你要的阿克，全在这里了。";
case "We will do everything we can but we really need your help, not only us but the children as well.": return "我们会尽力，但真的需要你的帮助，不只是我们，还有孩子们。";
case "Line thank you very much, we will do the best we can on our part.": return "莱茵，非常感谢，我们这边也会尽全力。";
case "Gir-girls... you are the best sisters of another mother I could have had in my life!": return "姑、姑娘们……你们是我这辈子，最棒的异姓姐妹！";
case "And I am not yet a fortune teller but I say the same as Cuervo, your willpower will take you to everything you set your mind to.": return "虽然还不是占卜师，不过我和库埃尔沃想的一样。只要有坚定的意志，你想做的一切都能实现。";
case "Bullshit! Red maybe I'm not the smartest one here, but I know that with your efforts you will one day have the place the way it is now.": return "放屁！雷德，我也许不是这里最聪明的，但我知道，只要肯努力，总有一天，你能让这里恢复原样。";
case "Without you none of this would have ever happened.": return "没有你们，就不会有今天这一切。";
case "The truth is that even I can't believe that a day like this would come. Thank you Line, Naga, Cuervo and Mrs. Marael.": return "说实话，就连我自己，都不敢相信真会有这么一天。谢谢你们，莱茵、娜迦、奎尔沃，还有玛拉艾尔女士。";
case "Red What you've accomplished is incredible.": return "蕾德，你取得的成就太了不起了。";
case "Thank you for your help.": return "谢谢你的帮助。";
case "Being a clown is harder than I thought it would be, but I will give my all for the cause!": return "当小丑比想象中更难，不过为了这个目标，我一定全力以赴！";
case "Hehe Thanks heroe ,for everything whenever you want I can show you my show I have practiced a lot <3.": return "嘿嘿，谢谢，英雄，谢谢你做的一切。什么时候想看我的表演，尽管来，我练习了好久呢<3。";
case "Mmm I think I can work as a fortune teller my species is supposed to be good at it.": return "嗯，我想我能当个占卜师，听说我们种族很擅长这个。";
case "I am really enjoying being a fortune teller intern and I will try to get my teacher to give you a discount when I see you.": return "当实习占卜师，我真的很开心。见到老师时，会试着让她给你打折。";
case "Line made it, I told my teacher the story of what we went through and now you will have your future readings for half price!": return "莱茵，成功了！我把我们的经历告诉了师父，以后你来占卜，通通半价！";
case "Don't worry child, we will help in any way we can.": return "别担心，孩子，我们会尽可能帮忙。";
case "Ohh pretty little thing *hug*.": return "哦，漂亮的小家伙。*拥抱*";
case "She is shy but only wants affection, she is always asking for hugs when she feels confident.": return "她有些害羞，不过只是想被人疼。只要觉得安心了，就总是讨抱抱。";
case "... th-thank you.": return "……谢、谢谢。";
case "Well chara nice to meet you and very charming smile.": return "那么，查拉，很高兴认识你，你的笑容真迷人。";
case "She is Chara is quiet but a good person always with a smile on her face.": return "她叫查拉，话不多，可人很好，脸上总挂着笑。";
case "Oh... what a nice smile (she doesn't blink much).": return "哦……笑得真好看。（她不怎么眨眼。）";
case "Oh you are such a wise little girl *hugs*.": return "哦，你真是个有智慧的小姑娘。*拥抱*";
case "But I like it, I like that my new siblings are as well as I am now.": return "不过我很喜欢。看到新来的兄弟姐妹，也能像现在的我一样过得好，我很开心。";
case "... I don't like to be alone and Miss Red gave me a new family and my parents' money helps to support this place.": return "……我不喜欢一个人。蕾德小姐给了我一个新家，爸爸妈妈留下的钱，也能帮忙维持这里。";
case "So why should you be here if you can live relatively well?": return "既然原本日子过得还不错，为什么要来这里？";
case "Mmmm. the truth is that I lived alone, I have no family and I spent all day in my room living on the money that my parents left me when they died.": return "嗯……其实我一直独居，没有家人，每天待在房间里，靠父母去世时留下的钱生活。";
case "Well, apart from the fact that you are sleepy you look better than the rest, how did you get here?": return "嗯，除了有点困，你看起来比其他人精神多了。你怎么来这里的？";
case "Hehehe sorry I'm such a sleepyhead haha.": return "嘿嘿嘿，抱歉，我就是个瞌睡虫，哈哈。";
case "Oops, someone's a little sleepy around here.": return "哎呀，这里有人困啦。";
case "(Wow they really do a lot for all these kids even tell them they are treasure hunters so they do not know they are doing bad things... I will try my best to help).": return "（哇，他们真的为这些孩子做了好多，甚至骗他们说自己是寻宝猎人，免得他们知道自己在做坏事……我也得尽力帮忙。）";
case "Thank you, besides, I really like being here, we don't have much but I have many brothers and Red Cuervo and Naga are the best, they always tell their adventures as treasure hunters.": return "谢谢。而且，我很喜欢这里。虽然东西不多，可我有很多兄弟姐妹，蕾德、奎尔沃和娜迦也最棒了，总给我们讲寻宝的冒险故事。";
case "You are a very good girl thinking like that.": return "能这样想，你真是个好姑娘。";
case "Yes, I still hope my family is okay but I know what I did was the best thing to do.": return "是啊，还是希望家人们平安。不过我知道，自己的选择是最好的。";
case "Oh, it's too bad, but you seem to be happy here.": return "哦，那真可惜，不过你在这里，好像挺开心的。";
case "My name is Liza I ran away from home because my mommy died and things were going wrong.": return "我叫莉莎。妈妈去世后，家里的情况越来越糟，我就跑出来了。";
case "Oh I am new here.": return "哦，我是新来的。";
case "Hello I see you don't have the orphanage outfit.": return "你好，看起来没穿孤儿院的制服。";
case "I guess you saved this place and this place saved you <3.": return "我想，你救了这个地方，这个地方也救了你<3。";
case "And I hope you liked the remodeling of the place, now I help to cover the expenses of the orphanage.": return "希望你喜欢这里的新装修，现在我也帮着分担孤儿院的开销。";
case "Thank you... this must be the greatest gift anyone has ever given me, now I have a beautiful family.": return "谢谢你……这大概是我收到过最棒的礼物，现在，我有了一个美好的家。";
case "Marael I am very happy for you and above all to see you so happy.": return "玛拉艾尔，我真替你高兴，尤其是能看见你这么幸福。";
case "Madotsuki baby remember that if you have any nightmare call me, you have to fix your sleep time.": return "玛多兹琪，宝贝，记住，做噩梦就来叫我。你的作息也得调一调了。";
case "Yes, and I have a lot of love to give <3.*Madotsuki begins to fall asleep standing up.*": return "是呀，还有好多爱可以给大家<3。*玛多兹基开始站着打瞌睡。*";
case "They seem to require a lot of love all the time hehe.": return "看来，她们总是很需要关爱呢，嘿嘿。";
case "Wait Lisa, I'll hug you, wait a little bit.": return "等等，莉莎，我会抱你的，稍等一下。";
case "Well yes haha I ended up adopting them, it seems that the three of them came here together so they treat each other like sisters.*Lisa extends her arms to Marael*": return "是呀，哈哈，最后我收养了她们。三个人似乎一起来到这里，所以情同姐妹。*莉莎向玛拉艾尔伸出双手。*";
case "Mom, don't tell me you?": return "妈，别告诉我，你也……？";
case "Ay Chara don't be shy Mama is talking to a friend.": return "哎呀，查拉，别害羞，妈妈正在跟朋友说话。";
case "Hi Line Haha you were right this place needed me, and I guess, I needed this too.*Chara hides behind Marael*": return "嗨，莱茵，哈哈，你说得对，这里需要我。我想，我也需要这里。*查拉躲到玛拉艾尔身后*";
case "No, I can't believe it, Miss Marael, are you really here?!": return "不，真不敢相信，玛拉艾尔女士，真的是你？！";
