case "Flirt": return "调情";
case "Gift": return "赠礼";
case "Yes": return "是";
case "No": return "否";
case "You have that one already babe.": return "宝贝，那个你已经有了。";
case "Mmm. looks like you have that one alredy.": return "嗯，好像已经有这件了。";
case "It seems that you lack money, you don't want to pay it in another way?": return "看来钱不够，要不要换种方式付款？";
case "You lack of arcs to buy this.": return "你的阿克不够买这个。";
case "Now you will look more like an elf.": return "这下，你看起来更像精灵了。";
case "Looks nice on you.": return "你穿着很好看。";
case "You're leaving so soon babe.": return "这么快就走啦，宝贝。";
case "Come back soon.": return "下次再来。";
case "Welcome to the evergreen shop the best shop in town.": return "欢迎来到常青商店，镇上最棒的店。";
case "You need something more or just want to talk to me babe.": return "还想要什么，还是只想跟我聊聊，宝贝？";
case "You have problems deciding?": return "选不出来？";
case "Sorry Line but now we can't play together.": return "抱歉，莱茵，现在没法陪你玩。";
case "Thank you are so sweet , if you want a discount you must give me a better compliment haha.": return "谢谢，你嘴真甜。不过想打折，得再说点更好听的，哈哈。";
case "Oh, thank God, you are the best thing that has happened so far I was very hungry.": return "哦，谢天谢地，今天就数这件事最棒，我都饿坏了。";
case "I guess a nice gift would be something nice to drink.": return "想送礼的话，来点好喝的应该不错。";
case "*the saleswoman opens the bottles and drinks one with her mouth and the other pours it on her body* \nThanks *hip* you very mush traveleeer *hip*.": return "*售货员打开瓶子，一瓶对着嘴喝，另一瓶倒在自己身上*\n太*嗝*谢谢你啦，旅——人*嗝*。";
case "A gift eh? well, bring some beers again so we can play for a bit.": return "礼物啊？那再带些啤酒来，我们就能一起玩会儿了。";
case "I'm sorry I no longer have that garment.": return "对不起，那件衣服已经没有了。";
case "I'm desperate that I'm already selling the garment cheap, try to get some more Arcs.": return "都急得贱卖了，你就想办法再凑点阿克嘛。";
case "Thank you so much this will help me a lot!": return "太感谢了，这可帮了大忙！";
case "Wait don't leave! at least stay and watch me do a rimjob, maybe that will motivate you.": return "等等，别走！至少留下来，看我给人舔肛，说不定就让你心动了。";
case "Hey, I know you're not a VIP but if you buy me the reverse bunny clothes I'll give you a free rimjob. \n \nI thought I would get the VIP's attention with that weird outfit and make more money but, well I got to be the rimjob girl hehe, he, ehhh shit I just want to get my money back :c.": return "喂，知道你不是贵宾，不过要是买下这身逆兔女郎装，就免费给你舔一次肛。\n\n本来以为穿这身怪衣服，能勾住那些贵宾，多赚点钱。结果呢，反倒成了舔肛妹，嘿嘿，嘿，唉，妈的，只想回个本啊:c。";
case "Thanks for buying the suit if you need that ass to be clean, just turn around and press those cheeks into my face and I'll do the rest <3.": return "谢谢你买这套衣服。屁股要是想清理干净，就转过身，把两瓣臀肉贴我脸上，剩下的交给我<3。";
case "Oh you're killing me, if you don't want to buy them for yourself please do it for me I have children to feed ;c.": return "哦，你可愁死我了。不想买给自己，也拜托为了我买吧，我还有孩子要养;c。";
case "Thanks, it's nice to be treated like a human even though it's not necessary here. maybe we could meet another time hehe if you want to of course.": return "谢谢，虽然在这里，没必要拿我当人看，可这样被对待，还是很开心。要不，我们改天再见？嘿嘿，当然，得看你愿不愿意。";
case "There is no need for you to talk nice to me, I get paid per person who uses me, so stop your chitchat and go away you are in the way of the VIPs.": return "不用跟我说好听的，有人用我，我才拿得到钱。别闲聊了，快走，你挡着VIP了。";
case "Look I'm only for VIP's \nbut I can make an exception if you buy the reverse bunny suit.": return "听着，我只招待贵宾。\n不过，你要是买了反穿兔女郎装，我可以破例。";
case "Rimjob": return "舔肛";
case "UFff what an idiot! you already have this garment.": return "呼，真是个白痴！这件你已经有了。";
case "Oh well, it must be hard for your species to understand that you already bought that garment *giggles* poor thing.": return "哦，好吧，要让你们这个种族理解，衣服已经买过了，大概挺难。*轻笑*可怜的小东西。";
case "Ohhh you're missing Arcs, that's what you deserve for teaching me to be a pleasure addicted animal I wish you the worst in the world!": return "哦，阿克币不够啊，活该！谁让你把我教成了沉迷快感的野兽，祝你倒八辈子血霉！";
case "Are you trying to rob me here? Inside the house of god, I will let you go just because you are part of the prophecy but you better get Arcs if you want to buy something in life.": return "你想在这里抢劫？在上帝的殿堂里？看在你是预言中的人，这次就放过你。不过，想买东西，最好先去赚点阿克。";
case "I think I know where you get your money from, sadly because of you I have thoughts and the temptation to do the same. you are the worst thing I have ever encountered in my life.": return "我想我知道你的钱从哪儿来了。可悲的是，都怪你，让我也开始胡思乱想，甚至想照着做。你是我这辈子遇到过最糟糕的东西。";
case "I'm glad you bought it, with this you'll have some decency... you didn't steal Arcs to buy this did you?": return "买得好，这样总算体面一点……你没偷钱买这件吧？";
case "You didn't come to see the clothes you just want to please seeing the giant penis that because of you I use it to satisfy me like a brainless animal!": return "你根本不是来看衣服，只是想欣赏这根巨大的鸡巴！就是因为你，我才像个没脑子的野兽一样，拿它满足自己！";
case "Your species loves to waste good people's time, right?": return "你们这种生物，就爱浪费好人的时间，对吧？";
case "Welcome my stray lamb, what brings you here?": return "欢迎，迷途的羔羊，什么风把你吹来了？";
case "Another garment sold will be my way of redemption for the sinful acts I do in this sacred place.": return "在这神圣的地方犯下罪，我就靠多卖一件衣服来赎罪吧。";
case "I finally sold a garment, the sisters will be happy.": return "终于卖出一件衣服，修女们会高兴的。";
case "Ohhhh no need to flirt with me, you know that when you enter the confessional I fall prey to your demonic powers.": return "哦，不用撩拨我。你知道的，只要一进告解室，我就逃不过你恶魔般的力量。";
case "You are disgusting to try to flirt with a nun in the house of god! I'll give you some help since I feel sorry for you. go into the confessional and get all those sinful thoughts out of your head.": return "竟敢在上帝的殿堂里调戏修女，真恶心！看你可怜，给你点指点：去告解室，把脑子里那些罪恶念头，全倒出来。";
case "Mmm you have nothing to regret? I doubt it but I can't force anyone if you have nothing to do here you'd better leave.": return "嗯，没什么要忏悔的？我不信，但也不能强迫。没事做就请离开。";
case "I am here to listen to you with understanding and without judgment. Please tell me what you need to confess. In a way I am glad you are coming so you can change from the sinful path you are following.": return "我会耐心理解，不加评判。请告诉我，你有什么需要忏悔的。某种程度上，能见你过来，我很高兴，至少你能试着离开这条罪孽之路。";
case "Mhhm I am glad to see you again I can see that you started on the path to righteousness.": return "嗯，很高兴又见到你，看得出，你已经踏上了正道。";
case "... Why do you come here, you dirty sinner? if I could refuse you to enter the confessional, I would do it without a doubt.": return "……你为什么又来，肮脏的罪人？要是能禁止你进告解室，我绝不会犹豫。";
case "Ple-please do-don't come anymore, your presence is di-disturbing me, it's affecting my mind, PLEASE GO AWAY... I want to remain pure.": return "求、求你别、别再来了，你的出现让我心、心神不宁，连脑子都受影响。求你走吧……我想保持纯洁。";
case "... Ta-take this fura-fura fruit, please do not say anything.": return "……拿、拿着这颗芙拉芙拉果，求你别说出去。";
case "Confessional": return "告解室";
case "Haha cmon girl, I sold you that alredy.": return "哈哈，拜托，姑娘，那个已经卖给你了。";
case "Na girl you dont have enough Arc, but come later ya.": return "不行，姑娘，阿克币不够，晚点再来吧。";
case "Oh girl, that was a great purchase I tell ya.": return "哦，姑娘，这回你可买对了，真的。";
case "What the matter, is not your style city girl?": return "怎么，城里姑娘，不合你口味？";
case "Good morning, girl, what brings you to the farm?": return "早上好，姑娘，来农场有什么事？";
case "Don't worry little girl, I'll be here if you need me.": return "别担心，小姑娘，需要我，我就在这里。";
case "Ya are so kind, but my heart stays with my cows.": return "你真好，可我的心，已经留给奶牛们了。";
case "Hey thanks for earlier I just realized you did it so I could work more comfortably.\n\nBuy whatever you want the discounts are on me.": return "喂，刚才谢谢了，我才想明白，你是想让我工作得更舒服。\n\n想买什么尽管买，折扣我来出。";
case "The only gift you could give me, is for the guards to let me work naked.\n\nNowadays they find everything obscene but working the land as you came into the world is one of life's pleasures I tell ya.\n\nAlthough there is a way if someone tried to steal something I could take off some of my clothes to stop any kind of theft.": return "真想送我礼物，就让守卫同意，我可以光着身子干活。\n\n如今什么都说伤风败俗，可我告诉你，像出生时那样，赤条条地耕地，可是人生一大乐事。\n\n不过也不是完全没办法，要是有人想偷东西，我就能脱掉几件衣服，制止偷窃。";
case "Products": return "商品";
case "Outfits": return "服装";
case "I've already sold you that Line.": return "莱茵，那个已经卖给你了。";
case "Oh Line you are short of Arcs to buy this.": return "哦，莱茵，买这个，你的阿克还不够。";
case "You'll look as beautiful as I do with it on.": return "穿上它，你也会跟我一样漂亮。";
case "What happened you did not like the clothes?": return "怎么，不喜欢这些衣服？";
case "Hello little Line.": return "你好，小莱茵。";
case "What are you looking for?.": return "在找什么？";
case "Hey, do you want a second round already?": return "嘿，这么快就想再来一轮了？";
case "The best gift you can give me is to buy something. So we can move to a bigger place, the house is a little small.": return "最好的礼物，就是来买点东西。这样我们就能搬去大点的地方，现在的房子有些小。";
case "Oh girl, you will look great i tell ya.": return "哦，姑娘，相信我，穿上肯定好看。";
case "Very well, shall we start with your divination?": return "好，我们开始占卜吗？";
case "What fate has in store for you..": return "命运为你准备了什么呢……";
case "Don't waste your time don't you think it's better to know your future?": return "别浪费时间，知道自己的未来，不是更好吗？";
case "Thanks Line but now I want nothing more than to see what the future holds for others or myself.": return "莱茵，谢谢，不过现在，我只想看看别人，或我自己的未来。";
case "I guess I would like a scarlet crystal sphere, they are special because they let you see your own future from time to time.\n\nI would like to know what the stars have in store for me.": return "嗯，我想要颗绯红水晶球。它们很特别，偶尔能让人看见自己的未来。\n\n我想知道，群星为我安排了什么。";
case "Ah, traveler, heed my words. When you reach the place where you first set foot upon this island, seek the crimson tent. There, a radiant smile shall greet you, promising wonders untold.": return "啊，旅人，听我说。回到你第一次踏上这座岛的地方，寻找绯红的帐篷。那里会有灿烂的笑容迎接你，许诺无尽奇景。";
case "Ah, fortune seeker, listen carefully. To appease the stingy cat woman, give her a gift that will brighten her spirits and lift her spirits.": return "啊，求问命运之人，仔细听好。想安抚那吝啬的猫女，就送上一份能让她心情变好的礼物。";
case "Listen well, for an expert fisherman shall lend his aid. With his guidance, you will offer a gift to soothe the ire of a most ill-tempered cat.": return "仔细听，一位经验丰富的渔夫会助你一臂之力。在他的指引下，送上一份礼物，平息那只暴躁猫儿的怒火。";
case "The cat's mind lingers on the gift, her thoughts entwined with your return. She waits, unaware of your intent to steal a kiss from her unsuspecting lips.": return "猫娘还惦记着那份礼物，思绪缠绕着你的归来。她静静等着，却不知道，你想从她毫无防备的唇上偷走一吻。";
case "In the place where people lose consciousness, you shall overhear a conversation meant for other ears. Listen closely, for within it lies the information you seek.": return "在人们失去意识之地，你将听见一场本不该让你听到的谈话。仔细倾听，你要的消息，就藏在其中。";
case "A familiar figure awaits payment, standing by the water at dawn. They linger before the place where you crafted your humble abode.": return "熟悉的身影在黎明的水边，等着收钱。就在你为自己安置陋居的地方前方。";
case "A lone figure with magenta hair hands out money in the place where people drink until they lose consciousness.": return "在人们喝到不省人事的地方，一个洋红发色的身影，正在独自发钱。";
case "In the heart of the town, amidst the commotion, you will find a mother defending her children with all her might.": return "镇子中央，骚动之中，你会看见一位母亲，拼尽全力保护自己的孩子。";
case "A beautiful plant seeks your help after a long day of working under the sun with her faithful pet.": return "忠实的宠物陪伴着美丽的植物，她在烈日下劳作一天，盼望你的帮助。";
case "You will witness a dragon descending from the sky, where the cows graze peacefully.": return "你将见到巨龙从天而降，落在牛儿安静吃草的地方。";
case "In the dusk, a restless woman will befriend your other half within the house of laughter.": return "暮色降临，欢笑之屋里，一位不安分的女人，会与你的另一半结为朋友。";
case "Cows will witness you crossing paths with a person you only ever hoped to find in your dreams.": return "在牛儿的注视下，你将邂逅那个你曾以为只能在梦中遇见的人。";
case "A bridge where lies await you leads to an individual of ambiguous values.": return "一座充满谎言的桥，通向一个是非观念暧昧不清的人。";
case "In a place where people are mere objects, you will encounter someone as white as snow, but missing ashes.": return "在人被当成物件的地方，你会遇见一位白如雪、却缺少灰烬之人。";
case "text_adv_list,On the top floor, you will be met by someone whose attention has been captivated by your potential.": return "在顶层，一位被你潜力吸引的人，正等着见你。";
case "Consumed by hatred and rage, he wanders lost in the forest, seeking a lackey to guide him back to his home.": return "他被仇恨和怒火吞噬，迷失在森林里，寻找一名跟班，带他返回家园。";
case "Before the village, the green force carves a path to safety amidst the rocks scattered by the one-horned demon.": return "村庄前方，翠绿的力量，将在独角恶魔抛落的乱石间，开辟一条通往安全的道路。";
case "In the dead of night, within the silence of the forest, only a skilled magician remains.": return "夜深时，寂静的森林中，只留下一位娴熟的魔法师。";
case "Amidst laughter and drinks, lies a figure with little intellect, now reduced to an object, while his cat is in need of a new sailboat.": return "笑声与酒杯之间，一位头脑简单的人物已沦为玩物，而他的猫，需要一艘新帆船。";
case "In the midst of infinite fun, one of them did not return, overcome by pleasure. You must meet her near a restaurant and a sign.": return "无尽欢乐之中，有人沉迷快感，未曾归来。你得在一家餐馆和一块招牌附近，找到她。";
case "In a place without guards, a discussion is stirred up. Your presence would be quite beneficial.": return "在没有卫兵的地方，一场争执正在酝酿。你若到场，会大有帮助。";
case "Upstairs people are waiting for a cure but in the basement a strange figure awaits you.": return "楼上的人们等待救治，地下室却有个奇怪的身影等着你。";
case "In the night without a dragon at your side a house in the swamp something strange happens.": return "夜里，身边没有龙女时，沼泽中的某栋房子，正发生着怪事。";
case "An abandoned house, sees a flower in the daytime, which makes a beautiful bunny rabbit angry.": return "白天，一栋废弃房屋旁，有人望着一朵花，惹怒了一只漂亮的兔女郎。";
case "By day to the west of the farm a beautiful tune calls out to you.": return "白昼，农场西边，美妙的旋律正在呼唤你。";
case "In the dark west of the farm, a brown leather demon awaits you.": return "农场西边的黑暗中，棕色皮装的恶魔，正等着你。";
case "In a realm where the line between person and object is blurred, a golden-twintailed woman awaits you.": return "在人与物的界线模糊之处，一位金色双马尾女子正等着你。";
case "You will meet a powerful man surrounded by sheets of knowledge whose state is haunted by loss.": return "你将遇见一位强大的男人，被知识的书页簇拥，却为失落所困。";
case "A big green pet near the institute of knowledge, yearns to see its mistress again, unfortunately it is out of control.": return "知识殿堂附近，一只巨大的绿色宠物，渴望再见女主人。可惜，它已失去控制。";
case "Once said she was your teacher distracted by her own desires now she sells hamburgers your visit will brighten her miserable day.": return "她曾自称你的老师，却被自己的欲望分了心。如今卖起汉堡，你的到访，会为她悲惨的一天添点光彩。";
case "Silver skin companion awaits you away from home seeks to destroy itself.": return "银肤的同伴远离故乡，等待着你，一心想毁灭自己。";
case "Once helped for the second time by the lost dragon the fisherman will be in the basement of holes where his wishes will be frustrated.": return "第二次得到迷途龙女帮助后，渔夫会来到洞穴遍布的地下室，欲望却将在那里落空。";
case "I see the desperation of the farmer who is waiting for a gift from a God.": return "我看见农夫绝望地等候，盼望神明赐下礼物。";
case "Poor water nymph who can no longer differentiate the interest of the people. they will want more the products she sells? or she will be the object that they want?": return "可怜的水中仙女，已经分不清世人的企图。他们真正想要的，是她卖的商品，还是她自己？";
case "The kitten surrounded by red trees wants to find his better half in the warmest season of the year.": return "红树环绕的小猫，想在一年最热的季节，找到自己的另一半。";
case "the stars show me the following concepts: sudden wealth, hair of fire, incomplete desires, hause of pleasure.": return "星辰向我揭示了这些意象：横财、火焰般的头发、未遂的欲望、欢愉之屋。";
case "I see physical and temporal ruptures near the walls adorned with female figures.": return "在装饰着女性画像的墙壁附近，我看见了时空的裂隙。";
case "Ahead of the golden river quarter only the sunlight will give you the opportunity to find a blessing in disguise.": return "金河区前方，唯有阳光，才会赐你找到因祸得福之物的机会。";
case "The stars show me the following concepts, white pillar, healing, black hole and cleansing.": return "星辰向我揭示了这些意象：白色支柱、疗愈、黑洞与净化。";
case "In the house of knowledge, a simple tale calls its protagonist.": return "知识的殿堂里，一个简单的故事，正呼唤着它的主角。";
case "As night falls in the cloth house, laughter abounds your great desire awaits you the body change you have longed for.": return "夜幕降临，布料之屋中欢笑不断。你心底的渴望正在等你，那是你盼望已久的身体变化。";
case "The stars come together voices echo a syncronia wall of woods and Holes you will meet your phonetic simile.": return "群星交汇，声音共鸣。木板与洞口组成的墙后，你将遇见与你声线相同的人。";
case "See two stars intertwine, the night calls, synchronized footsteps and colored lights the glow of your companion is a strong emerald.": return "两颗星辰交缠，夜色呼唤，同步的舞步与彩色灯光中，你的舞伴闪耀着浓郁的翡翠之光。";
case "Oh yes I see it a star but not in the false sky projected from other dimensions, it is you singing in a river of gold the night will open the gates accompanied by the mooing of cows..": return "啊，是的，我看见一颗星。它不在其他次元投来的虚假天空中，那就是你，在黄金之河里歌唱。夜晚，伴着奶牛的哞叫，大门将为你敞开……";
case "I see you, in front of a destroyed building, once a house of lust, now witnessing again one of the worst atrocities of the island.": return "我看见你，站在一栋毁坏的建筑前。那里曾是欲望之所，而今，你又将目睹岛上最恶劣的暴行之一。";
case "OH God! please don't! Listen to me Well I never got to see such a clear future don't go to Verity Pond A Great formless sobbing force has you in its sights I repeat don't go to Verity Pond!": return "天哪！求你别去！听清楚，我从没看过这么清晰的未来。别去真相池塘！一股强大、无形、啜泣着的力量，已经盯上了你。再说一次，别去真相池塘！";
case "In the church of God's holy ground confession will bring you relief, lividity, anger and revenge.": return "在上帝的圣地教堂里，忏悔将带给你宽慰、欲念、愤怒与复仇。";
case "On the road to self-knowledge you will look for a friend who has already traveled a long way, she will try to advise you that the best way is ignorance.": return "在认识自我的路上，你会寻找一位早已走过漫长旅程的朋友。她会劝你，无知才是最好的路。";
case "Outside the scholar's house you will find a demon who is a true saint.": return "在学者的家门外，你会找到一位真正圣洁的恶魔。";
case "What, Futaba My trusted futanari is here in Elira and in this forest?!": return "什么，我信得过的扶她双叶，就在艾莉拉，在这片森林里？！";
case "The house of chains, people who can only see freedom in the sky is closed to the plebs. In front of it an ebony-colored knight will help you to enter.": return "锁链之屋，里面的人只能从天空看见自由，平民不得入内。门前，一位乌木色的骑士会帮你进去。";
case "Foreign fire hair drink waiting for the day to have a rematch against skinny girl.": return "异乡的火红秀发，举杯等待着，再与瘦姑娘一决高下的那一天。";
case "The stars show me many emotions will you fight against your mirror? A red ill water nymph will help you make it happen but are you really ready?": return "星辰向我展现了诸多情绪。你会与镜中的自己交战吗？一位红色、病态的水仙女，会帮助你实现它。可你真的准备好了吗？";
case "Mmmm the stars show me... you have a calcium deficiency? go buy milk that's what the stars tell me!": return "嗯，群星向我显示……你缺钙？去买牛奶吧，群星是这么说的！";
case "I see many stars colliding, fire star, lucky star and a star that divides like the cells all in the house of the star of the sea.": return "我看见许多星辰相撞，烈火之星、幸运之星，以及如细胞般分裂的星辰，都在海之星的居所。";
case "The stars show me that another star will shine for you, A GIFT! down where the privileged stars meet, there destiny will be waiting for you.": return "群星告诉我，另一颗明星将为你闪耀，是份礼物！去往地下，那些享受特权的明星聚会之处，命运正在等你。";
case "Opmeit nu, ramot edeup, erepse, sotad odnagrac! AHHH I see it, I see your future.": return "间时些一要需能可，等稍，入载在正据数！啊——看见了，看见你的未来了。";
case "Ah! your-your destiny is blocked, it's hard for me to read it, but for ": return "啊！你、你的命运被阻挡了，很难看清，不过只要";
case " arcs I'm sure I'll be able to focus on it.": return "阿克币，我肯定就能专注于此。";
case "What? Are you really going to give me that Crystal orb as a gift?\nYou know that for a fortune teller, this is the best thing in the world.\nYou know what I will give you anything you want, but first I will see my future.": return "什么？真的要把这颗水晶球送给我？\n你知道吗，对占卜师来说，这可是世上最棒的礼物。\n这样吧，你想要什么，我都给。不过先让我看看自己的未来。";
case "You have already met all the events that the stars told me.": return "星辰告诉我的所有事件，你都已经经历过了。";
case "Opmeit nu, ramot edeup, erepse, sotad odnagrac! AHHH I see it, I see my future.": return "间时些一要需能可，等稍，入载在正据数！啊——看见了，看见我自己的未来了。";
case "Ohh, the scarlet crystal sphere shows me my nearest future and  it seems that our fates are intertwined in body and soul. I have never challenged destiny before and I won't do it now, so let's do it.": return "哦，猩红水晶球让我看见最近的未来，看来我们的命运会在身心上交织。我从未违抗命运，现在也不会，那就来吧。";
case "Come on get naked destiny shows me that this is what you want and this is what's in store for us.": return "来，脱光。命运告诉我，这正是你想要的，也是等待我们的未来。";
case "Divination": return "占卜";
case "Divination Cost : ": return "占卜费用：";
case "I already sold you that product.": return "这件商品已经卖给你了。";
case "Miss you do not have enough money to buy this product.": return "小姐，你的钱不够购买这件商品。";
case "Good choice Miss.": return "好眼光，小姐。";
case "Not in the mood for a drink?": return "没心情喝一杯？";
case "Welcome Miss \nwhat would you like to drink?": return "欢迎，小姐。\n想喝点什么？";
case "There is no rush Miss, \ntake your time to think about what you want.": return "不必着急，小姐。\n慢慢想，你想要什么。";
case "Good try, but I've been working too many years to fall for a simple flirtation Haha.": return "撩得不错，不过干了这么多年，可不会被几句情话骗到，哈哈。";
case "Are you really still trying? I'm only here to sell so if you don't want to buy something go away.": return "还不死心？我只是来卖东西，不买就走吧。";
case "Mmm... You really come to this bar for me? No no no, Ahh this is just a trick I won't be fooled by your games": return "嗯……你真的是为我才来酒吧的？不不不，啊，这肯定是花招，我才不会上当。";
case "What?! You only buy here to see me, but here the prices are too expensive.Mmm the truth is that I have thought about you lately, but it is not because I love you or something, don't get your hopes up dummy.": return "什么？！你来这里买东西，就为了看我？可这里的东西贵得很。嗯，其实我最近也有想起你，不过才不是喜欢你什么的，别自作多情了，笨蛋。";
case "Do you really want me and only me, don't you want to use me to get better prices? Ahh ok wait for me in the VIP room if you really love me you will accept me no matter how weird I am.": return "你真的只想要我，不是为了利用我打折？啊，好吧，到VIP房等我。真爱我的话，无论我多古怪，你都会接受。";
case "A gift? I don't think I can receive presents during working hours, but thank you anyway.": return "礼物？上班时间，应该不能收礼，不过还是谢谢你。";
case "The bar has the right to sell lost property that has not been claimed for a period of 30 days. \n \nIf you have a problem with prices or if a product is for sale talk to Sieki the owner.": return "超过30天无人认领的失物，酒吧有权出售。\n\n对价格，或某件商品是否应该出售，有疑问的话，请找老板茜姬。";
case "Hahaha don't worry, even I wouldn't buy something that expensive.": return "哈哈哈，别在意，那么贵的东西，连我也舍不得买。";
case "Lost & Found": return "失物招领";
case "I'm sorry you're very pretty and everything but I have children maybe next time    (or for the full version of the game <3).": return "抱歉，你很漂亮，什么都好，可我有孩子。下次吧。（或者等游戏完整版<3。）";
case "New game": return "开始游戏";
case "Load game": return "读取存档";
case "This mode is dedicated to people who just want to experience": return "此模式适合只想体验";
case "the story with the sex scenes without having to think about combat.": return "剧情和性爱场景、不愿费心战斗的玩家。";
case "This mode is dedicated to all HARDCORE GAMERS! If you want to see a sex scene, it will have to be only by going through the toughest battles you have ever seen in a porn game.": return "本模式献给所有硬核玩家！想看性爱场景，就得打通你在色情游戏里见过的最狠战斗。";
case "Lewdstory": return "色情剧情";
case "PornSoulLike": return "色情魂系";
case "Thanks for being a Patreon <3": return "感谢你成为Patreon赞助者<3。";
case "Version ": return "版本";
case "Android Version ": return "安卓版 ";
case "Critical": return "暴击";
case "Weaker Attack": return "更弱攻击";
case "Weak Attack": return "弱攻击";
case "Critical Attack": return "暴击攻击";
case "que vola guacho qliao": return "咋样啊，傻逼小子。";
case "achievement unlocked :": return "成就解锁：";
case "Quest Started :": return "开始任务：";
case "Quest Completed :": return "任务完成：";
case "pan con queso": return "奶酪面包";
case "I used my last strength to summon some tentacles and take her to bed": return "我用最后一丝力气召出触手，把她抱上了床。";
case "The last thing that was heard about her is that she was on Elira, an island well known for its properties of uniting people.": return "最后的消息，是她去了艾莉拉。那座岛，以能让人结缘而闻名。";
case "When Line turned 18 she received her fairy companion. Toguether, they set out to search for Line's Friend.": return "莱茵十八岁那年，得到了自己的妖精搭档。她们结伴出发，寻找莱茵的朋友。";
case "The years passed and she still did not return...": return "多年过去，她却依然没有回来……";
case "'I am doing this for you, be strong'.": return "“我都是为了你，坚强点。”";
case "One day without warning one of the friends left the village, leaving a note for the other saying.": return "有一天，其中一位朋友，毫无预兆地离开了村子，只给另一位留下一张纸条，上面写着：";
case "Despite their differences, they were best friends.": return "尽管不同，她们仍是最好的朋友。";
case "One of was strong and empowered, the other was quiet and shy.": return "一个坚强而自信，另一个则安静而害羞。";
case "Many years ago there were two inseparable girls.": return "许多年前，有两个形影不离的女孩。";
case "Joined the Party": return "加入队伍";
case "Sam Hero of Tricotex": return "特里科特克斯英雄萨姆";
case "Yeah so-sorry you are right.": return "嗯，对、对不起，你说得对。";
case "Any way you need to focus were really close to find your her.": return "总之，你得专心点，我们离找到她，已经很近了。";
case "... Line sometimes you worry me.": return "……莱茵，有时候你真让我担心。";
case "Right, where did Charity go? she didn't even kiss me to say goodbye.": return "对了，查丽蒂去哪儿了？连个告别吻都没给我。";
case "Hey that's great, now you can !#%$% focus!": return "喂，太好了，这下总算能!#%$%专心了！";
case "She's not just any succubus, it's called Charity, she whispered in my ear <3.": return "她可不是普通魅魔，她叫查莉缇，是她亲口在我耳边告诉我的<3。";
case "The succubus took all your energy and then you passed out.": return "魅魔吸走了你所有精力，然后你就昏过去了。";
case "Wha-what happened?": return "怎、怎么回事？";
case "Wake up!": return "醒醒！";
case "This is bliss, Bliss <3.": return "这就是幸福，幸福啊<3。";
case "She is so warm, and she smells so good.": return "她好暖和，闻起来也好香。";
case "No way, she smells so sweet, I cant think of anything else.": return "不行，她的气味太甜了，我什么都想不了。";
case "Just enjoy it.": return "好好享受吧。";
case "Wh-why are you ge-getting closer... I am little dizzy.": return "你、你怎么靠、靠过来了……我有点晕。";
case "but I know I can win in my own way.": return "不过我知道，我能用自己的方式赢。";
case "Maybe i'm not as strong as you.": return "也许，我没你那么强。";
case "You will never beat me in a fight, now get out of my way!": return "打架你永远赢不了我，滚开！";
case "We can't go back, the boat sinks, we just have to continue.": return "回不去了，船沉了，我们只能往前走。";
case "I hope she is here.": return "希望她在这里。";
case "Pussy": return "小穴";
case "Wha-what why would it make me stronger? Is it a mushroom that we don't even know?.": return "什、什么，为什么吃了就能变强？我们连那是什么蘑菇，都不知道吧？";
case "Line look at that mushroom, if you eat it it will make you super strong.": return "莱茵，看看那蘑菇，吃了就能变得超强。";
case "Oh :c.": return "哦 :c。";
case "Mmm. Line that's pyrite, another idiot must have thought it was gold and brought it here.": return "嗯，莱茵，那是黄铁矿，肯定又有哪个白痴以为是金子，把它搬来了。";
case "Look _ili gold! we don't need to fight for money anymore <3.": return "看啊，_莉，黄金！再也不用为钱打架了<3。";
case "Fight!": return "战斗！";
case "But wait we are not the ones.": return "可等等，我们不是。";
case "Don't worry miners, I will save y'all.": return "矿工们，别担心，我来救你们！";
case "What?! no we no.": return "什么？！不，我们没有。";
case "You! you are the one who made the collapse!": return "你！就是你弄塌了这里！";
case "*Line murmurs his wish in Maria's ear*": return "*莱茵凑到玛丽亚耳边，轻声说出愿望*";
case "Hmm hehe, well look I want you to do this.": return "嗯，嘿嘿，是这样，我想让你做这件事。";
case "That's why I offer you a wish, whatever is within my reach, I will do it.": return "所以，我可以满足你一个愿望，只要在我能力之内，什么都行。";
case "But I was wrong and also I lost the battle I must regain my honor.": return "可我错了，还输了战斗。我必须挽回荣誉。";
case "When I fight with an enemy it is usually until one of the two dies.": return "我和敌人打起来，通常会一直打到一方死掉。";
case "Line and Maruia stay while all the miners leave the cave.": return "莱茵和玛露娅留在原地，矿工们全都离开了洞穴。";
case "Except you.": return "除了你。";
case "Okay, guys, you can go now, go see your loved ones.": return "好了，大家可以走了，去见你们心爱的人吧。";
case "Sorry but it's not me.": return "抱歉，可那不是我。";
case "So you are not the woman who caused the collapse?": return "所以，引发塌方的女人不是你？";
case "The guard who cleared the place asked us to see how things are here.": return "清理这里的卫兵，请我们过来看看情况。";
case "Hey stop it, we are not the bad ones!": return "喂，住手，我们不是坏人！";
case "Shit you're strong but as long as I'm here I won't let you hurt the miners.": return "妈的，你真强。不过只要有我在，别想伤害矿工。";
case "Well, Line, take care, I'll go to the hospital to see if a miner had a bigger problem.": return "好了，莱茵，保重。我去医院看看，有没有矿工伤得比较严重。";
case "I couldn't resist I needed to be between those thighs squeezing me. <3": return "忍不住了，我就想夹在那双大腿之间，让它们紧紧挤着我<3。";
case "haha shure you are a weirdo others would ask the same but the other way around.": return "哈哈，行，你真是个怪人。别人也会提这种要求，不过反过来。";
case "I don't think entering a house without permission is good idea.": return "没经过同意，就闯进别人家，不太好吧。";
case "oh ok :c": return "哦，好吧 :c";
case "I'm sorry miss but it's closed for now": return "对不起，小姐，暂时不开放。";
case "Yes you're right Lili maybe she could help us.": return "是啊，你说得对，莉莉，说不定她能帮忙。";
case "That woman on top of that box, she probably saw Ava.": return "箱子上那个女人，也许见过艾娃。";
case "Hey Line look.": return "嘿，莱茵，你看。";
case "Fuck no, besides, I'm getting bored.": return "才他妈不要，我也快无聊死了。";
case "Maybe give one more to be sure.": return "也许再给一次，保险些。";
case "Ok, Line enough, let's go back to that clown.": return "好了，莱茵，够了，回去找那个小丑吧。";
case "Relics stolen from temples it is better to speak in a private place.": return "从神殿里偷出的圣遗物……最好换个私密的地方谈。";
case "In the city strange things have been happening people disappearing.": return "城里一直在发生怪事，不断有人失踪。";
case "Why so much secrecy?": return "干吗这么神神秘秘？";
case "Mmm.. okay go to the hotel to the southwest, there tell the receptionist 'Mshonney have new workers' she will tell you what to do next.": return "嗯……好，去西南边的酒店，告诉前台“霍妮女士有新员工”，她会告诉你下一步怎么做。";
case "Whatever, help us find our friend.": return "随便吧，帮我们找到朋友。";
case "Hey Lili dont say that, she is joking please just ignore her.": return "莉莉，别这么说。她开玩笑的，别理她。";
case "Enough!! your jokes are boring for us.": return "够了！！这些笑话，我们已经听腻了。";
case "Mmm-no and that's just a stereotype.": return "嗯，不是，而且那只是刻板印象。";
case "aca lili y wea saltalo :v": return "这里是莉莉之类的内容，跳过吧:v。";
case "Ah of course the jokes of double meaning, since you are a succubus right?": return "啊，当然，是双关笑话嘛，毕竟你是魅魔，对吧？";
case "Oh-sorry I guess I like other kinds of jokes.": return "哦，抱歉，可能我比较喜欢别的笑话。";
case "You don't seem to like my comedy huh.": return "你看起来不太喜欢我的笑话啊。";
case "Don't destroy your brain with these stupid jokes,OK? ": return "别让这些蠢笑话把脑子毁了，好吗？ ";
case "This show sure really stings, isn't it?": return "这场演出可真“扎”心，是不是？";
case "Thanks god its end.": return "谢天谢地，终于结束了。";
case "Thank you for joining the show and make sure to BEE-hydrated all the time, everyone!": return "谢谢大家捧场，也别忘了随时补充水分，蜜蜜保湿哦！";
case "Hahahahahahahahahaha": return "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈";
case "See? This is how cactus pollinate, everyone..": return "看见了吗，各位，仙人掌就是这样授粉的……";
case "But you know what happens next? The thief then runs and gets hit by a big cactus in front of him! Now, he's crying like a ba-bee!.": return "可知道后来怎么了吗？小偷接着跑，一头撞上前面的大仙人掌！现在哭得像个小“蜂”宝宝！";
case "Please stop": return "请停下";
case "The thief then taunts 'Mind your bees-ness, Bee-tchs!'": return "小偷还嘲讽道：“关你们什么蜂事，蜂婆娘们！”";
case "And then the guards try to catch him. But the thief pours all the honey to the ground and the guards then slip and get stuck!": return "然后守卫们去抓他，结果小偷把蜂蜜全倒在地上，守卫就滑倒，全黏住了！";
case "Somebody stole all of them! Un-bee-lievable!": return "有人把它们全偷了！真是太蜂狂了！";
case "Have you ever heard about our new honey products that just released on our nearest market?": return "听说过吗？附近的市场，刚推出了我们的新款蜂蜜产品。";
case "Oh fuck.": return "哦，操。";
case "Come a little closer, people. I promise I won't sting ya.": return "大家再靠近一点，保证不扎你们。";
case "Oh no.": return "哦，不。";
case "Hey, greetings our fellow BEEINGS!": return "嘿，各位蜂友们，大家好！";
case "Mmm.. okay go to the hotel to the southwest, there tell the receptionist 'Mshonney has new workers' she will tell you what to do next.": return "嗯……好，去西南边的酒店，告诉前台“霍妮女士有新员工”，她会告诉你下一步怎么做。";
case "Finally the show ends and the people leave.": return "演出终于结束，观众们散去了。";
case "But Line is the only one who does not laugh.": return "可唯独莱茵没有笑。";
case "The act seems to be a success and the public is dying of laughter.": return "这场演出似乎很成功，观众笑得快断气了。";
case "Line and Lili arrive just in time to hear the show.": return "莱茵和莉莉来得正好，刚好赶上这场表演。";
case "Oh-ok but help me in what you can.": return "哦，好吧，尽你所能帮忙就行。";
case "The cat lady that we gave him the fish and gave us a discount to buy clothes.": return "就是我们送了鱼，还给我们买衣服打折的那个猫女。";
case "W-who?": return "谁、谁呀？";
case "Don't worry Line we'll start with someone you know.": return "别担心，莱茵，先从你认识的人开始。";
case "B-but you always do all the work, Lili you are my familiar it is your duty.": return "可、可是一直都是你做的呀！莉莉，你是我的使魔，这本来就是你的职责。";
case "Not this time, i will help you seduce your first person as sucubus.": return "这次不是，我要帮你第一次以魅魔身份勾引别人。";
case "You will help me meet another interesting person hehe?": return "你愿意再帮我认识一个有趣的人吗，嘿嘿？";
case "Hey Line I know you have a hard time taking the first step talking to people.": return "莱茵，我知道，主动跟人说话对你来说很难。";
case "Well if you really want to do that come behind the store but I still need to work.": return "真想那么做，就到店后面来吧，不过我还是得继续工作。";
case "I did not know that someone loved me so much to go to these extremes.": return "没想到，有人爱我爱到愿意做到这种地步。";
case "T-the thing is I see you working so hard and I would like to give you a good time but-but if you do not want to, I understand.": return "我、我看你工作那么辛苦，想让你开心一下，可、可你要是不愿意，我也理解。";
case "What!.": return "什么！";
case "I'm sorry for meddling, she wants to give you an oral because she loves you so much.": return "抱歉，多管闲事了。她是太爱你，才想给你口交。";
case "Ah well is mmm...": return "啊，那个，嗯……";
case "What do you mean Line?": return "你什么意思，莱茵？";
case "I-I would like us to take this to something mo-more private.": return "我、我想，跟你找个更、更私密的地方。";
case "I blush just to see you <3.": return "光是看见你，我就脸红了<3。";
case "Wow Line you are a better person than I thought and you are always so attentive to me.": return "哇，莱茵，你比我想的还体贴，而且总是这么关心我。";
case "I'll see how she attends and I'll tell you how quickly you lick her, just be attentive.": return "我会观察她招待客人的样子，告诉你该多快去舔她，你只要专心听着。";
case "Ok Line get down and get under the counter.": return "好，莱茵，蹲下来，钻到柜台下面。";
case "Go talk to Callie.": return "去和卡莉交谈。";
case "let's see how well you did.": return "看看你做得怎么样。";
case "But Lili :c.": return "可是，莉莉 :c。";
case "Ah, don't worry Line we figure it out.": return "啊，别担心，莱茵，总有办法的。";
case "Bu-but what are we going to do?": return "可、可是，我们该怎么办？";
case "Yeah maybe It wasn't the best person to improve your succubus powers.": return "是啊，找她提升你的魅魔之力，也许真不太合适。";
case "She wants to introduce me to her children and start a new family.": return "她想把我介绍给自己的孩子，重新组建一个家。";
case "I th-think we went to far.": return "我、我觉得，我们做得太过了。";
case "Wait Lili.": return "等等，莉莉。";
case "Accept that you are half succubus, for God's sake you are already twenty.": return "接受自己半魅魔的身份吧，拜托，你都二十岁了。";
case "O-ok I will use it as a last resort you know how shy i am.": return "好、好吧，我会留作最后的手段，你知道我有多害羞。";
case "You have to use your succubus skills in combat to improve the changes of winning.": return "战斗中得用上魅魔能力，才能增加获胜机会。";
case "Worth investigating but you can't lose again.": return "值得调查，不过你可不能再输。";
case "Of the demon there was already a one who knew Ava, maybe he knows something too.": return "之前的恶魔里，就有一个认识艾娃，说不定他也知道些什么。";
case "About what?": return "关于什么？";
case "Lili, we have to do something.": return "莉莉，我们得做点什么。";
case "Saving the game will change the time of day, and there are certain events that only happen at specific times.": return "保存游戏会改变时段，某些事件只在特定时间发生。";
case "Inside, you can save your game on a mattress that's on the floor.": return "里面地板上有张床垫，可以在那里存档。";
case "The warehause will be your personal home.": return "这间仓库，可以当作你的私人住处。";
case "Uhhh, honestly, I do not like the idea, but it is better than nothing. ;c": return "呃，说实话，我不喜欢这个主意，不过，总比没有强;c。";
case "Oh, it was nothing... Hey, this cellar doesn't look so bad\nwe could use it as a home while we're on the island.": return "哦，小事而已……嘿，这地下室看着也不赖。\n我们待在岛上的时候，可以把它当家。";
case "You are a hero, Lili! <3.": return "莉莉，你真是英雄！<3。";
case "Take the baww, you adorable fwuff!": return "来，拿球球，你这可爱的毛茸茸！";
case "Hmm... I think he wants that ball on the roof, I'll get it down.": return "嗯……它好像想要屋顶上那个球，我去拿下来。";
case "Why did the dog bring us here?": return "那条狗为什么带我们来这里？";
case "Cariel Town": return "卡里艾尔镇";
case "Welcome to the town of Cariel number one place for honeymoons, sexual discovery and acceptance by all.": return "欢迎来到卡莉耶尔镇，这里是蜜月、探索性欲，以及包容所有人的首选之地。";
case "The idea is to give her to drink alcohol so that she is drunk enough to give us some good discounts.": return "就是想让她喝醉，醉到愿意给我们一个好折扣。";
case "I know it doesn't hydrate!": return "我知道那不补水！";
case "B-but that does not hydrate :c.": return "可、可是，那又不补水:c。";
case "What we are going to do is buy alcohol at the bar.": return "接下来去酒吧买酒。";
case "Not that stupid! You see, that's why I'm the one in charge in this duo.": return "不是那个意思，笨蛋！看吧，所以咱们俩，得由我来做主。";
case "Yeah, I had planned to fill a bottle of water in the river": return "是啊，我本来打算去河边灌瓶水。";
case "Did you hear that line? she wants something to drink.": return "听见了吗，莱茵？她想喝点东西。";
case "Thanks Lili you are the best <3.": return "谢谢你，莉莉，你最好了<3。";
case "Of course Line go and have fun <3.": return "当然，莱茵，去玩吧<3。";
case "Mmm.. ca-can I go now?.": return "嗯……我、我能走了吗？";
case "Yeah, I only plan to have a discount. Maybe I have powers that exceed my own understanding.": return "对，我本来只是想要个折扣。也许，我拥有连自己都无法理解的力量。";
case "I think that woman wants to break my ass but in a good way": return "感觉那女人想把我屁股狠狠干开，不过是舒服的那种。";
case "Line.. what the fuck just happened?.": return "莱茵……刚才他妈的发生了什么？";
case "And just so you know I'm the one in charge here.": return "先说清楚，这里由我做主。";
case "Wha-Wha-Whaaat!": return "什、什、什么！";
case "You are very pretty, I guess your effort was worth it haha.": return "你很漂亮，看来付出的努力没有白费，哈哈。";
case "Ah!?": return "啊！？";
case "Do you know that it is also inappropriate? having sex behind my store.": return "知道还有什么也不合适吗？在我商店后面做爱。";
case "AHHhh. no-it was not intentional.. I am really sorry it was really inappropriate.": return "啊——不、不是故意的……真的对不起，太失礼了。";
case "I say I'm not stupid, notice how you undress me with your eyes from head to toe.": return "我又不傻，看看，你都用眼神把我从头到脚扒光了。";
case "What-what does that mean hehe.": return "那、那是什么意思，嘿嘿。";
case "And I love people with resilience.": return "而我，喜欢坚韧不拔的人。";
case "I never thought after so many failed compliments you will buy some much drinks for me.": return "说了那么多蹩脚情话，没想到最后竟然给我买了这么多酒。";
case "Now, shut up, I've been holding back all this time and I can't take it anymore.": return "现在闭嘴，我已经忍了这么久，实在受不了了。";
case "Don't worry, my pet will scare away anyone who come here.": return "别担心，我的宠物会吓跑所有来这里的人。";
case "I-I am somewhat shy, I do not know if I can do it here, someone could see us.": return "我、我有点害羞，不知道能不能在这里，可能会被人看到。";
case "God, you're slow, why are you taking so long?": return "天啊，你真慢，怎么花这么久？";
case "Well whatever, it was the first time i had such aggressive sex <3": return "算了，反正是第一次这么激烈地做爱<3。";
case "... No.": return "……不。";
case "There is no possibility that she is also half succubus right?": return "她总不可能也是半魅魔吧？";
case "For the love of God, Line, you were the one who fainted at the climax, aren't you ashamed to be a succubus?": return "天哪，莱茵，高潮时昏过去的可是你，还好意思说自己是魅魔？";
case "Sure Sam <3.": return "当然，萨姆 <3。";
case "Oh wait Lilly could you go to the hotel and get my wallet for me? it's room 001.": return "哦，等等，莉莉，能去酒店帮我拿钱包吗？001号房。";
case "That sounds good, let's get in.": return "听着不错，进去吧。";
case "If you want to rest before leaving, we can enter.": return "走之前想休息的话，我们可以进去。";
case "Not quite, I use it to sleep from time to time.": return "不算，我偶尔在里面睡觉。";
case "Hey Line, This place is empty?": return "嘿，莱茵，这地方没人住？";
case "Great go to the second floor of the hotel I'll wait for you there. <3": return "太好了，去旅馆二楼吧，我在那里等你<3。";
case "It would be an honor lucy. <3": return "荣幸之至，露西。<3";
case "I wanted you to see it before I publish it if you don't mind.": return "不介意的话，想在出版前先给你看看。";
case "Thanks to you I had enough inspiration to finish my novel and well": return "多亏你，我总算有了足够的灵感，能把小说写完，所以……";
case "Yes, what do you need?": return "嗯，需要什么？";
case "Line you have a moment.": return "莱茵，有空吗？";
case "I'm counting on you, we're short-handed due to the theft of the relics so just try to help out and stay out of trouble.": return "就靠你们了。圣物被盗，搞得我们人手紧张，尽量搭把手，别惹麻烦就行。";
case "Oh, ok I will do it.(I just hope Ava is on the island)": return "哦，好，我会的。（只希望艾娃就在岛上。）";
case "And if you see any person on the island with a problem that you can solve, you will also offer your help.": return "还有，在岛上看见有人遇到你能解决的困难，也要主动帮忙。";
case "Mmmmm let me think... I know what you could do to help us look for the relic!": return "嗯，让我想想……有了，你可以帮我们寻找圣遗物！";
case "Wait isn't there a way to stay on the island since you know we are innocent?": return "等等，既然知道我们无辜，就没有办法留在岛上吗？";
case "I will escort you to your boat.": return "我会护送你到船边。";
case "If you stay you will hinder the search that is why the island is closed.": return "你留下，会妨碍搜查，所以才要封岛。";
case "A relic was recently stolen from the island and the witness was able to identify that the perpetrator had horns.": return "最近，岛上的一件圣遗物被偷了。目击者辨认出，作案者长着角。";
case "Wh-what why?": return "什、什么，为什么？";
case "I am sorry but I will have to ask you to leave the island.": return "抱歉，不过得请你们离开这座岛。";
case "Oh I ju-just arrived on a raft.": return "哦，我刚、刚坐木筏到这里。";
case "I have never seen you on this island before.": return "以前从没在岛上见过你。";
case "Ho-hello is there a problem?": return "你、你好，出什么事了吗？";
case "Hey you unihorn, come here now!": return "喂，那个独角的，立刻过来！";
case "And-we could pick up where we left off <3.": return "而且……我们还可以接着上次没做完的<3。";
case "Great it will be the four of us, as soon as you get to the house, I'll make something you'll love!": return "太好了，我们四个一起。等你到了家，我就做些你绝对喜欢的东西！";
case "I-I would love to Callie.": return "卡莉，我、我很愿意。";
case "( I-I do not want to give her false hope, I really do not want to hurt her but to reject her would also be rude. )": return "（我、我不想给她虚假的希望，更不想伤害她，可拒绝也很失礼。）";
case "Hey Line, I was wondering if you wanted to have lunch with me and my son at my house today?": return "嘿，莱茵，今天要不要来我家，跟我和儿子一起吃午饭？";
case "That's okay, at least I'll keep my oldest son, he'll keep his old mother company.": return "没关系，至少大儿子还会留下，陪陪我这个老妈。";
case "Oh... Callie I am so sorry.": return "哦……卡莉，真对不起。";
case "... Someone had to take care of them while I was away.": return "……我不在的时候，总得有人照顾他们。";
case "Well, sort of, I got out just in time to see my kids leave with their dad.": return "算是吧，刚好出门，就看见孩子们跟爸爸走了。";
case "I am so glad Callie, now you can be with your children.": return "真替你高兴，卡莉，终于能跟孩子们团聚了。";
case "Yeah haha, it's not like I did anything serious enough to stay there any longer.": return "是啊，哈哈，我又没干什么严重到需要再关久点的事。";
case "Callie, you are finally out of the jail-farm!": return "卡莉，你总算从监狱农场出来了！";
case "Oh-Mmmm... but I've always been here.": return "哦，嗯……可是我一直在这里。";
case "Who are you? You should not be here.": return "你是谁？不该到这里来。";
case "Hey everyone, come on in, the best store is open for everyone!": return "各位，快进来，最棒的商店欢迎所有人！";
case "Ah why, what did I say?": return "啊？为什么，我说什么了？";
case "... I think you mean Come With you.": return "……我想，你想说的是跟你一起去。";
case "Leafy Cum on my if you want to live! * extends her hand *": return "叶叶，想活命，就射到我身上！*伸出手*";
case "Stop right there! you are under arrest by the law of Elira.": return "站住！依照艾莉拉法律，你被捕了。";
case "She is attacking the saleswoman!": return "她在袭击售货员！";
case "That is why we will go as fast as possible.": return "所以，我们会尽快赶过去。";
case "How dangerous that it is so close where there are such vulnerable people.": return "这么危险的东西，居然离那些脆弱的人这么近。";
case "We have to go to the last location is in front of the hospital.": return "去最后一个地点，就在医院前面。";
case "But that will have to wait": return "不过，那得等一等。";
case "Mmmm... if we find out what these keys open, we can find out what's really going on.": return "嗯……只要弄清这些钥匙能打开什么，就能知道，到底发生了什么。";
case "Most likely they got it, where they come from.": return "多半是从他们来的地方弄到的。";
case "So these slime are not stealing these keys.": return "所以，这些史莱姆并不是在偷钥匙。";
case "I knew it, here is another key!": return "就知道，这里还有一把钥匙！";
case "Well I'm drunk enough to confess to Callie.": return "好，已经喝够胆了，去向卡莉告白。";
case "... no drink ... no courage.": return "……没酒……没胆。";
case "Miss that room is for employees only.": return "小姐，那个房间，只有员工能进。";
case "I know i'm awesome.": return "我知道自己很棒。";
case "Great idea Lili <3.": return "好主意，莉莉<3。";
case "Line ask the bartender if she knows where we can buy premium cigarettes.": return "莱茵，问问酒保，知不知道哪里能买高档香烟。";
case "OHh, Hi, mmm  I Have to go now, ehh sorry.": return "哦，你好，嗯，我得走了，呃，抱歉。";
case "To the lady over there.": return "那边那位女士。";
case "What! to whom?": return "什么！对谁？";
