case "What are you talking about, you know that by law you must give me the coat?!": return "你说什么？按法律，你得把大衣交给我，知道吗？！";
case "Sorry but it is now our property, if you want to have it you can buy it.": return "抱歉，现在归我们所有，想要，就买回去。";
case "Aqua you have to give me that coat is evidence of a case of moral indecency": return "阿夸，把大衣给我，这是一起有伤风化案件的证物。";
