case "My pride is on the line.": return "事关我的尊严。";
case "Let's drink and the first one to fall unconscious loses.": return "开喝，谁先不省人事谁输。";
case "I'm not in the mood for jokes now sit down.": return "现在没心情开玩笑，坐下。";
case "Bu-ut I do not want to fight :c.": return "可、可是我不想打架:c。";
case "Where do you think you are going we are going to finish what we started.": return "想去哪儿？开始了，就得分个高下。";
case "Ah?!": return "啊？！";
case "Hey wait!": return "嘿，等等！";
case "Oh well that's great haha well I'm off now take car-": return "哦，那真好，哈哈，那我先走了，保重——";
case "Ahh I already paid for it, now I'll treat myself.": return "啊，反正已经付过钱，就好好犒劳一下自己。";
