case "Ah you're coming for a rematch?! Well, that's good hahaha.": return "啊，来再战一场？！那好啊，哈哈哈。";
case "Hey relax skinny girl what happened in the bathroom stays in the bathroom.": return "喂，放松，小瘦姑娘，厕所里发生的事，就留在厕所。";
case "Maybe next time skinny girl HAHAHAHAHA.": return "下次吧，瘦丫头，哈哈哈哈。";
case "Shit, I think I overdid it too, I'll go to the bathroom too.": return "靠，好像我也过量了，也得去趟厕所。";
