case "Ohh... thanks a lot Rynn I will stay away from there.": return "哦……谢谢你，琳恩，我会避开那里的。";
case "All right, but just to be sure, *Slurrrp* don't go behind the hospital, there's that old creep, I don't want anything to happen to you.": return "好，不过，保险起见，*吸溜——*别去医院后面，那个老变态在那里。我可不想你出事。";
case "I will not. I will be good.": return "不会的，我会乖乖的。";
case "*Glup glup* Ahhhh Well but I promised the fairy that you wouldn't get in trouble. *Slurrrp*": return "*咕咚咕咚*啊——好吧，可我答应妖精，不让你出事。*吸溜*";
case "Oh, really I wanted to continue exploring the island.": return "哦，其实还想继续逛逛这座岛呢。";
case "Hey skinny let's drink While we wait for your friend.": return "嘿，瘦姑娘，等你朋友的时候，陪我喝点。";
case "Come on Lili I am not a child.": return "来嘛，莉莉，我又不是小孩。";
case "-_-II that doesn't calm me down.": return "-_-II这可没让我安心。";
case "Yeah don't worry, she will be with me if she needs help with anything or to talk to anyone, I will be here.": return "嗯，放心，她跟着我。有什么要帮忙的，或者想找人说话，我都在。";
case "Do not worry Lili, I am a grown woman.": return "别担心，莉莉，我是个成年女人。";
case "I'm meeting someone so you'll be alone for a while, promise to stay out of trouble?": return "我要去见个人，你得自己待一会儿，保证不惹麻烦，好吗？";
case "Yes?": return "嗯？";
case "Hey, Line...": return "嘿，莱茵……";
case "Uugh... okay I-I'm leaving. * leaves with a noticeable bulge in his pants *": return "呃……好，我、我走。*裤子明显鼓着一大包，离开了*";
