case "So get out of here, you fat, filthy creep!": return "所以，滚吧，你这个又肥又脏的变态！";
case "HEY, LISTEN TO ME, YOU FUCKING SCUMBAG! She'll do what she wants with her body, but she'll never sell it.": return "喂，给我听清楚，你这个该死的人渣！她想怎么用自己的身体都行，可绝不会卖身！";
case "Eheheh and what about you Miss Elf? I have five Thousand Arcs here-": return "嘿嘿，那精灵小姐呢？我这里有五千阿克币——";
case "EIHhh!": return "诶——！";
