case "* surprise * Oh, Lili .. did you just judge someone without even knowing him?": return "*惊讶*哦，莉莉……还没认识他，你就先下判断了？";
case "Damn Line! look at his appearance the guy could not look more dangerous.": return "妈的，莱茵！看看他的样子，还能更危险一点吗？";
case "Well, we are here, and if it was so dangerous, why not, did he attack us before?": return "嗯，我们到了。要真那么危险，之前怎么不来攻击？";
case "Line I think he apologizes for us to do what he needs and not because he really is sorry.": return "莱茵，我觉得他道歉，只是想让我们替他办事，不是真的觉得对不起。";
case "Nooo! He needs help also, you saw how I did apologize and if a person manages to apologize I don't think it's as bad as you say.": return "不是！他也需要帮助。而且你也看见了，他向我道歉了。能愿意道歉的人，我想就没你说的那么坏。";
case "Line I know that you are a little naive for this world but I think it would be better not to go back to that guy.": return "莱茵，我知道你对这个世界还有点天真，不过最好别再去找那家伙。";
case "We got it  lili <3!.": return "拿到了，莉莉<3！";
case "I'm sorry but we can't, someone else needs this crystal to return home": return "对不起，不行。有人还等着这块水晶回家。";
case "Why is it that every time I find a crystal, you are in the middle?": return "为什么每次找到水晶，你都掺和在里面？";
case "This Crystal belongs to the Red Team.": return "这块水晶属于红队。";
case "No Lili, that poor man needs our help, if not, he will never return to his dimension": return "不行，莉莉，那个可怜的人需要帮助，不然就永远回不了自己的次元。";
case "Line let her take it and let's go on our way": return "莱茵，让她拿去，我们继续走。";
case "DEV: Sorry dude, the gallery is only for the full game you will have to put away that dingledong.": return "开发者：抱歉，老兄，相册只在完整版开放，先把你那小家伙收起来吧。";
case "Saving the game do not turn off the console...": return "正在保存游戏，请勿关闭主机……";
case "Gallery.": return "画廊。";
case "Do you want to sleep and save the game?": return "要睡觉并存档吗？";
case "I know that is why I want to give you this, my friend Laura loves it.": return "知道，所以才想送你这个。我朋友劳拉可喜欢了。";
case "Oh theres no problem I did it because I wanted to be close to you, i gues hehe.": return "哦，没关系，我这么做，应该就是想靠近你吧，嘿嘿。";
case "Line, I wanted to thank you for helping me catch that criminal.": return "莱茵，谢谢你帮我抓住那个罪犯。";
case "I could not agree more haha.": return "完全同意，哈哈。";
case "I must say it was a pleasure to be so close to her <3.": return "不得不说，能跟她那么亲近，真让人开心<3。";
case "Oh look what she gave me before he left, it's an autographed photo of her and 30 buppy bucks if we go to tricotex someday.": return "哦，看看她走前给我的东西，是她的签名照，还有30巴皮币，以后去特里科特克斯能用。";
case "Dont worry about me Lili, I do not think saying goodbye was necessary <3.": return "莉莉，别担心我。我觉得，没必要特地道别<3。";
case "Oh Line you fell asleep, and you couldn't you said goodbye to Sam.": return "哦，莱茵，你睡着了，没能跟萨姆道别。";
case "Line realizes that she is in her bed and understands that Sam left her there.": return "莱茵发现自己躺在床上，明白是萨姆把她送回来的。";
case "Lili wakes up Line.": return "莉莉叫醒了莱茵。";
case "Give me everything you got!": return "有什么本事，全使出来！";
case "Ca-calm Line I... I.. I can not contain myself anymore.": return "冷、冷静，莱茵，我……我……实在忍不住了。";
case "The fruit made you gro-grow a really big penis.": return "那颗水果，让你长出了好、好大一根鸡巴。";
case "I would not know how to do it, please help me, I can no longer contain myself.": return "我不知道该怎么做，求你帮我，我已经忍不住了。";
case "You-your fruit made me grow this.": return "你、你的水果，让我长出了这个。";
case "Please Vasuki I don't think I can't masturbate.": return "瓦苏基，求你，我觉得自己没法自慰。";
case "I will go to that corner until the effect passes be-because I think the e-effect is increasing.": return "我去那个角落，待到效果过去吧，因、因为，我觉得药、药效好像还在增强。";
case "Line no I... I can't cheat on my husband.": return "莱茵，不，我……我不能背叛丈夫。";
case "Vasuki, please, I think I can't take it anymore.": return "瓦苏基，求你了，我好像受不了了。";
case "I'm-sorry, I'm not a lesbian and I-have a family.": return "对、对不起，我不是女同性恋，而且我还有家人。";
case "Oh Vasuki, I really would like to kiss that angelic face of yours.": return "哦，瓦苏基，真想亲亲你那张天使般的脸。";
case "Yeah I think mine is an aphrodisiac, I-I feel kinda hot.": return "对，我想我这颗有催情作用，我、我感觉好热。";
case "Ohh... Vasuki these fruits have something strange about them.": return "哦……瓦苏基，这些水果有点奇怪。";
case "Vasuki and Line eat the exotic fruits.": return "瓦苏基和莱茵吃下了异界水果。";
case "Ok i will eat the red one.": return "好，那我吃红的。";
case "I want to eat the long one.": return "我想吃那根长的。";
case "The cows gave it to me, so that I could sell them instead of eating them, but since we don't have anything else.": return "是奶牛们给的，叫我拿来卖，别吃。不过，既然没有别的东西了。";
case "Wow i've never seen these fruits before.": return "哇，以前从没见过这些水果。";
case "Look Line, aren't these fruits strange? hehe.": return "看，莱茵，这些水果，是不是很奇怪？嘿嘿。";
case "Also I think there is something more that want me to stay.": return "而且，我想还有别的东西，想让我留下。";
case "My husband is the King he will protect the children, now I just want to be with you Line <3.": return "我丈夫是国王，他会保护好孩子们。现在，我只想和你在一起，莱茵<3。";
case "Wha-what about-your family?": return "那、那你的家人呢？";
case "You know what, I could stay here a while longer and be with you.": return "这样吧，我可以多留一会儿，陪着你。";
case "Yes, love was the best, too bad you have to go.": return "是啊，亲爱的，刚才太棒了，可惜你得走。";
case "Ohh. Line th-that was great..": return "哦，莱茵，刚、刚才真棒……";
case "Although, it is not that bad.": return "不过，倒也没那么糟。";
case "*Takes off his boots*  Uhhh it seems that I have walked a lot this smell is very strong.": return "*脱掉靴子*呃，看来走了不少路，这味道真够重的。";
case "A well-deserved rest after helping every DAM islander you bump into!": return "逮着岛民就帮，帮了他妈的每一个人，终于该歇歇了！";
case "Ohh finally I will be able to rest a bit": return "哦，终于能稍微休息一下了。";
case "Help me please! I feel like I'm going to explode, I really need it!": return "求你帮我！感觉要炸了，真的好想要！";
case "Ya ssh sh I need you to put it in, I can't wait!": return "好了，嘘，嘘，我要你插进来，等不了了！";
case "bu-but.": return "可、可是。";
case "Now! Lili uses your weapon to create a mega cock!": return "现在！莉莉，用你的武器，造一根超级大屌！";
case "I don't recognize you...": return "我不认识你……";
case "Oh fuck you and do not talk to me about this subject anymore!": return "哦，去你妈的，别再跟我说这件事了！";
case "I didn't think something like this could happen, Line even has people here and you didn't give a crap!": return "真没想到，会发生这种事。莱茵，这里明明还有其他人，你居然一点都不在乎！";
case "Shut up, I can quit this, whenever I want, did you not say you would help me in whatever I need!": return "闭嘴，我想戒，随时能戒。不是说了，我需要什么，你都帮吗！";
case "But it hasn't been long since the last time you had sex... Line I think you have to stop this for a while.": return "可是你上次做爱，也没过去多久……莱茵，觉得你得先停一阵子。";
case "I had not had sex in a while.": return "我有一阵子没做爱了。";
case "Line, are you okay, did you relax? It's the first time I've seen you like this.": return "莱茵，你还好吗？放松下来了？第一次看见你这样。";
case "I didn't think something like this could happen.": return "没想到，会发生这种事。";
case "AHHH MY BALLLS!!": return "啊——我的蛋蛋！！";
case "I am so sorry ;c I trie my best to contain her rage.": return "真的对不起;c，我已经尽力压住她的怒火了。";
case "Shit that woman hit me in the balls in the Sabbath.": return "妈的，那女人在女巫集会里踢了我的蛋。";
case "Yes, we are not priority because they are unconscious by magic, but I want to know if they will be alright anyway..": return "对，我们不算优先处理，因为她们是被魔法弄昏的。但我还是想知道，她们会不会有事……";
case "Naoki, are you still waiting here?": return "直树，你还在这里等着？";
case "I'm half elf so I think it comes from that ahah.": return "我有一半精灵血统，应该就是因为这个，哈哈。";
case "Oh Maruia you are a very good orc. <3": return "哦，玛鲁娅，你真是个好兽人。<3";
case "I am waiting, that they attend one of the miners.": return "我在等他们给一个矿工治疗。";
case "Good, thanks for asking and what are you doing?.": return "挺好，谢谢关心，你在做什么？";
case "Oh Line, how's everything going?": return "哦，莱茵，一切还好吗？";
case "Oh okay do not worry, if it is just raising a lever I do not think it won't take more than 2 minutes": return "哦，好，别担心。只是扳个拉杆，我想两分钟都用不了。";
case "It is, our reserve generators went off and I need you to lift a lever to turn them on. They are in the left basement of the hospital.": return "是的，备用发电机停了，需要你拉起拉杆，重新启动。就在医院左边的地下室。";
case "Mmmm well, if it is something small": return "嗯，只要是件小事。";
case "If you don't need anything, could you do me a little favor?": return "没什么需要的话，能帮我个小忙吗？";
case "Oh ,well the truth no, but thanks.": return "哦，其实没什么，不过谢谢。";
case "Hello, good morning, are you coming for a check-up?": return "你好，早上好，是来检查身体的吗？";
case "Something like that, he told me he had to train privately for his show so I think he went to find a new hiding place to practice his magic.": return "差不多吧。他说得为演出私下练习，大概去找新的藏身处练魔法了。";
case "And he said where was he going?": return "那他说，要去哪里了吗？";
case "It seemed that he had something to do so I told him to leave, and I will wait for my sister.": return "他好像有事，就让他先走了。我会等我姐姐。";
case "Hi Equinox, have you seen Naoki?": return "你好，伊奎诺克斯，见过直树吗？";
case "Iugg Lili kill me please *covers her face in shame*.": return "呃，莉莉，杀了我吧。*羞愧地捂住脸*";
case "I recommend less sex if you are not going to take care of your hygiene.": return "如果不注意个人卫生，我建议，少做点爱。";
case "Uhhh... is it okay, I am sorry *sobs*.": return "呃……没关系，对不起。*抽泣*";
case "Summary, High amount of sexual intercourse plus never having had a cleaning before will raise the price to a whopping amount.": return "总之，性交次数多，再加上从没清理过，价格就会贵得吓人。";
case "since it would be your first time, it would probably take more than usual, plus I've worked long enough to know that you've already had sex, which raises the price.": return "既然是第一次，大概会比平时更费时间。而且干了这么多年，我知道你已经做过爱了，价格还得往上加。";
case "WHAT THEE!": return "搞什——么！";
case "Perfect, it is only 3000 Arcs": return "很好，只要3000阿克。";
case "Ehhh hehe maybe it wouldn't be bad if I had a cleanup, it would be my first time.": return "呃，嘿嘿，清理一下，或许也不错，这还是第一次呢。";
case "It can be done without it but it is not recommended.": return "不做也可以，不过不推荐。";
case "Mmmm so if someone does it for that place is it necessary what you offer me?": return "嗯，所以要从那里做，就必须用你这项服务？";
case "Sorry I thought it was one of those low life women. usually they come to clean up to keep working properly.": return "抱歉，还以为是那种底层女人。她们常来清理，好继续干活。";
case "Oh m-me? no I just got a little lost hehe.": return "哦，我、我吗？没，只是有点迷路，嘿嘿。";
case "Welcome, are you coming for an anal cleansing?": return "欢迎，是来清洁肛门的吗？";
case "You still don't have the money? don't worry, I can wait until you get it.": return "钱还不够？没关系，我可以等你凑齐。";
case "Because of the amount I will use, you may resist, it will help me make the process go faster and also it may make the slime pop a little so you won't stain your clothes.": return "我要用的量不小，可能会让你产生抗拒。不过这能加快流程，也可能让史莱姆稍微溅出来点，免得弄脏衣服。";
case "What, why?": return "什么，为什么？";
case "All right, please take off your clothes, turn around and I'll have to tie you up with this.": return "好了，请脱掉衣服，转过身，我得用这个，把你绑起来。";
case "All right, I'll be waiting here if you change your mind.": return "好吧，改主意的话，我就在这里等。";
case "No thanks, right now I need the Arcs.": return "不用，谢谢，我现在需要这些阿克。";
case "Yes please (pay for the service).": return "好的，麻烦了。（支付服务费。）";
case "Do you want to pay for anal cleaning services?": return "是否支付肛门清洁服务费？";
case "When I clean everything here, you can have another cleaning.": return "等我把这里清理干净，你就可以再来清洁一次。";
case "Slime": return "史莱姆";
case "Wha-what!": return "什、什么！";
case "I can't do much about your weird new look, but I think I might be able to beat some sense back into your head-- *cracks knuckles*": return "你这副奇怪的新样子，我是没办法。不过，给你揍清醒点，应该还行——*捏响指节*";
case "Hold on, squirt: YOU'RE trying to help ME? It looks like time travel can screw up your body AND your brain!": return "等等，小不点，你要帮我？看来时间旅行，连身体和脑子都能一起搞坏！";
case "Oh Lily, she looks really disoriented.": return "哦，莉莉，她看起来很迷茫。";
case "Ta-Talia ?! What happened to you? The King never told us that time travel could change our appearances!": return "塔、塔莉娅？！你怎么变成这样了？国王从没说过，时间旅行会改变外表！";
case "Eh.. a-are you ok?(Wow is very pretty)": return "呃……你、你没事吧？（哇，真漂亮。）";
case "RGHhhh... ugh, my head's killing me! I don't remember the King saying time travel would hurt...": return "呃……唔，头疼死了！不记得国王说过，穿越时间还会疼……";
case "What that fuck!": return "什么鬼！";
case "Faye super Soldier of the king": return "菲伊：国王的超级战士";
case "Let's get on with it already then!": return "那就赶紧开始！";
case "No, we will have to find one.": return "没有，我们得找一个。";
case "Sure, sure. Enough chatting, though. Do you know a magician who can manipulate the rift?": return "好，好。不过别聊了，你认识能操纵裂隙的魔法师吗？";
case "What are you a hero or something?": return "你是什么英雄之类的人吗？";
case "Look, time is of the essence. Every minute I spend here, is a minute less I have left to take over-- save my Kingdom.": return "听着，时间紧迫。在这里多耽误一分钟，我就少一分钟去夺取——拯救王国。";
case "Yeas yes yes whatever Lili , what do you need beautiful redhead <3?": return "是是是，随便啦，莉莉。漂亮的红发姑娘，你需要什么<3？";
case "Hey line, are you really gonna help this brat?": return "喂，莱茵，你真要帮这个臭丫头？";
case "Alright, get to it then already!": return "行了，赶快动手！";
case "Yes, leave it to me and Lili.": return "对，交给我和莉莉吧。";
case "( What the fuck is she talking about? We beat you like 10 seconds ago )": return "（她他妈在说什么？十秒钟前才刚被我们揍过。）";
case "Are you really going to help a stranger who kicked your ass?": return "连揍过你的陌生人，也真要帮？";
case "Mmm I have, helped others to return to their dimension and I-If you want you can call me Talia since it is the name that you murmur so much.": return "嗯，我帮过别人回到自己的次元。你、你愿意的话，也可以叫我塔莉娅，毕竟你一直念叨这个名字。";
case "* Faye begins to sob *": return "*菲开始抽泣*";
case "What's the true.": return "真相是什么。";
case "The saddest thing that you didn't even make it to the year 3000 of this dimension.": return "最惨的是，你甚至没来到这个次元的3000年。";
case "Rgh... if Talia made it through, then there's no way I'm going to catch up to her. I can't let that happen, she can't beat me--": return "唔……塔莉娅要是成功过去，我就再也追不上她了。绝对不行，不能让她赢过我——";
case "When you arrived, that crystal was created, it usually happens when someone reaches this dimension by mistake.": return "你到来时，就产生了那块水晶。有人意外来到这个次元时，通常都会这样。";
case "Are you SURE this isn't the year 3000 AD?": return "确定这里不是公元3000年？";
case "No, sorry actually it's 201 AO.": return "不是，抱歉，其实是AO201年。";
case "This DIMENSION? You're telling me I traveled through space, not time? Shit...": return "这个次元？你是说，我穿越了空间，不是时间？妈的……";
case "Calm down Lili, she was disoriented from traveling to this dimension.": return "冷静，莉莉，她刚穿越到这个次元，有点迷糊而已。";
case "Dumbass, we've been telling you that from the beginning!": return "笨蛋，从一开始就在告诉你！";
case "Wait a minute... you're not Talia.": return "等等……你不是塔莉娅。";
case "Yes, thank you very much Line, I will continue training for my show, you know where to find me if you need something else.": return "好，谢谢你，莱茵。我会继续练习演出，知道去哪儿找我，有需要随时来。";
case "Finally, Faye We did it, you see Naoki you had the power to do it.": return "终于，菲伊，我们成功了！直树，看吧，你有能力做到。";
case "Done The dimensional rift is already Ready To get to the year 3000 AD.": return "好了，次元裂隙已经准备好，可以通往公元3000年。";
case "Ohh Faye you are a sweetheart <3.": return "哦，菲伊，你真贴心<3。";
case "This is all very different from my time but, I am glad you are here to help me Thanks Talia.": return "一切都跟我的时代完全不同，不过还好有你帮忙，谢谢，塔莉娅。";
case "Ohmmm...": return "哦嗯……";
case "I am sorry to show you this facet Faye, but there was no other option to help you.": return "抱歉，让你看见我这一面，菲伊。不过，为了帮你，别无他法。";
case "Oh right, you didn't know Line is half succubus is what she does best, although she acts like a saint.": return "哦，对，你还不知道，莱茵有一半魅魔血统，这才是她最擅长的，虽然装得像圣女一样。";
case "Wow, the King told us the year 3000 is full of perverts, but is EVERYWHERE full of them besides 1000 AD?": return "哇，国王说公元3000年到处都是变态，难道除了公元1000年，其他地方全是这样？";
case "* Naoki finally calms down when he ejaculates and begins to modify the rift correctly *": return "*直树射精后，终于平静下来，开始正确地调整裂隙。*";
case "Don't worry, this will calm you down * Line grabs naoki from behind and masturbates him until he ejaculates * ": return "别担心，这会让你冷静下来。*莱茵从背后抱住直树，帮他打手枪，直到射精* ";
case "Oh well I-I don't know *Line strips naked and walks over to naoki and starts taking off his clothes*": return "哦，那个，我、我不知道。*莱茵脱光衣服，走向直树，开始脱他的衣服。*";
case "Calm Naoki you want me to help you with your nerves, as before.": return "冷静，直树，想让我像上次那样，帮你放松一下吗？";
case "Is she alright? No magicians I've ever known had to chant stuff to cast magic.": return "她没事吧？我认识的魔法师，没一个需要念叨着施法。";
case "I-I will Try*Naoki start to shake because of nerves*.": return "我、我试试。*直树紧张得发抖*";
case "Hmm... would these earrings of mine work? They're from where I come from, 1000 AD. Maybe you can use that as a marker in time and then jump forward 2000 years?": return "嗯……我这对耳环能用吗？它们来自我的时代，公元1000年。或许可以用它作时间标记，再向未来跳2000年？";
case "What?! But I have never done this, at least you have an object of that dimension that would help me to have a time reference?": return "什么？！可我从没做过。至少有没有那个次元的物品，能帮我确定时间参照？";
case "We need the dimensional rift to open in the year 3000 AD of that dimension.": return "我们需要让次元裂隙，通向那个次元的公元3000年。";
case "B-but you haven't told me what to do.": return "可、可你还没告诉我，该做什么。";
case "Alright, so let's see some magic!": return "好，来看看魔法吧！";
case "Is Talia that desperate to keep me from beating her? Sending weird robots to attack me? Sheesh.": return "塔莉娅就这么怕输给我？居然派奇怪的机器人来袭击，真是的。";
case "Look like the kettle thing doesn't want you to go to your dimension Faye.": return "看来，那个水壶一样的东西，不想让你回自己的次元啊，菲伊。";
case "W-800 Series Gratters like myself have been employed to seal the dimensional holes created by violators, on behalf of the World Organization for Reformation of the Masses.": return "像我这样的W-800系列格拉特，受世界大众改造组织雇用，负责封闭违规者制造的次元洞。";
case "One of you violated the dimensional agreement; this is a parallel timeline had agreed to distance itself from our own. I am The Timekeper W.O.R.M System model 101": return "你们之中，有人违反了次元协议。这条平行时间线，曾同意与我们的时间线保持距离。我是时间守卫W.O.R.M系统，型号101。";
case "What the hell?!": return "搞什么鬼？！";
case "I seems so. Hopefully I don't end up somewhere even weirder this time, no offense.": return "看来是。希望这次别去到更奇怪的地方，没有冒犯的意思。";
case "Well it seems this is the goodbye.": return "好吧，看来要道别了。";
case "AAAHHHHHHH Whatever, fine, it's not like anything else is working. Weird ass dimensional weirdos... * Faye takes her clothes off *": return "啊啊啊啊，随便了，行，反正别的方法也不管用。你们这群怪里怪气的次元怪人……*菲脱掉衣服*";
case "Please Faye Believe in me is the only way. (this is my only chance to have sex with her!)": return "求你，菲伊，相信我，只有这个办法。（这是唯一能和她做爱的机会！）";
case "You really ARE all perverts. Get sex off your mind, and let's blow this thing up!": return "你们还真全是变态。把性爱从脑子里赶出去，先把这东西炸了！";
case "Faye We have to let ourselves lose!": return "菲，我们得故意输掉！";
case "* Line begins to recognize a smell coming from the robot. *MHmm ... those tanks ... those tentacles, oh I know what to do!": return "*莱茵逐渐认出机器人身上传来的气味*嗯……那些罐子……那些触手，哦，知道该怎么办了！";
case "What are you thinking so much?": return "你在想什么呢，想这么久？";
case "Mhmmm...": return "嗯哼……";
case "It would be a good idea, if we had done some damage!": return "前提是咱们打得出伤害，那主意才算好！";
case "How is this thing shrugging off everything we're throwing at it?  Change of strategy; Line, destroy those cylinders on it; maybe that's where its energy comes from.": return "怎么我们的攻击，全都被它扛下来了？换个策略，莱茵，破坏它身上的那些圆筒，说不定，能量就是从那里来的。";
case "Very proud of you Line.": return "很为你骄傲，莱茵。";
case "Shhhh Lili.": return "嘘，莉莉。";
case "Hey Line, if they only needed your milk to beat the robot, why did you make her get naked too?": return "喂，莱茵，打败机器人只需要你的奶，为什么还让她也脱光？";
case "Bye...": return "再见……";
case "Goodbye Line, it's time to go.": return "再见，莱茵，该走了。";
case "Hehe yeah, that's my name <3 and Kick that Talia's ass, Faye I will wait for your return.": return "嘿嘿，没错，就叫这个<3。去踢烂塔莉娅的屁股，菲伊，我等你回来。";
case "Yeah, once I've got this future weapon I'm looking for, I want to see you again and thank you properly Ta-sorry your name is Line isn't it?": return "对，等我拿到要找的未来武器，还想再见你一次，好好谢谢你。塔——抱歉，你叫莱茵，对吧？";
case "It sounds like you're leaving.": return "听起来，你要走了。";
case "We finally had a stroke of luck now it's all over.": return "终于走运了，这下总算结束。";
case "We were lucky that instead of stopping it, it exploded.": return "还好，没能阻止它，倒是把它炸了。";
case "Well I deduced that the robot used milk as energy just like a succubus if we allowed ourselves to be milked my milk would consume the energy of the robot's stored milk.": return "我推测，机器人像魅魔一样用奶作能源。让它给我们挤奶，我的奶就会吸掉它储存的奶里的能量。";
case "That didn't explain anything.": return "这根本什么都没解释。";
case "Hehe I-I guess <3.": return "嘿嘿，我、我想是吧<3。";
case "Wow, Line you have a brain.": return "哇，莱茵，你居然有脑子。";
case "Well, my succubus powers helped me to know that inside those cylinders there was woman's milk and the tentacles had a substance that stimulates milk production like succubus saliva.": return "其实，是魅魔之力帮我发现，圆筒里装的是女人的奶水，触手上也有类似魅魔唾液、能促进产奶的物质。";
case "Ahnn... mmmmnn... t-that was intense. Line, how did you know that'd destroy him?": return "啊嗯……嗯……刚、刚才太激烈了。莱茵，怎么知道那样就能毁掉它？";
case "I don't know how to tell Eleanor about this but I'd better finish our research and then I'll explain everything to her.": return "不知道该怎么跟埃莉诺解释，不过还是先完成研究，再把一切都告诉她吧。";
case "A body in a vegetable state... or did they mean that it had no soul? it could do so, but even a body without a soul would still have consciousness.": return "一具植物人状态的身体……还是说，没有灵魂？倒也可能，可就算没有灵魂，身体也依旧会有意识。";
case "they asked me for a body .... without a conscience but alive... I don't really know what they meant.": return "他们要我找一具身体……没有意识，却还活着……我也不明白，究竟是什么意思。";
case "They appeared.": return "他们出现了。";
case "* The book is dirty and only a few pages are readable *": return "*书很脏，只有几页还能辨认*";
case "Clearly not a success but they work for now. If I catch the target I can use them to verify the individual.": return "显然不算成功，不过暂时能用。抓到目标后，就可以用它们，确认身份。";
case "Although these beings are able to accomplish their sole objective, they lack the ability to reason, making them unable to move from the place where they are prostrate.": return "这些生物，虽然能完成自身唯一的目标，却不具备思考能力，因此无法离开瘫伏之处。";
case "Have only one objective, to catch and verify that the host is compatible with Eleonor.": return "只有一个目标，抓捕并确认宿主与埃莉诺兼容。";
case "I was able to create the first primitive, circular body by surface tension.": return "借助表面张力，我造出了最初的原始圆形身体。";
case "Kamiko the wyvern": return "翼龙神子";
case "Well, thanks to you, the town is much safer, besides that you solved the alcohol problem, I guess that's fine.": return "嗯，多亏了你，镇上安全多了，还解决了酒的问题。我想，这样也不错。";
case "I will also bring her to be milked.": return "我也会把她带来挤奶。";
case "Can I take this criminal with me? It would be a great help.": return "能把这个罪犯交给我带走吗？能帮上大忙。";
case "Oh never mind, I have a better idea.": return "哦，算了，有个更好的主意。";
case "*Kamiko let's out an embarrassing moan as her tits are being milked dry. She stands defeated*": return "*奶子被彻底挤空，神子羞耻地呻吟着，垂头丧气地站在那里*";
case "Please shut up, we are talking here.": return "请闭嘴，我们在说话。";
case "MOOO! - MOOO! Nghgh - MOOOooo~ ": return "哞——！－哞——！嗯啊－哞~ ";
case "Traveler I'm sorry to tell you that right now I don't have all the reward.": return "旅行者，很抱歉，现在我还凑不齐全部赏金。";
case "MOOO! - MOOOooo~ ngh...": return "哞——！－哞~嗯……";
case "Uuughh.. m-moo... mo-Nghh!~ Mooo-mooo": return "呜嗯……哞、哞……哞——嗯啊！~哞，哞。";
case "H-hngh!!... Dammit-ahh~ How did it come to this?!": return "嗯、嗯啊！！……可恶，啊~怎么会变成这样？！";
case "Hey here you don't talk you damn cow!": return "喂，这儿没你说话的份，臭奶牛！";
case "You'll pay for this!!": return "你会付出代价的！！";
case "Are you listening?!.": return "听见没有？！";
case "Hey! What the fuck are you doing?!": return "喂！你他妈在干什么？！";
case "(I don't think they dared to turn it on)": return "（我想，她们应该不敢开机器。）";
case "I think our little friend has not made her daily milk quota.": return "看来，我们的小朋友还没完成今天的产奶指标。";
case "Go turn on the machine.": return "去把机器打开。";
case "Ehh .. and how?": return "呃……怎么做？";
case "It seems that we will have to make her speak.": return "看来，得想办法让她开口了。";
case "(Big thing i just won't say anything)": return "（有什么大不了的，不说话就是。）";
case "Oh yes, listen Lili if they say something else I think they increase the time in jail.": return "哦，对，莉莉，听着，再说别的话，好像就会加刑期。";
case "Line, I understand that cows can only say moo.": return "莱茵，我记得奶牛只能说“哞”。";
case "Ah go fuck yourself.": return "啊，去你妈的。";
case "hehe clearly it is Lili.": return "嘿嘿，当然是莉莉。";
case "Uyy look Line is not a cute cow <3?": return "哎呀，莱茵，这奶牛不可爱吗<3？";
case "What do you want?!": return "你想干什么？！";
case "Ohh of course we will go to see her haha.": return "哦，当然会去看她，哈哈。";
case "If you want, you can go see the criminal while I count the money.": return "你愿意的话，数钱这段时间，可以去看看那个罪犯。";
case "Sure just give me a second.": return "好，等我一下。";
case "Lili, manners.": return "莉莉，注意礼貌。";
case "Where is the reward?": return "奖励在哪儿？";
case "*whispering * Line turn on the machine and let's get the hell out of here.": return "*小声说*莱茵，打开机器，我们赶紧离开这鬼地方。";
case "What...?": return "什么……？";
case "In a way I'm here because I want hu-hu-hu.": return "某种程度上，我是自愿待在这儿的，呵、呵呵。";
case "Oh darling there is no guard here who dares to raise his voice to me.": return "哦，亲爱的，这里没有哪个卫兵，敢对我大声说话。";
case "Hey I have a question, why are you talking shouldn't you say moo?": return "喂，想问一下，你为什么还在说话，不是该哞哞叫吗？";
case "Now you can turn on that machine I have a lot of milk in these udders.": return "可以打开机器了，我这乳房里全是奶。";
case "Oh thanks.": return "哦，谢谢。";
case "I will not tell a soul.": return "我不会向任何人透露。";
case "Oh no-no need, uhh.. could you do not tell anyone what I did to beat you hehe.. ple-please.": return "哦，不、不用，呃……别告诉别人，我是怎么赢你的，嘿嘿……求、求你了。";
case "But you came and you made me feel so, so good hu-hu.": return "可你来了，还把我弄得那么、那么舒服，呼呼。";
case "I like the place, maybe I killed and drank so much because I was frustrated.": return "我喜欢这里，也许以前杀那么多人、喝那么多酒，都是因为太压抑。";
case "Calm down, I have no grudge towards my little half succubus.": return "放心，我对自己的小半魅魔，没有怨恨。";
case "Uh.. hello, do you... enjoy the place? I mean ... hello :c.": return "呃……你好，这里……还喜欢吗？我是说……你好:c。";
case "It seems that we meet again.": return "看来，又见面了。";
case "Turn on the machine Line see if she shut up.": return "莱茵，开机器，看看她还能不能闭嘴。";
case "Tristan is not a puppet!.": return "特里斯坦才不是傀儡！";
case "Looking at the bright side they let you keep the puppet.": return "往好处想，至少让你留下了那个玩偶。";
case "And that fairy i guess.": return "还有那只妖精吧。";
case "When I come out I will take revenge on you and Sam!.": return "出去以后，我一定找你和萨姆报仇！";
case "Oh it's you, you really think i'll stay here forever.": return "哦，是你，真以为我会永远留在这里？";
case "Is this a reference?.": return "这是在玩什么梗？";
case "Beep bo bop.": return "哔哔，啵啵。";
case "Plz do-do not do it (uff yeah, God yes, I want to scream and moan while everyone looks at me)": return "求、求你，别这样。（呼，对，天啊，太对了，真想当着所有人的面，放声尖叫、呻吟。）";
case "Not even if they tickle you while they suck your milk.": return "就算一边挤奶，一边挠你痒痒，也不说？";
case "Mm-m moo (what's planned?)": return "哞、哞哞。（什么计划？）";
case "hey cows just say moo!": return "喂，奶牛只能说“哞”！";
case "Lili .. n-do-do not do anything weird please.": return "莉莉……别、别乱来，求你了。";
case "I'll turn on the machine.": return "我要开机器了。";
case "Mmm.. yeah. I already have it on.": return "嗯……对，已经开了。";
case "Did you put on your cow clothes?": return "奶牛装穿好了吗？";
case "Go to the upper left corner, there will be a machine waiting for you to suck your milk.": return "去左上角，有台机器等着吸你的奶。";
case "Take this, you will have to eat this fruit has a special effect that makes you produce more milk than if you were pregnant.": return "拿着，吃下这颗水果。它有特殊效果，能让你产的奶，比怀孕时还多。";
case "(Wow, just say you want to get milked to the brain)": return "（哇，想被挤奶挤到脑子都空掉就直说。）";
case "... The truth is that I think I deserve the punishment, she gave me a lot of money, I feel guilty that people suffered for it.": return "……其实，我觉得这惩罚是应得的。她给了我很多钱，大家却因此受苦，我很内疚。";
case "So the only option you have is to be milked to pay your sentence and I'll set you free.": return "所以，唯一的选择，就是靠挤奶服刑，期满就放你自由。";
case "Look, I can't let her go without serving some kind of sentence.": return "听着，我不能让她毫无惩罚地离开。";
case "Hey hey low the voice that others will think of me, Ehemm! well back to the topic, until now she has been a remarkable citizen.": return "喂喂，小点声，别人会怎么看我，咳咳！回到正题，到目前为止，她一直是位优秀市民。";
case "Plus she rimmed the white demon to capture her while you stared and did nothing!": return "而且，为了抓住白色恶魔，她都去舔肛了，你却光站着看，什么也没干！";
case "Hey come on, give us a warning, we have done more than any citizen of Elira.": return "喂，拜托，警告一次就好了吧。我们做的事，比艾莉拉任何市民都多。";
case "That rat said everything to have less sentence time, Line was the only one who made a deal with her.": return "那只老鼠，是为了减刑，才把一切都说了。跟她做交易的，只有莱茵。";
case "Wait and how do you know that they made a loan to Line.": return "等等，你怎么知道她们借钱给莱茵了？";
case "She is a thief and to launder the money she makes illegal loans, by law the borrower also has a penalty.": return "她是个贼，还靠非法放贷洗钱。按法律，借款人也有罪。";
case "You see that woman with purple hair.": return "看见那个紫头发女人了吗？";
case "WHAT!?": return "什么！？";
case "Line... sorry to tell you that you are under arrest.": return "莱茵……很抱歉，你被捕了。";
case "Ay Lili, don't be paranoid, we are heroes, maybe she called us to catch another criminal.": return "哎呀，莉莉，别疑神疑鬼，我们可是英雄。也许叫我们来，是为了抓另一个罪犯。";
case "It seems serious, we better escape.": return "好像很严重，还是逃吧。";
case "Could you come for a moment.": return "能过来一下吗？";
case "Line!": return "莱茵！";
case "shut up.": return "闭嘴。";
case "Hey now you have your mother's long tongue when you are completely aroused.": return "喂，彻底发情时，你也有你妈妈那条长舌头了。";
case "Ok line that's all we need you can go": return "好了，莱茵，就这些，你可以走了。";
case "Moo moo ranch": return "哞哞牧场";
case "Welcome to the Moo moo ranch prison and producer of the best breast milk of all dimensions. we also hire women and sell the best aphrodisiac fruits to fulfill any sexual desire <3.": return "欢迎来到哞哞牧场监狱，这里出产所有次元最棒的母乳。我们也招募女性，贩卖最好的催情水果，满足各种性欲<3。";
case "What!?.": return "什么！？";
case "Nyann!.": return "喵！";
case "We already beat you, surrender like a good kitten.": return "你已经输了，像只乖猫咪一样投降吧。";
case "Stop thinking with your horn we have to go back.": return "别再用你的角思考了，我们得回去。";
case "She did not stay with me :c hopefully I can see her again hehe.": return "她没有跟我留下来:c，希望还能再见到她，嘿嘿。";
case "She escaped I stayed here taking care of you.": return "她逃了，我留在这里照顾你。";
case "Where did the lady cat go?": return "猫女去哪儿了？";
case "Shit Line you pass out.": return "妈的，莱茵，你昏过去了。";
case "In the meantime you can enjoy the activities the island has to offer.": return "这期间，可以体验一下岛上的各种活动。";
case "Oh, I didn't know :c.": return "哦，我不知道:c。";
case "Sorry miss, right now the great captain is busy looking for a con artist posing as one of us.": return "抱歉，小姐，伟大的队长现在正忙着，寻找冒充我们行骗的骗子。";
case "Great let's go right away someone could be in danger.": return "太好了，马上去，也许有人正遇到危险。";
case "I do Sam :D, it is east of town, passing the bridge of lovers.": return "我知道，萨姆:D，在镇子东边，过了情人桥就到。";
case "Ok going back to the topic, I was informed that the criminal would be in the magenta swamp, do you know where it is?": return "好，说回正事。情报说罪犯在洋红沼泽，你们知道她在哪儿吗？";
case "Maybe you could hahaha.": return "也许，你还真可以，哈哈哈。";
case "Really? because I want to live in your armpits o.O.": return "真的？因为我想住在你的腋窝里o.O。";
case "Don't worry Lili, it happens to me often and in fact it flatters me.": return "别担心，莉莉，经常遇到这种事，其实还挺受用。";
case "Jeez Line self control.": return "天哪，莱茵，克制一点。";
case "*Line can't stop leering at Sam muscular and sweaty body*": return "*莱茵忍不住，色眯眯地盯着萨姆肌肉结实、汗津津的身体。*";
case "Oh by the way I think something happened to your friend.": return "哦，对了，你朋友好像出了点事。";
case "Yeah Sam we can handle it all <3 .": return "没错，萨姆，我们什么都能应付<3。";
case "Wow, you weren't lying, you two are really strong.": return "哇，你没说谎，你们两个真的很强。";
case "Please help me, don't let her take the crystal.": return "求你帮帮我，别让她拿走水晶。";
case "Hey leave her alone!": return "喂，放开她！";
case "Help the dragon maybe she gives us a reward.": return "帮帮那个龙女，说不定会给谢礼。";
case "Lili what do we do?": return "莉莉，我们怎么办？";
case "For now we block the exit until the guards arrive.": return "先把出口堵住，等守卫过来。";
case "We are prisoners if we get into someone else's fight they will increase our sentence.": return "我们是囚犯，掺和别人的打架，刑期会加长。";
case "And why don't you help her?!": return "那你为什么不去帮？！";
case "That dragon woman fell from the sky and the lamia seems to have stole something from her.": return "那个龙女从天上掉下来，拉米娅好像偷了她的东西。";
case "Hey! what's happening here?": return "喂！这里怎么回事？";
case "Vasuki The Silver Dragon of Luminous": return "瓦苏基，卢米纳斯的银龙";
case "Thank you very much you are very kind <3.": return "太感谢了，你真好<3。";
case "We know where it is, we will help you to return home.": return "我们知道在哪儿，会帮你回家的。";
case "This one came with me, the other one from what I could see ended up in a place with many bright blue rocks.": return "这一块跟我一起过来了，另一块，看样子掉到了一个有好多发光蓝石头的地方。";
case "Oh don't worry, the truth is I would like to go back but this crystal is only half the fracture.": return "哦，别担心。其实，我也想回去，可这块水晶，只是裂隙的一半。";
case "Lili! Excuse her, she was born without touch.": return "莉莉！抱歉，她天生不懂分寸。";
case "Wow.. it's a lot to digest but at least you already have the crystal to return to that horrible place.": return "哇……信息量真大，不过至少有水晶，能回那个可怕的地方了。";
case "Yes, my dimension is called Luminous, right now a corrupt god is wreaking havoc and that is why my dimension has these dimensional fractures.": return "对，我的次元叫流明界。现在，一个堕落的神明正在那里肆虐，所以，我们次元才会出现这些裂隙。";
case "Wait do you come from another dimension?": return "等等，你从另一个次元来的？";
case "That crystal is really a dimensional rift and my only way to get back home.": return "那块水晶，实际上是次元裂隙，也是我回家的唯一途径。";
case "That crystal, why is it so important to you?": return "那块水晶，为什么对你这么重要？";
case "Relax, it was nothing.": return "没事，小意思。";
case "Yes, Thanks for helping me, I didn't have any more energy to fight.": return "嗯，谢谢你帮我，我已经没力气继续战斗了。";
case "Are you ok?": return "你还好吗？";
case "Oh sorry I will go take it now.": return "哦，对不起，现在就去拿。";
case "Wait you forgot to take the crystal.": return "等等，你忘拿水晶了。";
case "Ahhhh you are right let's do it.": return "啊，你说得对，动手吧。";
case "Come on line just look at her, undress her with your dirty eyes, don't you want to see her like this all the time?": return "来嘛，莱茵，看看她，用你那下流眼神把她扒光。难道不想一直看她这副样子？";
case "But I do not understand, why do all that?": return "可我不明白，为什么要做那些事？";
case "Look, if they find you before you start the robbery they will only give you a warning and the farmer will be able to work naked.": return "看，在开始偷之前就被发现，只会收到警告，而农场主就能光着身子干活了。";
case "....Whhaat?": return "……什么？";
case "Exactly..": return "正是如此……";
case "You are insane! I do not want to go to jail.": return "你疯了！我可不想坐牢。";
case "Look, if the farmer wants to be more comfortable at work, why don't you try to steal this milk?": return "听着，既然农场女工想工作得舒服点，为什么不试试，偷这桶牛奶？";
case "What is it?": return "什么事？";
case "Hey Line I think I have an idea.": return "喂，莱茵，我有个主意。";
case "Hey you people, what are you doing!": return "喂，你们，在干什么！";
case "Ohh.... fine..": return "哦……好吧……";
case "get naked, if that doesn't get you noticed, nothing will.": return "脱光。这样还引不起注意，就没别的办法了。";
case "What do we do then?": return "那怎么办？";
case "Mmm this woman does not realize what is going on around her, no wonder the inmates are escaping.": return "嗯，这女人完全没注意周围在发生什么，难怪囚犯都在越狱。";
case "Ohh ok I will just move it from one side to the other..": return "哦，好，我只是把它，从一边挪到另一边……";
case "Wait Line Do not take it out of the box just move it.": return "等等，莱茵，别从盒子里拿出来，挪一下就好。";
case "Line starts to take out the milk bucket.": return "莱茵开始搬出奶桶。";
case "What act?": return "什么表演？";
case "Ah shut up the act is over.": return "啊，闭嘴，戏演完了。";
case "Why did you untie me?!": return "为什么给我松绑？！";
case "She says she understands and will never do it again.": return "她说，她明白了，再也不会这样。";
case "Mmmhemm hemmmMmmm.": return "嗯哼，嗯嗯嗯……";
case "I will give you only one warning but if you steal again I swear I will take you to the guards.": return "只警告一次，再偷东西，我发誓把你送到卫兵那里。";
case "Have a nice day Miss the prison-farm is a good place to buy aphrodisiacs as well as exemplifying the sentences of people who break the law.": return "祝你今天愉快，小姐。监狱农场是买催情药的好地方，也能让大家看看，违法的人会受到什么惩罚。";
case "You found one of the stolen relics! I'll give the news to the captain, you can go and return it to the church and I know they will be grateful.": return "你找到了被盗的圣遗物！我去向队长报告，你可以送回教堂，他们一定会很感激。";
case "Oh it's out of order, I really want to go to the bathroom :c.": return "哦，坏了，我真的好想上厕所:c。";
case "Well, it is out of order anyway.": return "反正也坏了，不能用。";
case "I cannot get in here, it is the men's room.": return "不能进去，这是男厕所。";
case "Hey watchout!": return "嘿，小心！";
case "No, over my dead body you ruin my whole plan!": return "不行，想毁掉我的整个计划，除非从我尸体上踩过去！";
case "Ehhh... Agh it's ok what should I do.": return "呃……唉，好吧，该怎么做？";
case "Not anymore, Line owes me.": return "现在可不是了，莱茵欠我的。";
case "WHAT? But I'm the one who has to do it.": return "什么？可这事明明该我做。";
case "Line? I need your help damn it, go to my place now!": return "莱茵？我需要你帮忙，妈的，立刻来我那里！";
case "Oh that's a bit aggressive.": return "哦，这有点凶啊。";
case "That's what worries me, you bloody gambler, if I see that you've turned the place into a casino I swear I'll kill you!": return "就是这点让人担心，你这个死赌鬼，要是敢把这里变成赌场，发誓我非杀了你！";
case "Don't worry SieKi I will run the place even better than you.": return "别担心，茜姬，我会把这里管得比你还好。";
case "Shit, I really don't want to but I didn't have time to look for someone.": return "妈的，真不想这么做，可没时间再找别人了。";
case "Then she will take your place for a while, Sieki?": return "茜姬，那就暂时由她代替你？";
case "Stay out of my business!": return "少管我的闲事！";
case "and let me make it clear you are working so be professional and don't touch anything on my desk!": return "还有，说清楚，你是在上班，专业点，别碰我桌上的东西！";
case "Oh I am sorry I am sorry I am running right now.": return "哦，对不起，对不起，马上就跑。";
case "Line what are you waiting for stop talking and go to work!": return "莱茵，还等什么，别聊了，去干活！";
case "Of course, there is no problem <3.": return "当然，没问题<3。";
case "W-would you really come ;c?": return "你、你真的会来;c？";
case "Oh, okay, I-I will visit you when you do.": return "哦，好，你、你安顿好后，我会去看你的。";
case "Ahhh fuck you, I'll make my own secret club with gambling and pachinko!": return "啊，去你的！我自己开秘密俱乐部，赌场、柏青哥，一个都不少！";
case "Thank you for opening your mind to me. It's been a long time since people came to see me. I'll give you advice as a gift. I see an evil being behind you, exposing your weakness. A shell of a being. If you don't find your ego, it will take its place, and you'll lose the little bit of individuality you have now.": return "谢谢你向我敞开心灵，很久没人来看我了。赠你一个忠告：你身后有个邪恶的存在，正暴露你的弱点，一个空壳般的存在。如果找不到真正的自我，它就会取而代之，你连现在这点独立人格都会失去。";
case "Ah, I-I'm sorry, Line. No, no, I can't. My head, ah, it hurts. I don't know what's happening.": return "啊，对、对不起，莱茵。不，不，我不行。我的头，啊，好疼。我不知道，发生了什么。";
case "Sh-shut up! I do not understand anything, Lili. Attack the serpent, please! I need you, please, make it stop!": return "闭、闭嘴！我什么都不懂，莉莉。攻击那条蛇，求你了！我需要你，求求你，让它停下！";
case "You're a shallow, flat shell of a person. It's hard to even call you an individual. Your super ego in society makes people idolize you like a hero, a role model. But when you're alone, your id surfaces, revealing nothing more than an animal devoid of any reasoning.": return "你只是个肤浅、空洞的空壳，甚至很难称为独立的人。在社会中，你的超我让大家把你当成英雄、榜样，盲目崇拜。可独处时，本我浮出水面，剩下的，不过是一头毫无理性的野兽。";
case "P-p-please, do not m-make me think about my family anymore. I-I beg you, get out of my head.": return "求、求、求你，别、别再让我想起家人了。求、求求你，从我脑子里滚出去。";
case "Please, get out of my head. I do not want to hear anymore.": return "求你，从我脑子里出去，不想再听了。";
case "You're right. You're a slut, and you're a saint. Your life has been about living between two extremes.": return "你说得对。你是个婊子，也是个圣人。你这一生，一直都活在两个极端之间。";
case "Line, calm down. Ahh, my head, what's happening?": return "莱茵，冷静。啊，头好痛，怎么回事？";
case "IT'S A LIE! I-I-I was always a good daughter in the village, a model daughter! I never did anything to shame my father!": return "骗人！我、我、我在村里一直是好女儿，模范女儿！从没做过让爸爸蒙羞的事！";
case "Do you really want them to know what you are? A shameless woman whose only motive is carnal relief. Your father is better off without knowing you; your mother saved him from seeing his daughter fall into a hopeless pit.": return "你真想让他们知道，你是什么样的人？一个不知羞耻，满脑子只有肉欲发泄的女人。你父亲不知道你这样，反而更好；你母亲，替他挡住了亲眼看着女儿坠入绝望深渊的痛苦。";
case "Wh-what! No, she w-wanted to h-help me get to kn-know myself, to t-truly experience and s-shape myself through int-interacting with other people!": return "什、什么！不，她、她想帮、帮我认识自己，通、通过和其他人来往，真正体、体验生活，塑、塑造自己！";
case "Your mother helped you leave the village just so you wouldn't cause problems for your father.": return "你妈妈帮你离开村子，只是不想让你给父亲惹麻烦。";
case "Line, are you okay?!": return "莱茵，你没事吧？！";
case "Ah!? Why do I hear you in my head?": return "啊！？为什么脑子里有你的声音？";
case "But you're just a nymphomaniac without morals, the nightmare of your father and the mistake of your mother.": return "你不过是个毫无道德的色情狂，你父亲的噩梦、你母亲犯下的错误。";
case "*Starts to cry* Sniff, sniff, th-thank you, really. I thought I was a j-joke, just a nymphomaniac in the form of an elf who can not even be a w-woman of values like my f-father wanted.": return "*哭起来*呜，呜，谢、谢谢你，真的。我还以为，自己就是个笑、笑话，不过是披着精灵外表的色情狂，连父、父亲希望的那种有、有品行的女人，都做不到。";
case "You're in a place where everyone gets what they want\nyour powers can't have an effect when everyone is already at the highest level of ecstasy.": return "这里人人都得偿所愿。\n既然所有人都已经沉浸在最极致的狂喜之中，你的力量自然起不了作用。";
case "B-ut I am succubus, they should be the ones desiring me more!": return "可、可我是魅魔，他们不该更想要我吗！";
case "The most accurate thing is that your friend was a warrior dragon, something not commonly seen in those places. You shouldn't worry; they just desired her more.": return "更准确地说，你朋友是个龙族战士，在那种地方很少见。不必介意，他们只是更想要她。";
case "Being half succubus doesn't necessarily mean you have to be the best in the sex. It could be due to various factors that VIPs liked your friend more than you.": return "半魅魔，不代表一定得最擅长做爱。贵宾们比起你，更喜欢你的朋友，可能有很多原因。";
case "Th-the thing is, it seemed like people enjoyed being with her more than with me, and, well, being half succubus makes me feel like I am a disgrace, as if it were a mistake or something like that.": return "就、就是，好像大家跟她在一起，都比跟我更开心。而且，半魅魔这个身份，让我觉得，自己像个耻辱，像是什么错误。";
case "Oh? Emm I think I have a question... *looks around* Not long ago, a friend and I were working in a VIP area on the island as onaholes.": return "哦？呃，有个问题……*环顾四周*不久前，我和朋友在岛上的一个VIP区，当过人形飞机杯。";
case "Hello, I'm Veritus and I can answer any question!": return "你好，我叫维里图斯，什么问题都能回答！";
case "It sticking out its little tongue, it is so adorable! <3": return "它在吐小舌头，太可爱了！<3";
case "Look at the sea serpent, it is so cute! <3": return "看那条海蛇，好可爱<3！";
case "Verity Pond": return "真言池";
case "Warning! $%&/(%/ &$#%% in the Pond: Speaking to it is akin to facing a mirror of your innermost self. It can answer questions, but its cost is unknown and can negatively affect people. Caution and respect are advised, avoiding deceit. Enjoy the pond with care and consideration.": return "警告！池塘中的$%&/(%/ &$#%%：与它交谈，就如直视映照内心最深处的镜子。它能回答问题，却不知要付出何种代价，也可能对人造成不良影响。请谨慎、尊重，切勿欺骗。游览池塘时，请小心体谅。";
case "Maybe I better leave.": return "我还是走吧。";
case "Lili, did I wake up before you?": return "莉莉，我居然醒得比你早？";
case "Ugh, what a horrible nightmare has happened?": return "呃，好可怕的噩梦，发生什么了？";
case "Lovers bridge": return "恋人桥";
case "Hey you cannot pass without paying the toll.": return "喂，没交过路费，不能过去。";
case "Hey! What do you think you're doing?": return "喂！你想干什么？";
case "It's the only thing you deserve for having the nerve to believe you can catch me.": return "敢以为自己能抓住我，这就是你唯一配得上的下场。";
case "Here you have my stinking foot": return "给，我的臭脚。";
case "Like the closet thirsty succubus that you are.": return "就像你这只装正经、却饥渴得要命的魅魔。";
case "You will have to touch yourself here in front of passersby.": return "你得在这里，当着来来往往的人自慰。";
case "Hehe I know a way that you can save your little friend.": return "嘿嘿，我知道一个办法，能救你的小朋友。";
case "Please do not take Lili.": return "求你了，别带走莉莉。";
case "I'll keep your fairy, it will sell very well on the black market.": return "这只仙子我留下了，黑市上能卖个好价钱。";
case "I told you that your attempt to catch me was useless.": return "早告诉你了，想抓我，白费力气。";
case "Well it does not matter I will go to your base.": return "好吧，没关系，我去你们基地。";
case "But it seems you wanted it to come to this.": return "不过看来，是你非要走到这一步。";
case "Hahaha you disgust me if you told me that before you would have saved yourself the humiliation.": return "哈哈哈，真恶心。早这么说，也不用丢这么大脸了。";
case "Yes! and I'll take out the wanted posters.": return "好！我也会撤下通缉令。";
case "Ple-please do not take Lili, we have a base you can hide.": return "求、求你，别带走莉莉，我们有个据点，能让你藏身。";
case "Do not worry, we will give you 1000 Arcs as a reward, you just have to go and pick it up at the jail-farm.": return "别担心，赏金是1000阿克，去监狱农场领取就行。";
case "Lili! do not be rude.": return "莉莉！别没礼貌。";
case "And our reward?": return "那我们的奖励呢？";
case "Oh.. there is nothing to be thankful for.": return "哦……没什么好谢的。";
case "Thank you again, traveler, and this is the third criminal that we arrest thanks to you.": return "再次感谢，旅人，靠你们抓到的罪犯，这已经是第三个了。";
case "But calm down if you lick the sweat you can pass your humiliation faster.": return "不过别急，舔掉这些汗，就能快点熬过这场羞辱。";
case "The only way you can get rid of this is by reaching climax.": return "要摆脱这个，唯一的办法，就是达到高潮。";
case "Ple-please let me go I can not continue like this.": return "求、求你放我走，不能再这样了。";
case "I am a special Type of wyvern that can secrete an aphrodisiac and use it at will..": return "我是种特殊的双足飞龙，能分泌催情剂，想什么时候用就什么时候用。";
case "Bu-but why do I feel like this?": return "可、可我为什么会这样？";
case "Haha and what if I'm not for the others you are just perverts who skipped the toll.": return "哈哈，那我若不是呢？在别人眼里，你们不过是逃了过路费的变态。";
case "Shit, you're not a guard!": return "妈的，你根本不是卫兵！";
case "Do you really think that I would let go without paying?": return "你真以为，不付钱就能走？";
case "What the hell AHHHH.": return "什么鬼，啊啊啊！";
case "I-I'm sorry Lili I ca-can not contain myself I do not know what's happening to me.": return "对、对不起，莉莉，实、实在忍不住，不知道自己怎么了。";
case "What the hell damn pervert !? do not touch yourself in public have some dignity!": return "搞什么，死变态？！别在公共场合摸自己，有点尊严！";
case "I do not know, I feel very hot.": return "不知道，我感觉好热。";
case "Ah?.": return "啊？";
case "Oh .. Lili I do-do not feel good.": return "哦……莉莉，我、我不舒服。";
case "Just what I like to hear, from now on you'll help me cover all my tracks, haha~.": return "这才是我想听的。从现在起，你得帮我抹掉所有痕迹，哈哈~。";
case "Yes! and I will take out all the wanted posters for the liberation of Line.": return "好！我会撕掉所有通缉海报，还莱茵自由。";
case "We have a base where you can hide, but at least free Lili.": return "我们有个基地，可以让你藏身，但至少，先放了莉莉。";
case "I know that you are the person who is in the wanted posters.": return "我知道，你就是通缉海报上的人。";
case "Wait please let me talk.": return "等等，求你，让我说话。";
case "Uhh I see you finished how about a second round.": return "哦，看来你结束了，要不要再来一轮？";
case "It would help me a lot to write my new novel, as I need new sources of inspiration, thank you for listening to my request, that's all I had to say, now I will continue with my next song.": return "我写新小说正缺灵感，有你帮忙，肯定大有用处。谢谢听完我的请求，就说这么多，接着为大家演奏下一首。";
case "Before I start my next song if anyone knows a hero or adventurer would you be so kind to introduce him to me.": return "下一首歌开始前，要是有人认识英雄或冒险者，能不能好心介绍给我？";
case "Thank you all so much for listening <3.": return "谢谢大家，愿意听我说<3。";
case "Lucy Monroe the wandering bard": return "露西·门罗：流浪诗人";
case "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!": return "不——！";
case "Lili, I need a coat, like right right now.": return "莉莉，我需要一件大衣，马上，现在就要。";
case "OH no, please Line, NO!": return "哦，不，求你了，莱茵，不要！";
case "I think this experience has just awakened something inside me, something bad.": return "这番经历，好像刚唤醒了我心里的什么东西，不是什么好东西。";
case "Yeah?": return "嗯？";
case "... Lili.": return "……莉莉。";
case "Uff thats my signal.": return "呼，该我上场了。";
case "That's all I'll call the guards": return "够了，我要叫卫兵了。";
case "Yes! I mean no, I dont know D:.": return "对！我是说，不，不知道D:。";
case "Fuck no you weirdo.": return "才他妈不要，你这个怪人。";
case "You like what you see hehehe.": return "喜欢你看到的东西吧，嘿嘿嘿。";
case ":O Lili she squirt in front of us!": return ":O莉莉，她当着我们面潮吹了！";
case "What that hell are you doing?!": return "你到底在干什么？！";
case "Yes wait, I have something to show you, where is it? oh it's here!": return "对，等等，有样东西给你看，哪儿去了？哦，在这里！";
case "Oh di-did you call me?": return "哦，你、你叫我？";
case "Yes you, the one with blue hair!": return "对，就是你，蓝头发的那个！";
case "Ah?": return "啊？";
case "Hey you, come here!": return "喂，你，过来！";
case "I've never done this you dirty pervert! Now go do what you came here to do!": return "从没做过这种事，你这个肮脏变态！现在，赶紧办你该办的事去！";
case "Lili, you are a genius. Are you sure you haven't done this before?": return "莉莉，你真是天才，确定以前没做过？";
case "If you do so with no one in front of you, you may attract the attention of a guard.": return "如果面前没人，就做这种事，可能会引来卫兵的注意。";
case "Just yell and get someone's attention will come and when they are in front of you open your coat.": return "大叫一声，吸引别人注意。有人走到你面前，就把大衣敞开。";
case "But I need someone to come, what do I do then?": return "可我需要有人来，那该怎么办？";
case "Ahhh, look I won't look for anyone but I'll be with you.": return "啊，听着，我不帮你找别人，不过，我会陪你。";
case "B-but Lili I really need you :c.": return "可、可是莉莉，我真的需要你:c。";
case "What no way!?": return "什么，不会吧！？";
case "Ehem, I am going to change my clothes, you-you bring someone.": return "咳，我去换衣服，你、你把人带来。";
case "I worry about you sometimes Line.": return "有时候，真替你担心，莱茵。";
case "Hehehehehe Eeeehhhhhh.": return "嘿嘿嘿嘿，呃啊——";
case "Thank you Lili.": return "谢谢你，莉莉。";
case "*Patting Line's head *Oh ya ya, you'll be all right.": return "*拍拍莱茵的头*哦，好了好了，没事的。";
case "yes, although she pulls my hair in a way that I don't like :c.": return "嗯，不过她扯我头发的方式，我不喜欢:c。";
case "Don't worry, I just said it to make her go away.": return "别担心，只是想让她走才那么说。";
case "Ay Lili, where can I hide?": return "唉，莉莉，我能躲到哪儿去？";
case "OH ok :c": return "哦，好吧 :c";
case "Tsk I have to go but if I see you here again, you're dead.": return "啧，我得走了，可下次再在这里看见你，你就死定了。";
case "Ehh you better hide you made a lot of noise the guards are coming!": return "呃，快躲起来，动静太大，守卫要来了！";
case "AHh Lili help me!": return "啊，莉莉，救我！";
case "Who do you think you are? Stealing my place, I've been stripping here for weeks!": return "以为自己是谁？敢抢我的地盘，我都在这里脱好几周了！";
case "Come here you stupid bitch.": return "过来，你这个蠢婊子。";
case "Me? I am not doing anything, I swear.": return "我？什么都没做，发誓。";
case "What the hell are you doing here? This is my place.": return "你在这里干什么鬼？这是我的地盘。";
case "Hey you!": return "喂，你！";
case "Mmm... no.": return "嗯……不。";
case "Shouldn't we take it to the guards?": return "不该把它交给卫兵吗？";
case "Wow it's a scarlet crystal sphere! We could pass it on to the fortune teller since she was looking for it.": return "哇，是颗绯红水晶球！占卜师正在找，送给她怎么样。";
case "Look Lili what I found.": return "看，莉莉，我发现了什么。";
case "Mmmmm... no, we could use it for something or sell it :V.": return "嗯……别扔，也许有用，还能卖钱:V。";
case "Should not we take it to the guards?": return "不该把它交给卫兵吗？";
case "Hey! that ball is not the one I handed it to him, it looks like glass.": return "喂！这球不是我之前交给他的那个，看起来像玻璃。";
case "Look Lili the red ball!": return "看啊，莉莉，那个红球！";
case "Magenta swamp.": return "绯红沼泽。";
case "Welcome to the Magenta swamp, the place where the most brutal mud fights in the world take place!!": return "欢迎来到洋红沼泽，这里有全世界最残暴的泥地摔跤！！";
case "Oh you talk like you don't Like it, looks like Jessi spoiled you alot, you bad little girl.": return "哦，说得好像你不喜欢似的。看来杰茜把你宠坏了，你这坏丫头。";
case "Playtime is over Elena, leave the puppet and the diaper on the floor and you won't get hurt.": return "游戏结束，埃莱娜。把傀儡和尿布放在地上，就不会受伤。";
case "Yeah what she said, you will not kidnap anyone while we are here.": return "对，就像她说的，只要我们在，谁也别想绑架别人。";
case "Stop right there you criminal scum!": return "站住，你这犯罪渣滓！";
case "Of course Line, there is no problem with that.": return "当然，莱茵，完全没问题。";
case "At least can we accompany you to the entrance of the town?": return "至少，让我们陪你走到镇子入口吧？";
case "I'm sorry Line I really have to go.": return "抱歉，莱茵，我真的得走了。";
case "Oh... I thought we could spend a little more time together but, its ok.": return "哦……本来还想，跟你多待一会儿，不过，也没关系。";
case "I have to return to Tricotex with my partner, sadly being a hero is a job that never ends.": return "得和搭档回特里科特克斯。可惜，当英雄是份永远干不完的工作。";
case "We made it Sam now that we caught the criminal, but now what will you do?": return "做到了，萨姆，罪犯已经抓住，接下来你要怎么办？";
case "Girls. You did a good job. I'll take her to the jail-farm to serve her sentence.": return "姑娘们，干得好。我把她带去监狱农场，服刑。";
case "Fairy where?": return "仙女在哪里？";
case "Well I would have gotten away with it, if it weren't for these nosy kids and their fairy.": return "本来能得逞的，要不是这群多管闲事的小鬼和他们的妖精。";
case "Yes, there will be no ABC Daycare here on the island!": return "是啊，不会让岛上再发生ABC托儿所那种事！";
case "Your days kidnapping people are over.": return "你到处绑人的日子，结束了。";
case "Game over Elena we already beat you, you can't escape.": return "结束了，埃莱娜，我们已经赢了，你逃不掉。";
case "Please someone help me I don't want to wear a diaper!": return "求求谁来帮帮我，我不要穿尿布！";
case "It seems that I must teach these bad girls how to behave.": return "看来，得教教这些坏女孩，怎样才叫乖。";
case "To fight!": return "开打！";
case "Thank you Line, with you helping my I know can get back home.": return "谢谢你，莱茵，有你帮忙，相信一定能回家。";
case "Don't worry Vasuki we will get the crystal.": return "别担心，瓦苏基，我们会拿到水晶的。";
case "Line these two will not leave the crystal we will have to take it by force.": return "莱茵，她们两个不肯交水晶，只能硬抢了。";
case "Sorry, but we also need these Crystals for the people we love.": return "抱歉，可我们爱的人，也需要这些水晶。";
case "Please, I have family my children await my return.": return "求你了，我还有家人，孩子们都等着我回去。";
case "Stop kidding this crystal is the only thing that separates Vasuki from her home.": return "别开玩笑了，这水晶可是瓦苏基能否回家的关键。";
case "This Crystal belongs to Red Team!": return "这块水晶，属于红队！";
case "Why are your so mean?": return "为什么这么坏？";
case "Ay Line you are very kind to me hehe.": return "哎呀，莱茵，你对我真好，嘿嘿。";
case "Sounds great, I heard they grow special fruits there, I would love to eat something new with you <3.": return "听起来不错，听说那里种着特别的水果，真想和你一起尝点新东西<3。";
case "Yes. I think it would be for the best, I even have some fruits that the cows gave me.": return "嗯，这样最好。我还有些从那些牛那儿拿到的水果。";
case "Come to my house so you can rest and then return to your dimension, Vasuki, something could happen to you if you fall unconscious in the change of dimensions.": return "瓦苏基，先去我家休息，再回你的次元吧。万一穿越次元时昏过去，可就危险了。";
case "I have not rested since I came to this dimension.": return "来到这个次元以后，我一直没休息。";
case "Vasuki do you feel good?": return "瓦苏基，感觉还好吗？";
case "Now, I just have to ...": return "现在，只要……";
case "Oh sorry Lili thank you so much to you too.": return "哦，对不起，莉莉，也非常感谢你。";
case "Ehemmmm.": return "咳咳。";
case "Thank you very much Line, I can finally return home.": return "莱茵，太谢谢你了，终于能回家了。";
case "We made it <3!": return "我们成功了 <3！";
case "Count on me Vasuki you will have my full support.": return "交给我，瓦苏基，我会全力支持你。";
case "Line, will you help me to get proof? and thus reveal to the whole island what is going on here.": return "莱茵，愿意帮我找证据吗？这样就能把这里的事，揭露给全岛的人。";
case "That so terrible she looked such a good woman.": return "太可怕了，她看着明明是个好女人。";
case "I believe they are involved.": return "我认为，他们牵涉其中。";
case "I went to tell the guards before I started my investigation and they told me that there was nothing unusual going on in this house.": return "调查前，我去告诉过卫兵，可他们说，这栋屋子里，没有任何异常。";
case "What! we must tell the great captain.": return "什么！得告诉大队长。";
case "Very bad I'm afraid Lili, I heard things like, money laundering, trafficking of people and drugs.": return "恐怕很糟，莉莉。听到了洗钱、人口贩卖，还有毒品这些事。";
case "Come on how bad can this place be it's almost a paradise, well apart from that white demon.": return "来嘛，这地方能有多糟，简直是天堂，除了那个白色恶魔。";
case "Well I work as a bounty hunter to help around the house and in one of my jobs I heard some very bad things about this place.": return "我靠做赏金猎人贴补家用，有次工作时，听到了这个地方一些很糟糕的传闻。";
case "Line... well I'm investigating this place.": return "莱茵……那个，我正在调查这里。";
case "Hi Vasuki, what are you doing here?": return "嗨，瓦苏基，在这里做什么？";
case "I don't think entering a house without Vasuki is good idea.": return "瓦苏基不在，我们还是别进屋了吧。";
case "Hehe thank you.": return "嘿嘿，谢谢。";
case "Bell that is beautiful.": return "贝尔，真美。";
case "If I can get it, I could save it from extinction and give a second chance to the island and its people.": return "只要拿到，就能挽救它免于灭绝，给这座岛和岛民再一次机会。";
case "Yes, but when I heard that one of them was still alive I couldn't stop myself from looking for it.": return "对，可听说其中一朵还活着，我就忍不住来找了。";
case "So it's just a strange flower? because in this island nowadays everything has aphrodisiacs..": return "所以，只是朵奇怪的花？毕竟现在岛上什么东西，都掺着催情药……";
case "Hehe not really, in ancient times this flower was used for its aphrodisiac properties and because of that the people of the island drove it to extinction.": return "嘿嘿，其实不是。古时人们把这花当催情药用，岛上的人也因此把它弄灭绝了。";
case "And why are you looking so hard for that flower, does it grant wishes or something?": return "你为什么这么拼命找那朵花，难道它能实现愿望？";
case "Someone must have hidden this path for some reason, maybe the flower is there.": return "有人藏起这条路，肯定有原因，说不定花就在里面。";
case "Mmm.. I think I see a path behind the cat tails.": return "嗯……香蒲后面，好像有条路。";
case "Exactly, they shouldn't grow so close together, someone must have planted them there.": return "没错，不该长得这么密，一定是有人种在这里的。";
case "Yes, there are a many.": return "对，有很多。";
case "Line you see those cat tails": return "莱茵，看见那些香蒲了吗？";
case "Lili don't be mean you can fly, besides I have my tights wet :c": return "莉莉，别坏心眼，你能飞，可我的连裤袜都湿了:c";
case "I do not want to go through all these plants.": return "不想穿过这些植物。";
case "Hey girl! if you want to harvest some mushrooms you better pay to play.": return "嘿，姑娘！想采蘑菇，最好先交钱参加游戏。";
case "Thanks for playing! come and get your Arcs.": return "感谢参与！过来领阿克吧。";
case "OH I almost forgot, since you managed to harvest your first mushroom perfectly, you can keep it.": return "哦，差点忘了，第一颗蘑菇采得这么完美，就留着吧。";
case "Great wait a second while your opponent arrives.": return "好，稍等，你的对手马上来。";
case "The prize for winning is 100 Arcs.": return "获胜的奖品是100阿克。";
case "The game ends when one of the contestants makes the opponent pass the boundary line.": return "一方把对手拉过界线，比赛就结束。";
case "Once the game starts you must press the button when the bar is at maximum so you will use all your strength to pull the rope.": return "游戏开始后，进度条到顶时按下按钮，这样就能使出全力拉绳子。";
case "Hey want to play danglinging-ass-rope? You can play for 50 Arcs.": return "喂，想玩悬绳荡屁股吗？50阿克币一次。";
case "Good luck next time, I look forward to seeing you if you want to play again.": return "下次好运，想再玩的话，随时欢迎。";
case "Hey to use the onaholes you need a ticket!": return "喂，使用人形飞机杯需要票！";
case "Calm lili, but thanks for saying that <3 you are the best fairy a half elf can have.": return "别激动，莉莉，不过谢谢你这么说<3，你是半精灵能遇到的最棒妖精。";
case "A proud half succubus!": return "一个骄傲的半魅魔！";
case "She is a proud half succubus!": return "她是个骄傲的半魅魔！";
case "Hey, don't give her money after sex like she's a whore !": return "喂！别做完爱，就给她钱，弄得像她是妓女一样！";
case "Keep the money, I have to go now.": return "钱你留着，我得走了。";
case "Ohh god I really need that.": return "哦，天啊，我真需要这个。";
case "Hi I'm SailorCum just turn around to give you a rimjob.": return "嗨，我是水手射精娘，转过去，让我给你舔肛。";
case "WHAT ONlY 10 Arcs!? I'm GOING TO KILL YOU DROGITAS!": return "什么，只有10阿克！？毒虫，我要杀了你！";
case "Ah.. whatever, why not.": return "啊……算了，为什么不呢。";
case "Lili you are a master negotiator. o.O": return "莉莉，你真是谈判大师o.O。";
case "Virgin of the ears, we will give you 10 arc no more nor less and you must give us a Deviant fruit so Line can grows a penis.": return "处女？恐怕也就耳朵还没破处吧。我们给你10阿克，不多不少。你得给我们一颗异变果，让莱茵长出阴茎。";
case "Well, don't you want to use Zoi? to start raising money only 30 Arcs while she is still a virgin.": return "那要不要用用佐伊？好开始筹钱。趁她还是处女，只收30阿克币。";
case "Here you pay with Arcs, seeing the good side at least now you know.": return "这里用阿克付钱，往好处想，至少你现在知道了。";
case "No wonder they all came to my hole. :c": return "难怪他们都来用我的洞:c。";
case "The entrance of the town there is a gold mine literally everyone in town has is basically garbage here.": return "镇口就有金矿，这里人人都有金子，基本跟垃圾没区别。";
case "Explain yourself fairy!!": return "给我解释清楚，仙子！！";
case "Wh-WHAT!?": return "什、什么！？";
case "Hey I'm sorry to tell you that gold is worth nothing here so you're stranded until you can buy a boat on this island.": return "嘿，很遗憾，这里的黄金一文不值。所以，买到船之前，你都得困在这座岛上。";
case "Ohh .. okay but be nice please.": return "哦……好吧，不过请温柔点。";
case "So you prefer that they make a fool of themselves when buying the boat?": return "所以，你宁愿他们买船的时候出丑？";
case "Do not bother them Lili let's keep going.": return "别打扰她们，莉莉，继续走吧。";
case "... Wow, what a dumm ass I will tell her the truth.": return "……哇，真是个傻子，我去告诉她真相。";
case "Finally we can start our adventure once and for all.": return "终于能正式开始冒险了。";
case "We did it drogitas, we finally have enough gold to buy a boat!": return "成功了，德罗吉塔斯，我们终于攒够金子，可以买船了！";
case "... You are lucky to be cute Line.": return "……莱茵，幸亏你长得可爱。";
case "I don't think she was a virgin, Lili.": return "我觉得她不是处女，莉莉。";
case "DROGITAS!": return "小毒品！";
case "New offer a20 arcs since she talks a lot!": return "新报价，20阿克，因为她太吵了！";
case "Hey wait give me a brake that woman left me a little tired.": return "喂，等等，让我喘口气，那女人把我弄得有点累。";
case "New onahole offer at 30 arcs take advantage now that it is still virgin!": return "新款肉便器，只要30阿克，趁还没开苞，赶快享用！";
case "Attention everyone!": return "大家注意！";
case "Yeah was great thanks Lili! <3": return "对，太棒了，谢谢莉莉<3！";
case "So you have fun Line? <3": return "莱茵，玩得开心吗？<3";
case "Well that's all and remember I'm not involved in all this so don't you dare come near me!": return "好了，就这些。记住，我跟这件事毫无关系，不许来找我！";
case "Remember they should last 24hrs but even if they lose consciousness you can still go on! and don't worry they have already given their approval.": return "记住，至少要坚持24小时。不过即使失去意识，也可以继续！别担心，她们已经同意了。";
case "And on the right side, a silver dragon from another dimension, shy but when it comes to fighting, a real beast, and her name is Vasuki!": return "右边这位，是来自异次元的银龙，平时腼腆，战斗时却是真正的猛兽，她就是瓦苏基！";
case "Elf half succubus shy and guess what, she is also a Virgin! (I can't believe I say that)": return "害羞的半魅魔精灵，而且猜猜怎么着，她还是个处女！（不敢相信，我居然说得出口。）";
case "Today we have 2 one of a kind onaholes give a warm welcome to Line!": return "今天有两位独一无二的肉便器，热烈欢迎莱茵！";
case "Attention everyone, the 24 hour marathon begins!": return "各位注意，24小时马拉松现在开始！";
case "yeah yeah whatever.": return "是是是，随便。";
case "It's not like it's a punishment, the money will be collected to pay the women who work here.": return "又不是惩罚，筹来的钱会付给在这里工作的女人们。";
case "Sure, why not.": return "好啊，有什么不行。";
case "Do you want me to promote the sale of my friends to this band of wankers?": return "你要我把朋友，推销给这群撸管的家伙？";
case "Oh and Lili you know a fairy around here is very strange wouldn't you like to be the entertainer?": return "哦，还有莉莉，在这里见到仙子真稀奇，想不想来当主持人？";
case "All right girls get into your poses.": return "好，姑娘们，摆好姿势。";
case "Mmm no nothing Lili let's take vasuki to the house.": return "嗯，没有，没什么，莉莉，我们带瓦苏基回家吧。";
case "Something wrong, Line?": return "怎么了，莱茵？";
case "Ah yes and that to...": return "啊，对，还有那个……";
case "And their dental benefit as well.": return "还有她们的牙科福利。";
case "Mmm yeah... At least she will be happy that all women will get paid.": return "嗯，是啊……至少，所有女人都能拿到钱，她一定会开心。";
case "Let's take vasuki to the house she is still not awake apparently she was the favorite of the night haha.": return "把瓦苏基带回家吧，还没醒呢，看来是今晚最受欢迎的，哈哈。";
case "You finally wake up Line..": return "莱茵，你总算醒了……";
case "Yes, look for me in the forest south of the hospital I have to prepare some things.": return "嗯，去医院南边的森林找我，得先准备些东西。";
case "Really!": return "真的！";
case "It may sound crazy but I think I know where she might be.": return "听着可能很疯狂，但我好像知道，她可能在哪儿。";
case "ehhh, I do not like this but if you can keep it a secret, my friend we are looking for, she is an angel.": return "呃，不太想说，不过能保密的话，我们正在找的朋友，是个天使。";
case "Line you will have to reveal the truth about Ava otherwise it will take a long time.": return "莱茵，得把艾娃的事如实说出来，否则要耽误很久。";
case "And filter it by clothing color but it would still be a problem if they did not have their head wings extended they could pass for regular humans.": return "还可以按衣服颜色筛选。可还是有个问题：头上的翅膀不展开，她们就能装成普通人。";
case "Mmm I can't really do much with that, I'd have to go through every harpy that entered this island a week ago.": return "嗯，光凭这个，还真不好办。得把一星期前进岛的所有鸟身女妖，都查一遍。";
case "And we need to find my friend has wings on her head, the last information we had was that she was seen coming to this island a few weeks ago and was wearing a black coat.": return "要找的朋友，头上长着翅膀。最新线索是，几周前有人看见她来岛上，穿着黑大衣。";
case "MsHonney said you know the location of the majority of the women on this island.": return "霍妮女士说，你知道这座岛上，大多数女人的下落。";
case "What you need from me?": return "要我做什么？";
case "Uff I don't even want to know the details, but if you are here because of her I will help you unfortunately I am also indebted to her.": return "呼，细节我都不想知道。不过既然是她让你来，我就帮你。可惜，我也欠她人情。";
case "Oh well let us just say he finally found another way to make people laugh hehe.": return "哦，就说他终于找到了另一种逗人发笑的方式吧，嘿嘿。";
case "I must admit that I am surprised that you have earned a favor from her, what a crazy thing you must have done to make her feel indebted to you.": return "不得不说，你居然能让她欠人情，真让人吃惊。到底干了什么疯狂的事？";
case "Yeah I see you're her type, dumb and pretending to be incocente.": return "嗯，看得出来，你就是她喜欢的类型，蠢，还装无辜。";
case "Yes, well, he actually left me a letter after... we talked like good friends hehe.": return "对，那个，其实他留了封信给我，就在……我们像好朋友那样，聊过之后，嘿嘿。";
case "Wait, are you here because of MsHonney?": return "等等，是蜜糖女士让你来的？";
case "Damn, look what that crazy bee got us into!": return "妈的，瞧那只疯蜜蜂，把我们害成什么样了！";
case "UHHH~ I ca not feel my legs.": return "呜——~腿都没知觉了。";
case "*SLURP* Ohh~ I had to do this task this time but Sailorcum always does her best! MUAHAHAHA!.": return "*吸溜*哦~这回，这份活儿归我，不过水手之精永远全力以赴！哇哈哈哈！";
case "Of course don't worry. <3": return "当然，放心吧。<3";
case "I am glad that with this I will not disappear from the island he.. hehe.": return "真高兴，这样就不会从岛上消失了，嘿……嘿嘿。";
case "Thanks Line I thought you would be a problem but you ended up solving a problem.": return "谢谢，莱茵，本来以为你会是个麻烦，没想到反倒解决了麻烦。";
case "We're going to kick your flabby ass that's what we'll do!": return "我们要踢烂你那松垮垮的屁股，就这么办！";
case "Yes, so what? What will you do?": return "对，所以呢？你要怎么做？";
