case "I can still walk, but I do need help I am looking for a very rare flower I heard a rumor that it was here but it seems it was not true.": return "还能走，不过确实需要帮助。我在找一种极罕见的花，传闻这里有，看来是假的。";
case "I-If there is anything I can help you with just let me know.": return "有、有什么帮得上忙的，尽管说。";
case "Oh no, I am so so-sorry this is all my fault. I should have he-held back.": return "哦，不，真、真的对不起，全是我的错。我应该忍、忍住的。";
case "Ah, I think I twisted my ankle in the fight.": return "啊，打架时，好像把脚踝扭了。";
case "Dont worry you didn't know.": return "没关系，之前又不知道。";
case "Sorry if I ofend you before.": return "抱歉，刚才冒犯你了。";
case "Thank you for understanding <3, my name is Bell I am a florist and my pronouns are they and them if you would be so kind to use them with me.": return "谢谢理解<3。我叫贝尔，是位花匠。如果方便，请别用带性别的代词来称呼我。";
case "Oh. see Lili? I knew there was something wrong.": return "哦，看吧，莉莉？就知道有问题。";
case "I a-am very sorry these flowers seem to have proproperties that affect the aggressiveness of people.": return "真、真的很抱歉，这些花，似乎有影响人攻击性的特、特性。";
case "Why are you apologizing? She attacked us out of nowhere!": return "道什么歉？她莫名其妙攻击我们！";
case "Oh, God, are you okay?": return "哦，天啊，你没事吧？";
case "lili.": return "莉莉。";
case "Oh, Go-god, are you okay?": return "哦，天、天哪，没事吧？";
case "tsk, you know I'll follow you anyway, don't act like a hero.": return "啧，反正你去哪儿，我都会跟着，少逞英雄了。";
case "Lili you can stay here I will not force you to follow me.": return "莉莉，可以留在这里，不会逼你跟来。";
case "Wow, that idea, may just be crazy enough, to get us all killed!": return "哇，这主意可真够疯狂的，说不定能把咱们全害死！";
case "My idea is that if you know the smell of the pie maybe you can follow it to her home. I know she cooks one every day so you should be able to find the right way.": return "我的想法是，知道馅饼的气味，也许就能循着味道，找到她家。我知道，她每天都会烤一个，应该能找对路。";
case "She always brought homemade pie to work and shared it with everyone, she was very good at cooking.": return "她总带自制的派去上班，分给大家，厨艺很好。";
case "A pie?": return "一个派？";
case "This is all I can offer to help you find her house.": return "要帮你找到她家，我能提供的，就这么多了。";
case "Shit, okay I'll go with you but how are we going to find his house if even his crazy fans haven't found it?": return "靠，好吧，陪你去。可连那些疯粉丝都没找到，我们怎么找她家？";
case "I-is our only chance Lili": return "莉莉，这、这是唯一的机会。";
case "Marael lives hidden in the forest as she is very popular among the VIPs and did not want to be disturbed at home.": return "玛拉艾尔很受VIP欢迎，不想在家被打扰，便隐居在森林里。";
case "I guess it makes sense but what does this crappy forest have to do with anything?!": return "好像有点道理，可这破森林，又跟这有什么关系？！";
case "The only thing that could surprise Marael is a succubus with years of experience would be an angel, I have no doubt.": return "玛拉艾尔当了那么多年魅魔，能让她吃惊的，恐怕只有天使，这点毫无疑问。";
case "have to understand that in the place where we work we find all types of customers.": return "得明白，我们工作的地方，什么客人都有。";
case "Shhh,When she resigned she looked very happy, she told me that she met someone very special who could help her to get what she really wants in life.": return "嘘，她辞职时，看起来很开心，说是遇到了一个特别的人，能帮她得到人生真正想要的东西。";
case "What does our search have to do with this succubus?": return "我们找人，和这个魅魔有什么关系？";
case "I really can not imagine a succubus being bored in that place.": return "实在想不出，一个魅魔待在那种地方，还能觉得无聊。";
case "it wasn't a big surprise she looked depressed a while ago, maybe so many years of working bored her.": return "倒也不意外，前阵子就有点抑郁，大概干了这么多年，厌倦了。";
case "Now listen, a few weeks ago Marael, the most desired VIP succubus, stopped working for me.": return "听着，几个星期前，玛拉艾尔，贵宾们最渴求的魅魔，不再替我工作了。";
case "Yes, but it's your only chance to find your friend.": return "对，可这是你找到朋友的唯一机会。";
case "Aren't we not supposed to enter this part of the forest because people disappear?": return "不是说，这片森林会有人失踪，所以不该进来吗？";
case "Sieki, why did you call us to this place?": return "茜姬，为什么把我们叫到这儿？";
case "Intertwined forests": return "交错森林";
case "*DANGER*\nDo not go further into the forest.": return "*危险*\n切勿继续深入森林。";
case "Think what you want but if you want to see your destiny you know where I am.": return "随你怎么想，真想看看自己的命运，知道去哪儿找我。";
case "Too convenient did you really see all that or are you just a pervert?": return "太巧了吧，真看到了这些，还是单纯是个变态？";
case "Thank you very much destiny is very generous it seems.": return "太感谢了，看来，命运很慷慨。";
case "Is an incense that helps you to have lucid dreams of your memories.": return "这是一种熏香，能让你在清醒梦中，重温记忆。";
case "I almost forgot to also take this the crystal sphere also showed me that it gave it to you.": return "差点忘了，这个也拿着，水晶球还显示我会把它交给你。";
case "How interesting, I have never met an elf succubus in my life.": return "真有意思，这辈子还没见过精灵魅魔。";
case "Oh it's because I'm half succubus, it must be my aura that attracts people.": return "哦，因为我是半魅魔，一定是我的气场，吸引了大家。";
case "Excellent our destinations were fulfilled, it was strangely pleasant.": return "太好了，我们的命运都应验了，意外地令人愉悦。";
case "But it'll be worth it, I promise, plus I'll be reading your fortune at a discount from time to time <3": return "不过绝对值得，保证，而且以后时不时还能给你占卜打折<3";
case "Oh, well it is better than nothing I guess.": return "哦，好吧，总比没有强。";
case "Well, hehe, first I have to pay for the tuition and then I will earn money, so it will be a while before I start earning money.": return "那个，嘿嘿，我得先交学费，之后才能赚钱，所以，还得过一阵子，才会有收入。";
case "Seriously? I pay a lot for the services of the fortune teller, you will do very well!": return "真的？请占卜师可花了不少钱，你肯定能过得很滋润！";
case "Hi Line look at me I found a teacher to practice fortune-telling.": return "嗨，莱茵，看我，找到老师学占卜了。";
case "Hey hero! Half price divination, you don't have to thank me hehe.": return "嘿，英雄！占卜半价，不用谢，嘿嘿。";
case "I will make you forget this!": return "我会让你忘记这一切！";
case "No you should not do something like that, here. * drools *": return "不，不该在这里做这种事。*流口水*";
case "What are you doing spying on me, you bloody pervert!": return "你这个该死的变态，居然偷看我！";
case "Hey, who's there?": return "喂，谁在那里？";
case "Finally it was so packed...": return "总算来了，刚才挤死了……";
case "Ohhh..OoOOOoOOHHHHHHHHH!!": return "哦——噢噢噢！";
case "What, what's going on?": return "什么，怎么回事？";
case "A well ... Bye ....                                            I'm your fan :v.": return "啊，好吧……再见……                                            我是你的粉丝:v。";
case "I_I have to go now :v": return "我、我得走了:v";
case "Really? I-I can explain it again, I have no proble-": return "真的？可、可以再解释一次，不麻——";
case "I understo-": return "我明白——";
case "You do not like it? What I did is use your slogan and well re use i-": return "不喜欢吗？我用了你的口号，然后，重新利——";
case "You are welcome, because I am Line your Heroine of trust :D.": return "不客气，因为我是莱茵，你值得信赖的女英雄:D。";
case "... Th-thank you very much.": return "……谢、谢谢。";
case "Finally Line finishes cleaning up and there is no trace of the embarrassing event.": return "莱茵终于打扫完毕，那场尴尬事件，一点痕迹也没留下。";
case "Futaba stands back in horror at the act she is witnessing.": return "双叶看着眼前这一幕，惊恐地退了开。";
case "Line starts to clean the semen puddle as quickly as possible.": return "莱茵尽可能迅速地清理那摊精液。";
case "Do not worry, I think I can help so that no one else knows about this.": return "别担心，应该能帮忙，让这件事不被别人知道。";
case "But now my career will die, everyone will know that I can't hide my urges and that I ejaculate in spurts :c *snif snfi*.": return "可现在，我的事业要完了。大家都会知道，我忍不住冲动，还会一股股地射出来:c。*抽泣*";
case "Oh I remember you are from that show! sorry, I am-I am kind of a clumsy. ( I have no idea who the hell she is :v )": return "哦，想起来了，你是那个节目里的！对不起，我、我有点笨手笨脚。（根本不知道她他妈是谁:v）";
case "I AM FUTABA YOUR TRUSTED FUTANARI, OFFICIAL PURPLECRIT COMMUNICATOR!": return "我就是双叶，你信得过的扶她，PURPLECRIT官方通讯员！";
case "What do you ask if I'm famous you don't know who you're talking to?!": return "问我出不出名？你不知道，自己在跟谁说话？！";
case "Ah, you are famous?": return "啊，你很有名？";
case "Ahh... I-I can't trust anyone if this gets out my career will die.": return "啊……不、不能相信任何人，传出去，事业就全毁了。";
case "Hey, calm down, I won't say a word.": return "喂，冷静，绝不会说出去。";
case "Shit, you're so strong!": return "妈的，你好强！";
case "No thanks to you, I was on the verge of cutting off the penis of the one in the position of the helicopter.": return "可不是你的功劳，那个摆直升机姿势的家伙，鸡巴都快让我切下来了。";
case "Thank you so much.": return "真的太感谢了。";
case "You can have as a reward the armor is better than the few arcs that Tamara would give you.": return "奖励就拿这副盔甲吧，比塔玛拉给的那几个阿克好多了。";
case "Whatever, it was a thing of the past I will report the mission as accomplished.": return "算了，已经过去了，就汇报任务完成。";
case "You seem to appreciate her a lot.": return "你似乎很珍惜她。";
case "I'm sorry for making me so mad, tamara works so hard and these parasites only give her more work.": return "抱歉，刚才太生气了。塔玛拉那么努力，这群寄生虫，却只会给她添活。";
case "After a few minutes Alura calms down.": return "几分钟后，阿露拉冷静下来。";
case "All the guards escaped without major problem.": return "所有守卫都逃走了，没出什么大问题。";
case "Line and Lili hold alura before something bad happens.": return "莱茵和莉莉抱住阿露拉，免得出事。";
case "Oh ok. :c": return "哦，好吧 :c";
case "Shiet Line it's time to intervene!": return "靠，莱茵，该插手了！";
case "You leave your position as guards and the only thing you do is give the great captain more work, the only way to do justice is for everyone to die!": return "身为卫兵，却擅离职守，只会给大队长添工作。想伸张正义，只有让所有人都死！";
case "I thought it was something small but now I see that y'all are parasites!": return "本来还以为，是点小事，现在才发现，你们全是寄生虫！";
case "I was sent to Investigate the disappearance of the guards by the great captain!": return "大队长派我来，调查守卫失踪的事！";
case "Listen everybody!": return "所有人，听好了！";
case "... does not matter how.": return "……怎么做到的，不重要。";
case ":O but how?": return ":O 可是怎么会？";
case "Oh my god, Line look at that they are doing the helicopter!": return "天啊，莱茵，快看，她们在甩直升机！";
case "It look like they were doing more thang just hanging out.": return "看来，他们可不光是在闲逛。";
case "What that hell!": return "搞什么鬼！";
case "Oh god, YES I am going, I am coming!": return "哦，天啊，对，要去了，要来了！";
case "Wof WOOF BArK Bakk GRRrr": return "汪，汪汪，汪，汪，呜——";
case "Good, that's slutty now bark how happy you are!": return "很好，够骚，现在叫两声，告诉大家你有多开心！";
case "* drooling * Im rely ejoyig tis Co-cough!": return "*流口水*偶真享受这根鸡、咳咳！";
case "You just enjoy and practice your doggie swim.": return "你好好享受，练你的狗刨就行。";
case "You don't need to take off your clothes, I'll make you a hole and that will be enough.": return "不用脱衣服，我给你弄个洞，就够了。";
case "Look back.": return "往后看。";
case "B-both sides?": return "两、两边？";
case "Today you will lose your virginity on both sides.": return "今天，前后两边都要破处。";
case "I love it I hope you can stand this.": return "我很喜欢，希望你撑得住。";
case "Ehh well yes it i-it's m-my first time (AHhhh I am a horrible hypocrite).": return "呃，嗯，对，是、是我的第一次。（啊，我真是个可怕的伪君子。）";
case "Hehe you look like a very innocent girl.": return "嘿嘿，你看起来，真是个纯情的姑娘。";
case "Now we just have to find proof of what is going on here.": return "现在，只要找到这里到底出了什么事的证据。";
case "Ah there's no need to thanks me hehe.": return "啊，不用谢，嘿嘿。";
case "Well done Lili. <3": return "干得好，莉莉。<3";
case "...(fucking fairy)": return "……（该死的妖精。）";
case "Oh of course you don't want to know.": return "哦，那你肯定不会想知道。";
case "I don't want to know.": return "不想知道。";
case "We'll take some time, we'll be doing girl things.": return "我们要忙一会儿，做点女生之间的事。";
case "That' s enough! go to the goddamn bathroom.": return "够了！去那该死的厕所。";
case "Hold on Line and we'll see what we can do.": return "莱茵，撑住，我们看看，还能怎么办。";
case "Hey hey,I don't want to be part of this conversation anymore.": return "喂，喂，这话题我不想聊了。";
case "Hey, I don't have those tas!": return "喂，我才没有那种癖好！";
case "Well if you want to see my friend pee herself that's fine, I don't judge other people's tastes.": return "你要是想看我朋友尿裤子，那也行，我不评价别人的喜好。";
case "I can't let anyone pass.": return "不能让任何人过去。";
case "Please we need your help? or do you want to see her pee.": return "拜托，得请你帮忙，还是你想看她尿出来？";
case "Ohh Lili I can't hold on any longer.": return "哦，莉莉，实在憋不住了。";
case "I am sorry sir, but we need a bathroom urgently for my friend.": return "对不起，先生，朋友急需一个厕所。";
case "*whispering* relax, I'll take care of this.": return "*小声说*放心，交给我。";
case "OH I-I do not think we think this through very well.": return "哦，我、我觉得，我们没考虑清楚。";
case "Hey, what are you doing here?!": return "喂，在这里干什么？！";
case "haha okay": return "哈哈，好吧";
case "I will, but not because you told me to.": return "会去，不过不是因为你叫我去。";
case "Lili, you can break the light bulb, maybe that way the guard won't see us pass by.": return "莉莉，能把灯泡打破吗？这样卫兵也许就看不见我们经过。";
case "Go to the other room!": return "去另一个房间！";
case "I have an idea *picks up the gun from the table*": return "我有个主意。*拿起桌上的枪*";
case "Now how do we get him to leave his post?": return "现在，怎么让他离开岗位？";
case "Mmm.. must be in the room that the guard is guarding.": return "嗯……一定在卫兵守着的那个房间。";
case "If all this money exists, we can't let them use it, more people could be in danger.": return "如果真有这笔钱，不能让他们用，可能害更多人遇险。";
case "Line we have to look for the rest of the arcs and burn them all.": return "莱茵，得找到剩下的阿克，一把火全烧了。";
case "So far all the rumors have been true.": return "目前为止，传闻全是真的。";
case "We will take everything as evidence.": return "所有东西，都当证据带走。";
case "How terrible, then you were right.": return "太可怕了，原来你是对的。";
case "These are... dental records of humans.": return "这些是……人类的牙科档案。";
case "They seem to be in a hurry.": return "看起来，他们很着急。";
case "What a disaster.": return "真是一场灾难。";
case "Oh sorry.": return "哦，对不起。";
case "Hey, the guard will be able to see you if you walk by.": return "喂，你走过去的话，卫兵会看见。";
case "Oh sorry": return "哦，对不起";
case "Hey if we don't go now we won't be able to find evidence of what's going on here.": return "喂，现在不走，就找不到证据，查清这里在发生什么。";
case "Unfortunately Vasuki Line and Lili end up cornered.": return "不幸的是，瓦苏基、莱茵和莉莉，最终被逼进了死角。";
case "Vasuki incinerates all the arcs before the guards arrive.": return "守卫赶到前，瓦苏基烧毁了所有阿克。";
case "quick Vasuki use your fire breath.": return "快，瓦苏基，用火焰吐息。";
case "Hey what are you doing over there!": return "喂，你在那边干什么！";
case "Oh ok just try to keep the fire under control.": return "哦，好，尽量控制住火势。";
case "We have already made this far we have to burn it all down.": return "既然都到这一步了，就得全部烧光。";
case "Lo-look Vasuki, the table is full of Arcs.": return "看、看啊，瓦苏基，桌子上全是阿克。";
case "Well everything is ready, go to the VIP lounge of the bar and I will tell you what to do.": return "都准备好了，去酒吧VIP厅，再告诉你该怎么做。";
case "Oh Line you are such a good person I guess that's why I like you hehe.": return "莱茵，你真是个好人，所以，我才喜欢你吧，嘿嘿。";
case "No vasuki, I was also part of all this, I will help you in everything. <3 (please don't leave me out of this).": return "不，瓦苏基，这些事也有我的份，会全力帮你。<3（求求你，别把我排除在外。）";
case "Wait Line didn't do anything I brought her with me it was all my fault.": return "等等，莱茵什么都没干，是我带来的，全是我的错。";
case "Perfect because I manage the vip section of the bar and my idea is to create a special day in which you will be the onaholes, 24 hours uninterrupted and the Vip will continue even if you are unconscious and I guess we would make enough money to solve all this problem.": return "太好了，我负责酒吧的贵宾区，打算开个特别活动日：让你们连续24小时充当肉便器，哪怕昏过去，贵宾们也不会停。赚的钱，应该足够解决这次的问题。";
case "Whatever it takes for those women to get paid. :c": return "只要能让那些女人拿到工钱，做什么都行。:c";
case "Wait I have an idea of how they could get all that money.": return "等等，我想到他们可能怎么弄到这些钱了。";
case "Sorry but both will have to go to the jail-farm.": return "抱歉，两位都得去监狱农场。";
case "Even worse, you burned all the money that was going to be given to the onahole for their work.": return "更糟的是，烧掉的那些钱，全是要发给肉便器的工钱。";
case "Th-then it was all a misunderstanding.": return "那、那原来全是误会。";
case "No, thank you very much aunty.": return "不用了，太谢谢了，阿姨。";
case "Oh, ho ho sorry to bother I spilled the flour in the kitchen and the guards helped me clean it up a little bit, but nothing happened to the cake, don't worry, anyone want some?": return "哦，呵呵，抱歉打扰。厨房里把面粉撒了，卫兵帮我稍微清理了一下。不过蛋糕没事，别担心，有谁想吃吗？";
case "An-and what about th-the guards with the white dust in their hands?": return "可、可那些手上有白粉的守卫，又、又是怎么回事？";
case "Is part of the onahole contract is their dental insurance and records.": return "这是肉便器合同的一部分，包括牙科保险和档案。";
case "What, but what do you need dental records for??": return "什么，可为什么需要牙科档案？？";
case "No you donkey, it's the money you earn for the VIP services under the bar even Line knows the place.": return "不是，你这头蠢驴，就是在酒吧下面，给贵宾服务赚的钱，连莱茵都知道那地方。";
case "B-but what about the women and the dental records, weren't they selling them?!": return "可、可那些女人和牙科档案呢，不是在贩卖她们吗？！";
case "You are completly insane! when a business makes too much money it moves to a safe place to lower the likelihood of theft on the premises in addition to correctly applying the taxes.": return "彻底疯了！店里赚的钱太多，就会转移到安全的地方，减少被盗风险，还得照章纳税。";
case "The worst thing is that you ask me that kind of question when there were a lot of arcs at this table.": return "最离谱的是，桌上堆着那么多阿克，还能问出这种问题。";
case "Women were entering and leaving with chains and necklaces and some guards were leaving this house with white powder residue on their hands.": return "不断有女人戴着锁链、项圈进进出出，还有些卫兵离开屋子时，手上留着白色粉末。";
case "I'm not an idiot before I heard the rumors I took a closer look at this house.": return "我又不傻，听到那些传闻之前，就把这间屋子仔细查过了。";
case "But you're crazy! at least you have proof of it?!": return "你疯了吧！至少，得有证据啊？！";
case "Don't play dumb, Vasuki told me that this house is used for human trafficking in addition to selling drugs.": return "少装傻，瓦苏基告诉我，这房子不光卖毒品，还做人口贩卖。";
case "What the hell are you talking about?": return "你到底在说什么鬼话？";
case "We trusted you great captain but what you are doing here is simply dreadful.": return "我们信任你，大队长，可你在这里做的事，简直令人发指。";
case "Yeah!": return "好耶！";
case "What any person would do, justice!": return "任何正常人都会做的事，伸张正义！";
case "What do you think you are doing?!": return "你以为自己在干什么？！";
case "Let's keep looking for clues, I need to corroborate if they are trafficking people.": return "继续找线索，我得确认，她们是不是在贩卖人口。";
case "Mmmm ok.": return "嗯，好吧。";
case "Line don't touch anything, it fell a little in the bag with the arcs let's take that as evidence.": return "莱茵，别乱碰。装阿克的袋子里洒了一点，就拿那个当证据。";
case "Eh I don't think anyone bakes with a bag full of Arcs next to them.": return "呃，可没人会一边烤东西，一边在旁边放一包阿克币。";
case "looks like someone is baking something.": return "好像有人，在烤东西。";
case "Mmm it must be nothing I must be a little paranoid.": return "嗯，应该没什么，是我有点疑神疑鬼。";
case "Yes... but these are strange, I've never seen them moving like this.": return "是啊……可这些很奇怪，从没见过它们这样动。";
case "But as long as we don't touch them we'll be fine, right?": return "不过，只要不碰，就没事，对吧？";
case "Those flowers are the same ones I picked where we met, the ones that produce aggression.": return "那些花和我们相遇的地方采到的一样，会引发攻击性。";
case "Wh-what is wrong?": return "怎、怎么了？";
case "Mmm yes line. but there is something strange.": return "嗯，莱茵，不过有点奇怪。";
case "Bell is that the flower you are looking for?": return "贝尔，那就是你要找的花吗？";
case "*The flower starts to shake* Eh?": return "*花开始颤动*咦？";
case "Take *coughs* the flower Line quickly please.": return "莱茵，快，拿走*咳嗽*那朵花，求你了。";
case "*coughs* No, it's already kicking in.": return "*咳嗽*不，已经开始起效了。";
case "Are you ok Bell?!": return "没事吧，贝尔？！";
case "I can't resist any longer either, I need to do it. *Bell puts his foot on Line's head*": return "我也忍不住了，必须做。*贝尔把脚，踩到莱茵头上*";
case "Oh god, I can not containt myself, I WANNA DOIT.": return "天哪，忍不住了，我想做！";
case "Oh OHH, this tingling sensation all over my body.": return "哦，哦——浑身上下，都在发麻。";
case "Ah Line this is not good.": return "啊，莱茵，这可不妙。";
case "*The flower releases a purple smoke*": return "*花朵释放出紫色烟雾*";
case "Thank you so much Line I don't know how I could return the favor.": return "太谢谢了，莱茵，真不知道该怎么报答。";
case "The flower took a lot of damage, but I can still save it.": return "花伤得很重，不过还能救。";
case "I am... more than perfect. *gasping*": return "我……好得不能再好了。*喘气*";
case "I'm sorry Line the flowers made me more aggressive, are you okay?": return "对不起，莱茵，那些花，让我变得更暴躁了，你没事吧？";
case "Oh... Oh, god my ass.": return "哦……天哪，我的屁股。";
case "maybe two penises, like shark men?": return "也许有两根阴茎，像鲨鱼人那样？";
case "Ya, made me grow a penis... wonder what would happen if a guy ate one?": return "对，让我长出鸡巴了……不知道男人吃了会怎样？";
case "Didn't you eat those fruits with Vasuki?": return "你不是跟瓦苏基，一起吃过那些水果吗？";
case "great let's get moving? I-i don't have a whole lot of time...~": return "太好了，快点行动？没、没多少时间……~";
case "*Line feels naoki's precum from being in heat.* Do not worry, I-i will look for them as soon as possible.": return "*莱茵感觉到了直树因发情而流出的前列腺液。*别担心，我、我会尽快去找。";
case "If you can grab some purple mushrooms, fura fura and hea hea fruit um... and milk. I think I can grab the rest. You can probably find the mushrooms one in the swamp, t-the milk and the fruits from the farm...": return "要是能帮忙拿点紫蘑菇、芙拉芙拉果、希亚希亚果，嗯……还有牛奶，剩下的应该能自己弄到。蘑菇大概在沼泽，牛、牛奶和水果，就去农场找……";
case "So? what do we need to grab then?": return "所以，要拿什么？";
case "I-i mean... if I want to get it done before the urge gets too bad... th-then yes... I-ill need help. Need to gather a bunch of ingredients again.": return "我、我是说……要在冲动变得太强之前搞定……那、那就对……需、需要帮忙。又得收集一堆材料。";
case "Well? Do you need any help? With the potion perhaps?": return "怎么样，需要帮忙吗？比如，那个药水？";
case "N-no! G-guys c-can get t-that urge!~ mhm! definitely!... at least I-i do...~": return "不、不是！男、男生也、也会有那、那种冲动！~嗯！肯定会！……至少，我、我会……~";
case "Arnt you a guy though? Isn't that a girl thing?": return "可你不是男生吗？那不是女生才有的事？";
case "N-no!~ I-i um... Im gonna start going into heat soon and in the mating season werewolves are somewhat more aggressive than usual.": return "不、不是！~我、我，呃……马上要发情了，狼人在交配季会比平时更有攻击性。";
case "Hot? why do you need a werewolf to cool down?": return "热？为什么得找个狼人，才能凉快？";
case "*Looks at the ground* O-okay... I-I'm a-a little... h-hot right now...~": return "*看着地面*好、好吧……我、我现在……有、有点热……~";
case "Are we really ganna do this again? *Crosses arms*": return "真要再来一遍？*抱起双臂*";
case "Ehh, forget what I said, it's really n-nothing!~~": return "呃，忘了我刚才说的吧，真、真的没什么！~~";
case "Wait a minute, why pacify him with a potion you could perfectly well stop them with your magic?": return "等等，明明能用魔法制服，为什么还要用药水安抚？";
case "Oh no! there are dangerous werewolves on the loose?": return "哦，不！有危险的狼人跑出来了？";
case "F-f-fine!~ I-i was going to use it to... p-pacify a w-werewolf...": return "好、好、好吧！~我、我本来想用它……安、安抚一只狼、狼人……";
case "A potion that dose nothing, come one its gatta do soooomething.": return "什么效果都没有的药？拜托，总得有点用吧。";
case "N-n-nothing!!~~ *Blushing*": return "没、没、没什么！！~~*脸红*";
case "A potion!? What does it do huh.": return "药水？！有什么用？";
case "Oh... u-um n-not much. W-was j-just trying to make a new p-potion": return "哦……没、没什么。就、就是想做一种新的药、药水。";
case "We just saw you and wanted to see what you were working on.": return "刚看见你，想来看看你在忙什么。";
case "So... um... C-can I ask wh-why your both here? a-and um... how you found me?": return "所以……呃，能、能问问，你、你们两个怎么来了？还、还有，怎么找到我的？";
case "I-I'm fine.": return "我、我没事。";
case "Na-naoki are you okay?": return "直、直树，你没事吧？";
case "Did you get the materials Line?": return "材料找齐了吗，莱茵？";
case "Look line there is another werewolf a-after all this y-you need a pay off too~ T-they will be a bit more a-aggressive b-but you like i-it rough? R-right?~~ *Naoki releases the bindings and lets the werewolves pounce them and have their way*": return "看啊，莱茵，还有另一只狼人。毕、毕竟忙了这些，你、你也该有点报酬~它、它们会稍微暴、暴躁些，可、可你喜欢粗、粗暴一点，对、对吧？~~*直树解开束缚，任由狼人扑向他们，肆意享用。*";
case "All set now they won't cause any problems although as you can see they are still very energetic *points to the bulge in the wolf's pants*.": return "全搞定了，现在不会再惹麻烦，不过也看见了，还是精力旺盛。*指着狼裤裆鼓起的地方*";
case "Naoki uses a chain magic to stop them and administer the pacifying potion.": return "直树使用锁链魔法制止她们，喂下镇静药水。";
case "Suddenly, two unleashed werewolves appear with a large bulge visible in their pants.": return "突然，两个失控的狼人出现了，裤裆明显鼓起一大包。";
case "Line Lili and Naoki wait for the werewolves.": return "莱茵、莉莉和直树，等着狼人到来。";
case "*Starts to get red* Then l-lest hurry i-its s-starting t-to be too much~ *He rubs his crotch through his clothes, a bulge visible": return "*开始脸红*那、那就快点，已、已经快、快受不了了~*隔着衣服揉起胯下，鼓包清晰可见";
case "It is very tempting especially for that last part~": return "很诱人，尤其是最后那部分~";
case "Sounds interesting and we can stay around for the show? (Oh no I am  a furry)": return "听着有意思，我们能留下来看吗？（哦，不，我是兽控。）";
case "You want to help me hunt down and subdue a werewolf? That's all we needed.": return "想帮我猎捕、制服一只狼人？正缺这个。";
case "The potion is ready.": return "药水做好了。";
case "Uff it is a little hot in here hehe.": return "呼，这里有点热，嘿嘿。";
case "Wow naoki you're so hot you're spurting precum": return "哇，直树，你发情得，都在往外喷前列腺液。";
case "Great, give me the ingredients and I'll do the rest.": return "太好了，把材料交给我，剩下的我来。";
case "Naoki we get everything you need!": return "直树，需要的东西，全找齐了！";
case "Good show girls and boys it's time to go Line.": return "演得不错，姑娘小伙们。莱茵，该走了。";
case "Ye.e.es, I-I'm going to rest for a while": return "好、好、好，我、我要歇一会儿。";
case "Oh yes.. we tranquilized the werewolves or something like that.": return "哦，对，把狼人安抚下来了，差不多吧。";
case "The astray path": return "迷途";
case "It has been reported that many people have been lost in this part of the forest if you are lost and manage to find this sign, take the path to the right.": return "据报告，已有多人在这片森林失踪。迷路后若有幸找到此告示，请走右边的路。";
case "LINE D:!": return "莱茵 D:！";
case "OOOOKKKKKK!": return "好——吧！";
case "Yes, be careful not to stumble.": return "嗯，小心，别绊倒。";
case "It seems that the scent is coming from down here.": return "香味好像从下面传来。";
case "Uy sorry.": return "哎，对不起。";
case "Line gets out of there, you will fall down!": return "莱茵，离开那里，会掉下去的！";
case "Yes, do not worry, I fell in these plants by luck.": return "嗯，别担心，幸好摔到了这些植物上。";
case "Line for God's sake, are you okay?!": return "莱茵，老天，你没事吧？！";
case "Follow me.": return "跟我来。";
case "How about we talk everything over at my place and you can even try some of my pie.": return "去我家把话都说清楚，怎么样？还可以尝尝我烤的馅饼。";
case "Aww dear you don't know much about succubus do you?": return "哎呀，亲爱的，对魅魔了解得不多吧？";
case "You-you are Marael? you do not look like a succubus.": return "你、你是玛拉艾尔？看着不像魅魔。";
case "Wait you were looking for me?": return "等等，在找我？";
case "Yes, Line then we can continue looking for Marael.": return "对，莱茵，之后再继续找玛拉艾尔。";
case "Come to my house darling, you still haven't regained all your strength.": return "到家里来吧，亲爱的，力量还没完全恢复呢。";
case "Wait a little while I'll help you stand up.": return "等等，我扶你起来。";
case "Do not worry, luckily I fell into this pile of flowers.": return "别担心，幸好掉进了这堆花里。";
case "Line please dont die!": return "莱茵，求你别死！";
case "Uhhhh I think so.": return "呃，应该是。";
case "Are you ok darling?": return "亲爱的，你没事吧？";
case "Oh my goodness!": return "我的天哪！";
case "So close to knowing something about your missing friend fills you with determination and I guess it also tuns you on or something like that.": return "就快知道失踪朋友的线索，让你充满了决心，顺便也兴奋起来了，还是什么的。";
case "Uhmm.. it looks like there is a cave behind the barrier.": return "嗯……屏障后面，好像有个洞穴。";
case "Why would someone put this here?": return "谁会把这个放在这里？";
case "A magic barrier is blocking the way.": return "一道魔法屏障挡住了去路。";
case "She doesn't even have a chair for her husband.": return "她连给丈夫坐的椅子，都没有。";
case "A single chair for a family table.": return "家庭餐桌旁，只有一把椅子。";
case "hehe how can I forget that": return "嘿嘿，我怎么会忘呢。";
case "Remember the magazines your mother used to have?": return "还记得妈妈以前藏的那些杂志吗？";
case "Not the books you would expect from a succubus.": return "不像是会出现在魅魔家里的书。";
case "Cookbooks, how to raise a child and romance novels.": return "菜谱、育儿书，还有爱情小说。";
case "No, I asked you to help me bring out my succubus side, not to be a criminal!": return "不，我让你帮我释放魅魔的一面，不是去当罪犯！";
case "didn't you ask me to help you do new things?": return "不是求我，带你做点新鲜事吗？";
case "Lili, you are a very bad influence, you know that?": return "莉莉，你知道吗，你真把人带坏了。";
case "Are you going to steal one?": return "你要偷一本？";
case "Wow here ... she keeps her erotic books.": return "哇，这里……放着她的色情书。";
case "yeah, there's something weir here.": return "对，这里有古怪。";
case "how strange this must have been purchased before the cave collapse.": return "真奇怪，这个肯定是洞窟坍塌前买的。";
case "Line look at this she has enough food to live here for months!": return "莱茵，看看，她储备的食物，够在这里住上几个月！";
case "Until next time, your favorite succubus -Willow Adams.": return "下次再见，你最喜欢的魅魔——薇洛·亚当斯。";
case "Just volunteer as a guard and we'll have our girls night out. <3": return "去报名当守卫，然后我们就能过个女生之夜了。<3";
case "Come visit me if you feel sad or if you want to talk about what we will do after the angel grants us our wishes.": return "难过的时候，来看看我吧。或者，一起聊聊，等天使实现我们的愿望后，要做什么。";
case "Hi Marael I hope you are well, I want you to know that I will be at the abandoned Big Dream building like in the old days.": return "嗨，玛拉艾尔，希望你一切都好。我会和从前一样，待在废弃的“大梦想”大楼，想告诉你一声。";
case "I'm sorry Line I can't talk to you right now, I'm preparing a surprise for you <3.": return "对不起，莱茵，现在不能说话，正在给你准备惊喜<3。";
case "If you need me, I'll be in the kitchen.": return "需要的话，我就在厨房。";
case "haha it will be just like home.": return "哈哈，会跟家里一样。";
case "I have a room that I use as a storage room, you can sleep there.": return "有间当仓库用的房间，可以睡在那里。";
case "Thank you very much Miss Marael for everything. <3": return "玛拉艾尔女士，真的谢谢你为我们做的一切<3。";
case "Hey, don't be sad, darling, I can teach you some succubus stuff if it makes you feel better.": return "别难过，亲爱的，要是能让你心情好些，我可以教你一点魅魔的本事。";
case "Ohh I guess there's nothing left to do but wait. :c": return "哦，看来，除了等待，也没别的办法了:c。";
case "But don't worry, the guards should be working to open the exit.": return "不过别担心，卫兵应该正在想办法打开出口。";
case "I am sorry but you will not be able to leave, there was a cave-in in the caverns that block the road to the town.": return "抱歉，现在走不了，洞窟塌方，通往镇上的路被堵住了。";
case "dear wait.": return "亲爱的，等等。";
case "This is terrible, thank you very much for everything Miss Marael but we will have to go, we have to continue with the search of our friend.": return "太糟糕了。玛拉艾尔女士，非常感谢你做的一切，不过，我们得走了，还得继续寻找朋友。";
case "He... he works off the island so I was very surprised that he came to visit me so unexpectedly.": return "他……在岛外工作，所以突然过来看我，真的很意外。";
case "Mhmm and where is he now?": return "嗯，他现在在哪儿？";
case "Oh well I ran into my husband in town haha I haven't seen him in a long time. ": return "哦，在镇上碰见丈夫了，哈哈，好久没见了。 ";
case "But then who was the person you met who surprised you so much!? Sieki said it had to be someone very special.": return "可你遇见的那个，让你如此惊喜的人，到底是谁！？茜姬说，那一定是个特别的人。";
case "Nice to meet you both and about your friend unfortunately I have not seen her.": return "很高兴认识你们。至于你们的朋友，很遗憾，没见过。";
case "I-I am so sorry I did not introduce myself before, I am Line and this is my fairy's familiar her name is Lili.": return "对、对不起，之前没介绍。我叫莱茵，这是仙子使魔，叫莉莉。";
case "Oh... your name was Line right?": return "哦……叫莱茵，对吧？";
case "We need your help we are looking for my friend Ava she is an angel and Saeki said you might know about her.": return "我们需要你的帮助，在找我的朋友艾娃，她是个天使。茜姬说，你可能知道她的事。";
case "You're welcome, I haven't seen people from a while ago, you can eat whatever you want and stay as long as you want <3.": return "不用谢，好久没见到人了，想吃什么就吃，想待多久都行<3。";
case "Thank you Marael for inviting us to your home.": return "玛拉艾尔，谢谢你请我们来家里做客。";
case "Let's search the house she must have another way out of this place.": return "搜搜这栋房子，她一定还有别的路，能离开这里。";
case "FUCK Line don't lose your sanity let's try to stay cool maybe we can get out of this.": return "妈的，莱茵，别失去理智，冷静一点，也许还能脱身。";
case "If so, Sieki is helping by taking easy and desperate prey like us!": return "要是这样，茜姬帮忙，就是把我们这种绝望、好下手的人，当猎物抓走！";
case "Was the only thing in that cave, maybe she uses that hole to trap people.": return "洞穴里只有那个，也许，她就用那个洞，困住别人。";
case "Shit you remember when you fell, you fell in a bed of flowers!": return "靠，还记得摔下来时吗？你摔进了花丛里！";
case "Do you think she is the kidnapper of the forest D:?": return "她会不会就是森林里的绑匪D:？";
case "Yes, I noticed that too.": return "对，我也注意到了。";
case "Lili, do not you think there is something odd going on here?": return "莉莉，不觉得这里，有些不对劲吗？";
case "I don't think so, she's in the kitchen, just watch and act like you don't know anything, when she goes to sleep we keep looking.": return "应该不会，她在厨房。留心看，装作什么都不知道，等她睡着，再继续找。";
case "Do you think she heard us?": return "你觉得，她听见我们了吗？";
case "LINEE! I have something for you come to the kitchen.": return "莱茵——！有东西给你，来厨房。";
case "mhmm I don't know but I'm seeing a pattern here just look at this place Marael is also hiding.": return "嗯，不知道，不过发现点规律了。看看这个地方，玛拉艾尔也躲着人。";
case "Not that I know, besides, why is this succubus hiding?": return "据我所知，没有。再说，这只魅魔，为什么要躲起来？";
case "Can Ava do that?": return "艾娃能做到？";
case "But what is this about an angel granting wishes?": return "可天使实现愿望，到底又是怎么回事？";
case "Uff at least she is not a crazy psychopath.": return "呼，至少不是个疯狂杀人魔。";
case "Lili this is what she was hiding she knows Ava!": return "莉莉，这就是她藏的秘密，她认识艾娃！";
case "Don't worry it was my fault and always will be.": return "别担心，这是我的错，永远都是。";
case "I am so sorry I didnt want to come to this I am very sorry for your husband.": return "真的对不起，没想过会闹成这样，你丈夫的事，实在很遗憾。";
case "Poor little girl this is not the pie I was going to give you but here eat this fruit and release yourself with me.": return "可怜的小姑娘，本来没打算给你吃这个，不过来，吃下水果，和我一起释放吧。";
case "Miss Marael no matter how much I masturbate in front of you-I can not stop and I can't finish.": return "玛拉艾尔女士，不管当着你的面自慰多少次，我、我都停不下来，也结束不了。";
case "OHhh is my all my fault it must be my powers succubus darling, I've been here alone for so long that I haven't suppressed my powers.": return "哦——都怪我，肯定是魅魔的力量，亲爱的。独自在这里太久，都忘了压制能力。";
case "*starts masturbating* I am so sorry, Miss Marael, but can not resist being near you, it turns me on so much I do not know why.": return "*开始自慰*玛拉艾尔女士，真的很对不起，可一靠近你，就忍不住兴奋，不知道为什么。";
case "Oh.... Line.": return "哦……莱茵。";
case "UHhh Line I dont think is talking about that pie. *Line please don't do anything stupid.*": return "呃，莱茵，我觉得，她说的不是那种馅饼。*莱茵，求你别犯傻。*";
case "YO-YO-YOU WANT ME TO EAT YOUR PLUM, WARM, MOIST,PIE!": return "你、你、你想让我吃你的李子馅饼，又温热、又湿润的馅饼！";
case "Oh dont worry would you like some 'PIE', Darling....?": return "哦，别担心，想尝点“馅饼”吗，亲爱的……？";
case "Ohh mmm yeah I-I am so sorry I got carried away *what is wrong with me just being near her I am losing my mind*": return "哦，嗯，是，我、我真的很抱歉，太忘形了。*怎么回事，光在她身边，就要失去理智*";
case "OHhh Line haha, you're so excited, you told me mom how cute you are <3": return "哦，莱茵，哈哈，太兴奋了吧，居然喊我妈妈，真可爱<3。";
case "Excited is not enough to describe what I'm feeling right now, momy.": return "妈妈，“兴奋”，根本不足以形容我现在的感觉。";
case "Are you excited about the gift I'm going to give you darling?": return "亲爱的，想到我要给你的礼物，兴奋吗？";
case "Just act normal and stop looking at her ass! *whispering*": return "表现正常点，别再盯着她的屁股！*低声*";
case "Wow Lili she just has an apron and she has a big *glup* bum *whispering*.": return "哇，莉莉，她只穿了条围裙，还有个好大的*咽口水*屁股。*小声说*";
case "Yes yes I am sorry :c": return "嗯，嗯，对不起:c。";
case "Wake up Line! you really want to find Ava! *whispering*": return "清醒点，莱茵，还想不想找到艾娃了！*低声*";
case "Uhh no way, I'm exhausted, let's do it better tomorrow.": return "呃，不行，累坏了，还是明天再做吧。";
case "It is. Let's look around the house for more clues now that she's asleep.": return "确实。趁她睡着，到屋里再找找线索。";
case "Mhmm that's a little strange": return "嗯，确实有点奇怪。";
case "Marael went to sleep and told us not to go out until the morning.": return "玛拉艾尔睡了，叮嘱我们，早上之前，别出门。";
case "Ah ahmmm wh-what?": return "啊，嗯，什、什么？";
case "Line! Line! wake up! *whispering*": return "莱茵！莱茵！醒醒！*小声说*";
case "Very well I'm going to go to my room to sleep good night. <3": return "好，回房间睡觉了，晚安。<3";
case "Ok ok I'll tell Line when she wakes up.": return "好，好，醒了就告诉莱茵。";
case "It is important so I will repeat it, do not leave this room until morning.": return "很重要，所以再说一遍，天亮之前，不许离开这个房间。";
case "Oh and don't leave the room there are so many boxes you could bump into and break something.": return "哦，也别离开房间，箱子太多，可能撞上，摔坏东西。";
case "She will most likely wake up in the morning she needs to regain a lot of energy.": return "大概明早才会醒，她需要恢复很多能量。";
case "Yes, don't worry, I'll take care of her (does she really have a husband, wouldn't he have already looked for help to get home?)": return "好，别担心，我会照顾她。（她真的有丈夫吗？如果有，不早该找人帮忙回家了吗？）";
case "The poor thing couldn't even reach climax on her own and dont worry I'll tell my husband later, he knows I'm a succubus.": return "可怜的，自己连高潮都做不到。别担心，之后会告诉丈夫，他知道我是魅魔。";
case "Lili takes care of Line I think I overdid it a little when I took her energy but how could I not hold back haha it's been a while since my last time haha.": return "莉莉，照顾好莱茵，吸她能量时，好像有点过火。可怎么忍得住呢，哈哈，毕竟好久没做了，哈哈。";
case "Good night darling.": return "晚安，亲爱的。";
case "let's wait for Marael to go to sleep to investigate further.": return "等玛拉艾尔睡着，我们再继续调查。";
case "It looks like there is a door behind these boxes.": return "这些箱子后面，好像藏着一扇门。";
case "Lili Look!": return "莉莉，你看！";
case "I cannot leave yet without knowing something about Ava.": return "没问出艾娃的消息，我还不能走。";
case "Wha :v?": return "什么 :v？";
case "What-what the fuck are you doing?": return "什、你他妈在干什么？";
case "*Start praying*": return "*开始祈祷*";
case "Yeah, for better or for worse.": return "是啊，无论好坏。";
case "These pies helped us to find marael.": return "这些馅饼，帮我们找到了玛拉艾尔。";
case "it is now or never we are going to find out what is behind all this.": return "就是现在，错过就没机会，去查清这后面的一切。";
case "And the boxes that cover the door are gone.": return "还有，挡门的那些箱子没了。";
case "Lili Marael is not in her room sleeping.": return "莉莉，玛拉艾尔没在自己房间里睡觉。";
case "I guess I am doing it for me too, so I will not fail to help her.": return "我想，也是为了自己，所以绝不会放弃帮她。";
case "I did not know about the downside of being a succubus, I want to help her as much as I can... if something like this happens to me someday, maybe I can be a little more prepared than her.": return "以前不知道，当魅魔还有这些坏处。我想尽力帮她……如果哪天，我也遇到这种事，至少，能比她多一点准备。";
case "And what are you going to do with Marael, it's a giant promise you made to her?": return "那玛拉艾尔怎么办？你可是向她许下了天大的承诺。";
case "And your mother managed to form a nice family with your father, even if she didn't teach you anything about how to be a succubus, she did have a happy ending.": return "你妈妈，最终和爸爸组成了美满的家庭。即使没教过你怎么做魅魔，她也有了自己的幸福结局。";
case "I don't know Line, but you're only a half succubus, who knows what will happen in the future.": return "不知道，莱茵，你毕竟只有一半魅魔血统，谁知道以后会怎样。";
case "Do you think I could end up like miss marael?": return "我也可能变得像玛拉艾尔女士那样吗？";
case "Yes Line?": return "怎么了，莱茵？";
case "This will increase your damage but reduce the amount of life you recover.": return "这会提高你的伤害，但减少生命恢复量。";
case "If Line gets a large amount of match in a fight, Lewdserker will be activated.": return "如果莱茵在一场战斗中，达成大量消除，就会进入淫欲狂战状态。";
case "Line feels an energy coming from inside her along with a great burning from her womb.": return "莱茵感觉体内涌起一股能量，伴随着子宫里强烈的灼热。";
case "... I will not promise but if I can do something I will let you know.": return "……我不能保证，不过，能做点什么的话，会告诉你的。";
case "Oh beautiful, it's not necessary, I really don't think I can bear another promise that doesn't come true, I really love that you think of me, but you have to know when to give up.": return "哦，美人，不用了。真的受不了又一个无法兑现的承诺。你能想着我，真的很开心，不过也该知道，什么时候要放弃。";
case "... I know I am lucky and I will try to make that luck come to you too.": return "……知道自己很幸运，也会努力把这份幸运带给你。";
case "You are very lucky to have someone by your side who cares about you and supports you.": return "身边有一个关心、支持你的人，你真的很幸运。";
case "So true Lili <3 !": return "说得对，莉莉<3！";
case "Knowing yourself is part of life Marael, it may bring you problems but we'll work it out together right Line?": return "玛拉艾尔，认识自己，也是人生的一部分。也许会有麻烦，但我们一起解决就好，对吧，莱茵？";
case "Miss Marael, thank you so much, but it's something I really needed to do. I will always remember you as another mother figure to me <3.": return "玛拉艾尔女士，真的很感谢，不过这件事，我必须亲自去做。会永远记住你，把你当作另一个妈妈<3。";
case "... the hunger that you feel is the gluttony of the succubus, as you are half elf it is not necessary that you copulate to get energy but the feeling of emptiness always exists... Line you are a very good girl I really hope this action doesn't bring you any tragedy.": return "……感受到的饥饿，是魅魔的贪食之欲。你有一半精灵血统，不必靠交媾补充能量，可那种空虚感，一直都在……莱茵，你是个好姑娘，真心希望，这样做不会给你带来悲剧。";
case "Aghh I feel strange, a little more awake and very hungry.": return "啊，感觉很奇怪，清醒了点，还特别饿。";
case "That it is good to see new faces for a change.": return "换换样子，看见新面孔，真好。";
case "I did not insist anymore, I told her that I was fine and if she had time to visit them that it would do her good.": return "我没再坚持，只说自己没事。她要是有空，去看看他们，对她也有好处。";
case "She said she had no energy and wanted some time alone.": return "她说没什么精力，想独自待一阵。";
case "But I failed.": return "可是我失败了。";
case "We talked, I tried to explain to her that they needed help without specifying that without her help all would be lost.": return "我们聊过，试着解释，她们需要帮助，但没明说，没有她帮忙，一切就都完了。";
case "I know that Ms. Marael is praying for someone to save her and for that reason I feel that this will be positive for her.": return "我知道，玛拉艾尔女士一直在祈求有人救她，所以，我觉得，这对她会是件好事。";
case "But she was sadder than usual, she just did not seem to be helping anyone.": return "可她比平时更难过，看起来，也没能帮上任何人。";
case "I know that she more than anyone else will want to help these children.": return "知道她比任何人，都更想帮助这些孩子。";
case "She was surprised to learn of the situation of the orphans and their caregivers.": return "得知孤儿和照顾他们的人所处的境地，她很吃惊。";
case "I told Ms. Marael everything.": return "我把一切，都告诉了玛拉艾尔女士。";
case "I am really sorry.": return "真的很抱歉。";
case "Don't d-do this to me, I-I beg you.": return "别、别这样对我，我、我求你了。";
case "Line please, this is my last chance to be happy in life..": return "莱茵，求你，这是我这辈子最后一次获得幸福的机会。";
case "I am sorry Miss Marael, you will have to give me that relic, I will return it to the Knights of Elira.": return "对不起，玛拉艾尔女士，得把那件圣物交给我，我会还给艾莉拉骑士。";
case "Line listen to me I know I have told many lies since you arrived but you know in your heart that I am a good person please come back to the house.": return "莱茵，听我说，你来之后，我确实撒过很多谎。可你心里知道，我是个好人，求你回家来。";
case "No! the games are over, we know you know Ava as well as the wish the angel will grant you.": return "不！别再装了，我们知道你认识艾娃，也知道天使会满足你一个愿望。";
case "darling you need to get out of here, then we can talk more calmly about this.": return "亲爱的，先离开这里，之后再冷静地谈这件事。";
case "Don't come any closer!": return "别过来！";
case "Line, what are you doing here?!": return "莱茵，在这里做什么？！";
case "Miss Marael-that's one of the stolen relics!": return "玛拉艾尔女士，那是被盗的圣遗物之一！";
case "I used my last strength to summon some tentacles and take her to bed.": return "用最后的力气，召出了几条触手，把她带上床。";
case "It seemed that she was carrying a great burden and was finally able to reveal it to someone else.": return "她似乎背负着沉重的负担，终于能向另一个人吐露。";
case "When Marael stopped crying she fell asleep.": return "玛拉艾尔哭完后，睡着了。";
case "And I promise I will do everything I can to help you so you can have a beautiful and loving family.": return "我保证，会尽我所能帮助你，让你也能拥有一个美好、充满爱的家。";
case "But I honestly don't think she has the power to grant wishes.": return "不过说实话，不觉得她真有实现愿望的能力。";
case "And I am sorry for all that Ava has put you through.": return "艾娃让你承受了这一切，真的很对不起。";
case "I will take the relic and say that I found it in the forest.": return "我会拿走圣物，就说是在森林里发现的。";
case "Is ok, everithing will be ok.": return "没事，一切都会好的。";
case "I'm really sorry I'm sorry I just wanted to be happy!": return "真的对不起，对不起，我只是想幸福！";
case "With the wish I would ask to meet that special someone for me!": return "有了愿望，我就能找到属于自己的那个人！";
case "I-I just wanted to start a family raise my children and go out with my husband!": return "只、只是想成个家，养育孩子，跟丈夫一起出门！";
case "I-I'm really sorry, but-but what choice did I have?": return "真、真的对不起，可、可我还能怎么办？";
case "That's when I met your friend, she promised me that if I stole the relic and fed it with energy, she would grant me a wish.": return "就在那时，我遇见了你朋友。她答应，只要偷走圣物，为它注满能量，就满足我一个愿望。";
case "I even learned how to cook so that they would at least fall in love with me for my cooking, but that didn't happen either.": return "我甚至学会了做饭，想着，至少能让他们因为厨艺爱上我，可还是没用。";
case "For the people I was nothing more than a piece of meat that could satisfy their needs.": return "在别人眼里，不过是块能满足他们欲望的肉。";
case "I never met anyone who saw me more than a succubus.": return "从来没人看见魅魔之外的那个我。";
case "My husband does not exist I made him up and I was completely miserable in my job.": return "丈夫根本不存在，是我编的。那份工作里，我一直痛苦极了。";
case "No darling, you are wrong, I have nothing to lose, because I have nothing.": return "不，亲爱的，你错了。我没什么可失去，因为，我一无所有。";
case "Miss Marael why did you steal the relic, you had everything, a husband, a dream job and you are good at cooking, why risk everything you have done in life for this?": return "玛拉艾尔女士，为什么要偷圣物？你什么都有，丈夫、理想的工作，还做得一手好饭，为什么要为这件事，把一生建立的一切都赌上？";
case "Guau.": return "哇。";
case "Yeah, BAD, BAD DOGGY!": return "对，坏狗，坏狗狗！";
case "This dog seems to be grounded :O.": return "这狗好像在受禁足:O。";
case "I'm sorry, Miss, but the library is closed..": return "抱歉，小姐，图书馆关门了……";
case "Line get up, you are naked in the middle of the street, the guards can take you prisoner!": return "莱茵，起来，光着身子躺在街上，卫兵会抓你的！";
case "Oh thanks I guess, bye Lemmy.": return "哦，算是谢谢吧，再见，雷米。";
case "Hey fairy, I'll leave your friend here, she had a good time, she resisted Lemmy well.": return "嘿，妖精，你朋友给你留在这里。她玩得很开心，也挺扛得住雷米。";
case "*Gulp* I'm going to get out of the carriage, I'll wait for you outside Line. :v": return "*咽口水*先下马车，在外面等你，莱茵。:v";
case "...HELLo?": return "……有人吗？";
case "Ehh I'm sure Lemmy isn't big enough to cover all the walls.": return "呃，雷米个头没那么大，不够遮住所有墙吧。";
case "Where did so many tentacles come from, was it you lemmy?": return "哪儿来的这么多触手，雷米，是你弄的？";
case "Wow it looks like seeing Lemmy's dick hasn't destroyed your mind, it might be a good reward since you helped me so much.": return "哇，看来见过雷米的屌，也没把脑子搞坏。既然帮了这么多忙，说不定是个好奖励。";
case "God mother fucking, DAMN.": return "天杀的，操他妈的，靠。";
case "Unsheathe boy and don't look at it for too long it might be a bit much for mortals.": return "拔出来吧，男孩，别盯着看太久，凡人可能受不了。";
case "I hope you don't mind me calling Lemmy but I need to relax after all that has happened.": return "希望你不介意，我把雷米叫来。发生了这么多事，真的需要放松一下。";
case "Yes, my name is ZONE-tan and I came to this island to rest and have a good time but it all ended so badly.": return "对，我叫ZONE-tan，来岛上休息、寻欢作乐，结果一切都糟透了。";
case "Wh-who are you Lemmy's mistress?!": return "你、你是谁，雷米的女主人？！";
case "Just a little bit more!!!": return "再来一点！！！";
case "AHhhhh the key is absorbing that thing.": return "啊——钥匙正在吸收那东西。";
case "Ah, ah ah here it is.": return "啊，啊啊，在这里。";
case "Shit Line pulls out the key!": return "妈的，莱茵，把钥匙拔出来！";
case "It is quite big here, what's that?!": return "这里挺大的，那个是什么？！";
case "*Line and Lili enter the carriage*": return "*莱茵和莉莉走进马车。*";
case "Ah fine.": return "啊，好吧。";
case "Wait! Is it too late to forget about this?": return "等等！现在反悔，还来得及吗？";
case "Do not worry Lemmy, your mistress will be fine.": return "别担心，雷米，女主人不会有事。";
case "BLurulup!": return "咕噜！";
case "He wants us to get into the carriage.": return "他想让我们上马车。";
case "AHhh what did he say?": return "啊，他说了什么？";
case "bluplulup.": return "咕噜噜。";
case "Lemmy we brought the key to your mistress.": return "雷米，我们给你女主人，把钥匙带来了。";
case "Ohh Ok, this is my first time in such a public place.": return "哦，好，第一次在这么公开的地方做。";
case "Don't worry, I've done it many times and she's always in her own world and besides her there's no one in the library.": return "别担心，试过很多次了，她总沉浸在自己的世界里，而且图书馆里除了她，根本没人。";
case "But what about the librarian?": return "可图书管理员呢？";
case "Haha Well, I wouldn't mind doing it here, in fact.": return "哈哈，其实在这里，我也不介意。";
case "... I don't know why I ask, go on.": return "……真不知道，我为什么要问，继续吧。";
case "Wait Line, you really don't want the 1000 Arcs?": return "等等，莱茵，你真不要那1000阿克？";
case "Wa-wait it is not necessary, Mmm maybe if you reward me with something else.": return "等、等等，不必这样，嗯，换个奖励也许不错。";
case "...Ahh fine, at least it's cheaper than the vip under the bar.": return "……啊，好吧，至少比酒吧底下的贵宾便宜。";
case "Yes, packed full of pictures of you fucking monster girls!": return "对，里面全是，你跟魔物娘做爱的照片！";
case "What?! You saw what was in the briefcase!": return "什么？！看过公文包里的东西了！";
case "What! NO it will be 10,000 Arcs we saw your dirty secret.": return "什么！不，得10,000阿克币，我们看到了你的龌龊秘密。";
case "Oh you saved my life take 1000 Arcs for your trouble.": return "你救了我的命，这1000阿克，作为辛苦费吧。";
case "Gilfried we found your briefcase.": return "吉尔德弗里德，找到你的公文包了。";
case "Gilfried The Monster Fucker.": return "吉尔德弗里德，怪物操手";
case "Ok it's time to go, if you want to see her again go to this address that's where we sleep.": return "好，该走了。想再见她，就去这个地址，我们住在那里。";
case "Yeah Oohw, I swear it's the first time it's happened.": return "对，呜，我发誓，第一次这样。";
case "You said that the librarian is always in her own world.": return "你说过，图书管理员总沉浸在自己的世界里。";
case "Wha what happend?": return "怎、怎么了？";
case "Ehhh Gilfried?": return "呃，吉尔德弗里德？";
case "Dude she is half succubus.": return "老兄，她有一半魅魔血统。";
case "Yeah that was better than I imagine you are not a just a regular elf.": return "对，比想象中还棒，你可不是普通精灵。";
case "Ohh it felt so good in my poopa.": return "哦，小屁屁里好舒服。";
case "The sword in the anvil of the purple and green forest remains a mystery to most, but its magic endures, waiting to be discovered by those truly worthy. This legend inspires generations to seek wisdom, purity, and strength in their hearts, in pursuit of a greater purpose in this magical corner of the world.": return "紫绿森林里，铁砧上的那把剑，对多数人而言，依旧是谜。可魔力长存，等待真正值得的人前来发现。这个传说激励一代又一代人，在心中寻找智慧、纯洁与力量，在世界这个神奇的角落，追寻更伟大的使命。";
case "The brave who venture into this forest must make a gesture of peace, imitate the purity of a rabbit, and show the strength of a gorilla to lift the sword from the anvil at its purple center. Only a few throughout the centuries have been worthy of this feat and become guardians of the forest, destined to protect peace and harmony in the world.": return "敢踏入这片森林的勇者，须以手势示好，仿效兔子的纯洁，展现大猩猩的力量，方能在紫色的森林中心，将剑从铁砧中拔出。数百年来，仅有寥寥数人配得上这份荣誉，成为森林守护者，肩负捍卫世界和平与和谐的命运。";
case "In a remote forest with a purple center and shimmering green trees, lies a legendary sword forged by The one Horned god. This unique sword, with an unusual hilt made of balls, can only be claimed by those who demonstrate wisdom, purity, and strength.": return "在一片偏远的森林里，紫色的中心、泛着微光的绿树之间，藏着独角神锻造的传说之剑。它的剑柄，由奇特的圆球构成。唯有展现智慧、纯洁与力量之人，才能得到它。";
case "The Pelletclad Blade.": return "弹丸之刃。";
case "*snif snif* Ok :c.": return "*吸吸鼻子*好吧:c。";
case "Let's go get it, before you get scolded again for yelling and screaming.": return "去拿吧，免得又因为大喊大叫挨骂。";
case "Oh I am sorry I am sorry I am sorry :c.": return "哦，对不起，对不起，对不起:c。";
case "SHhhh!": return "嘘！";
case "Lili the author lives on the island!": return "莉莉，作者就住在岛上！";
case "Story written by Clifftop Vegando currently lives quietly on the island of Elira.": return "故事作者克利夫托普·维甘多，目前在艾莉拉岛安静度日。";
case "Read the back cover.": return "读封底。";
case "Read the tale.": return "读这个故事。";
case "It's ok but let's read the story again, maybe we'll find something we missed that could help us.": return "好，不过再读一遍故事，也许能找到漏掉的线索，帮上忙。";
case "Well, if we are passing through the forest, I do not see why we should look for it.": return "嗯，反正要经过森林，顺路找找也无妨。";
case "Do you want to look for the sword?": return "想去找那把剑？";
case "Yes but how many have a story written about them.": return "是啊，可有几把剑，能有个专门为它写的故事？";
case "Mmm I thought it was normal on this island since almost every place has high energy points.": return "嗯，还以为岛上这是常态，毕竟几乎到处都有高能量点。";
case "It is not that, well actually yes but I really feel a great energy from the forest that is south of the hospital.": return "不是……好吧，其实也有，不过我真的感觉到，医院南边的森林里，有很强的能量。";
case "Please tell me you don't believe this.": return "拜托，别告诉我，你真信了。";
case "Mmmm... Lili.": return "嗯……莉莉。";
case "I don't think entering the church without permission is good idea.": return "不经允许就进教堂，好像不太好。";
case "They even stole our sign.": return "连招牌都偷走了。";
case "I am sorry but due to the theft of the sacred relics the church is closed to the public for the time being.": return "抱歉，圣物失窃，教堂暂不对外开放。";
case "Yes, I think that would cheer her up and... Thank you Lili for always being with me.": return "对，我想，这能让她开心点……莉莉，也谢谢你，一直陪着我。";
case "Let's give you the good news": return "去告诉她这个好消息。";
case "Hey let's go see Marael in theory everything has been solved.": return "嘿，去看看玛拉艾尔吧，按说事情都已经解决了。";
case "... yes Lili?": return "……怎么了，莉莉？";
case "Hey Line.": return "嘿，莱茵。";
case "But it's okay, I'll get over it.": return "不过没关系，我会走出来的。";
case "Mmm my head hurts a little.": return "嗯，头有点疼。";
case "Is there something wrong Line?": return "莱茵，有什么不对吗？";
case "Here you go, all the father's semen I saved just for you, now you have no excuse to say that a succubus didn't do anything for you <3.": return "给，特地替你攒的，神父的全部精液。现在，没理由再说，魅魔从来没为你做过什么了<3。";
case "Go away champion.": return "走吧，冠军。";
case "*Criying* What-are-you-doing? sniff sniff.": return "*哭泣*你、在、干什么？吸鼻子。";
case "Ohhhh YES ahhh. Wh-What are you doing here?!": return "哦——对，啊。你、你怎么会在这里？！";
case "F-Father why did you call me here?": return "神、神父，为什么叫我来这里？";
case "Slup shlup-shhhp shlup.": return "啾，啾噜，吸溜，啾噜。";
case "Eh-eh it's okay * pulls down his pants.": return "呃，呃，好吧。*拉下裤子。";
case "Easy she'll never know * stroking his penis.": return "放轻松，她永远不会知道。*抚摸他的阴茎*";
case "Miss Line, if I came here it is to stop this, I love Sister Nero,Ahh.. and why are you dressed as one of the sisters?": return "莱茵小姐，我来这里，就是为了阻止这事。我爱尼禄修女，啊……还有，为什么打扮成修女？";
case "Hello father.": return "你好，神父。";
case "No, I-I don't want to, I-I'll stay here.": return "不，不、不要，我、我就待在这儿。";
case "Shit, you're so annoying are you part of this yes or no?!": return "妈的，你真烦，到底还参不参与？！";
case "PLEASE don't put on the nun's outfit Line this is what marael warned us about, Please Stop, you will regret it for the REST of your LIFE.": return "求你，别穿那件修女服，莱茵！玛拉艾尔警告过的，就是这个！求求你，停下，不然会后悔一辈子。";
case "(What's going on, why did I make Lili cry, what did I do during the day?! Oh Lili please forgive me)": return "（怎么回事，我为什么把莉莉弄哭了？白天，我都做了什么？！哦，莉莉，求你原谅我。）";
case "Line st-stop please this is not you you would never h-hurt someone like that. *begins to sob*.": return "莱茵，停、停下，求你。这不是你，你绝不会这、这样伤害别人。*开始抽泣*";
case "Stop meddling in my life, I'll only do what I'm made for, now get out!": return "别再插手我的生活！只会做天生该做的事，现在滚出去！";
case "I know you are angry, but don't screw with the father.": return "我知道你很生气，可别拿神父出气。";
case "But-": return "可是——";
case "Stop it Line, stop playing dumb I beg you please don't do it!": return "住手，莱茵，别再装傻，求你了，别这样！";
case "What, what's wrong, it wasn't daytime, why, it's nighttime?": return "什么，怎么回事，刚才不是白天吗，怎么，天黑了？";
case "Stop! Please don't do this, if you do something like this you will regret it forever!": return "停下！求你，别这么做，做出这种事，你会后悔一辈子！";
case "Mo-mother?.": return "妈、妈妈？";
case "He-HeHE.": return "嘿，嘿嘿。";
case "Hehe I guess that is fun <3. take care of yourself.": return "嘿嘿，应该挺好玩的<3，照顾好自己。";
case "Yes I also got myself assigned here, now the sisters will have to see me every day to get to their precious place, Hahaha it fills my heart with joy to make them rage at least a little bit.": return "对，我也申请调来这里了。现在，修女们想去她们宝贝的地方，就得每天看见我。哈哈哈，能让她们哪怕气一点，都让我心里痛快。";
case "Well I guess it is something.": return "好吧，总算有点用。";
case "Mmmm nope for now, but once I finish my sentence I will stay working here if I can, it's not too bad, most of the guards do almost nothing.": return "嗯，现在没有，不过刑满以后，能继续留在这里工作的话，就留下。也没那么糟，大多数守卫几乎什么都不干。";
case "So you will not make any money?": return "所以，就不赚钱了？";
case "Haha yes, well the truth is that while looking for a job I was arrested and I asked for community service to pay off my debt to society and... here I am.": return "哈哈，是啊。其实找工作时，我被捕了，就申请社区服务来偿还对社会的亏欠，然后……就到这里了。";
case "But how, if you are a criminal, how did you end up as a guard?": return "可是，你不是罪犯吗，怎么成了守卫？";
case "Haha Hi Line, look where I got a job.": return "哈哈，莱茵，你好，看看，我在哪里找到工作了。";
case "Yes, yes, yes I have one eye open relax.": return "好，好，好，我会留个心眼，放心。";
case "What do you mean, relaxed? You should be attentive, you're a guard!": return "放松？什么意思？你是卫兵，应该留神才对！";
case "You know what? I never thought the day would come when I would feel relaxed. Thank you for helping me and the kids.": return "知道吗，从没想过，自己也能有安心的一天。谢谢你，帮了我和孩子们。";
case "...(For the first time in my life, I felt the desire to harm someone) I will go leave the relic.": return "……（人生中第一次，我有了伤害别人的冲动。）我去归还圣遗物。";
case "I'm very sure. Her presence was like a miasma; it can't bring anything good. That's how they are, those of her kind.": return "非常确定。她的存在如同瘴气，不会带来好事。她那一族都是这样。";
case "(This woman just wants to give the demon a hard time.) Are you sure she could really be related to this? Remember, we can't waste time on other things.": return "（这女人，就是想找那个恶魔的麻烦。）确定她真跟这件事有关？记住，我们没时间浪费在别的事情上。";
case "It's the island's librarian, daughter of a demon. She couldn't stop talking about the light our goddess emitted.": return "岛上的图书管理员，是恶魔的女儿。她一直谈论，我们女神散发的光。";
case "Hmm, I only know one person who started spending a lot of time here when our prophet made her first presence. I always found it a bit strange, but she spent a lot of time admiring her like the rest of us.": return "只知道一个人，自从先知第一次出现，就开始常来这里。一直觉得有点怪，不过和我们一样，她也花了很多时间仰慕先知。";
case "...I want to save her, but I need help. Any information about where the other relics are will be useful.": return "……我想救她，但需要帮助。任何关于其他圣遗物下落的消息，都有用。";
case "(Ava, what are you planning? Is this really part of your plan, or are you truly in danger?)": return "（艾娃，你在计划什么？这真是你计划的一部分，还是你真的遇到危险了？）";
case "Save her, for yourself, for all of us, for the world. *Starts praying.*": return "救她，为了你自己，为了我们所有人，为了世界。*开始祈祷。*";
case "That's why she needs you. You are part of her prophecy. Get the remaining three relics and save her.": return "所以，她才需要你。你也是预言的一部分。拿到剩下的三件圣物，救她。";
case "That's right, she, our prophet, will die...": return "没错，她，我们的先知，会死……";
case "B-b-but if she can't get out-": return "可、可、可她要是出不来——";
case "It's a sacred room linked to the relics. Once they were stolen, the room sealed itself.": return "那是和圣物相连的圣室，圣物一被偷，房间就自动封闭了。";
case "The day all the relics were stolen, she was behind this door.": return "所有圣遗物被盗的那天，她就在这扇门后面。";
case "What? But how?!": return "什么？可怎么会？！";
case "...Unfortunately, that can't be done right now. She is currently imprisoned.": return "……可惜，现在做不到。她目前被囚禁了。";
case "Hmm, before returning the relic, I need to know... Where is the angel? I know it's here.": return "嗯，归还圣遗物之前，我得先知道……天使在哪儿？我知道，她就在这里。";
case "Give her the relic, so we can move faster from this hause of stupidity.": return "把圣物给她，快点离开这座愚蠢之屋。";
case "I-I do not know what you Are talking about. (Oh no, she not only knows I'm a demon but also that I'm a succubus. :c)": return "不、不知道你在说什么。（糟了，不光知道我是恶魔，还知道我是魅魔。:c）";
case "I admit her actions are admirable.\nBut if she plans to enter the house of God, she should at least not arrive with the scent of a woman of the night.": return "我承认，她的行为令人钦佩。\n不过，想进入上帝的殿堂，至少，不该带着风尘女子的气味来。";
case "(It is clear she dislikes me. Even though I appear as an elf, I still have a demon's horn.)": return "（显然不喜欢我。虽然看着像精灵，可还是长着恶魔角。）";
case "Hey, who do you think you are! Line has helped the people on the island, even you! What does it matter how she looks.": return "喂，以为自己是谁！莱茵帮了岛上这么多人，连你也帮过！长什么样，有那么重要吗？";
case "Oh, nothing. It's just that I never thought the hero would be s-someone with... your characteristics.": return "哦，没什么。只是从没想过，英雄会是……具、具备你这些特征的人。";
case "Oh, wh-what's happening?": return "哦，发、发生什么了？";
case "*Line takes a step forward* Miss, could you tell me- *The nun takes a step back with a disgusted look*.": return "*莱茵往前一步*小姐，能告诉我——*修女满脸厌恶，后退了一步*。";
case "(Ava also lied to the entire church, she told them a prophecy and manipulated the succubi to make it come true.)": return "（艾娃也骗了整座教堂，告诉他们预言，再操纵魅魔，让预言成真。）";
case "She prophesied the arrival of a hero who would return our sacred relics once they leave the house of God.": return "她曾预言，一位英雄会到来，在圣物离开上帝的殿堂后，替我们将其取回。";
case "Our goddess has spoken to us through the light of a thousand colors.": return "我们的女神，透过千色之光，向我们传达了旨意。";
case "And how do you know we were coming?": return "怎么知道我们会来？";
case "H-h-how do you kn-know my name?": return "你、你、你怎么知、知道我的名字？";
case "We were waiting for you, Line.": return "我们一直在等你，莱茵。";
case "At last, you've arrived.": return "总算来了。";
case "*slaps her face* shut up you slut and get out of here.": return "*扇了她一巴掌*闭嘴，婊子，滚出去。";
case "I am sick and tired of you demigrating me just for being a-": return "就因为我是个——你们就一直羞辱我，受够了。";
case "Impossible for someone like you to understand what love is, you are no more than an animal, in fact, you are less than an animal, at least they can feel love for their owners.": return "你这种东西，根本不可能懂什么是爱。不过是个动物，不，连动物都不如，至少动物还会爱它们的主人。";
case "What-what are you doing? You can't do that here, it's a sin!": return "你、你在干什么？这里不能做这种事，这是罪！";
case "What are you doing here, you filthy blood?": return "污秽的血统，来这里做什么？";
case "I think it's this way.": return "应该往这边。";
case "Ay Line speaks clearly, you're an adult for fuck's sake.": return "哎，莱茵，说清楚点，你他妈已经是成年人了。";
case "That thing, which adults do.": return "就是大人会做的那件事。";
case "What the hell Line, what do you mean?": return "搞什么，莱茵，说什么呢？";
case "It's, that smell you know, when you do that thing.": return "就是，那股味道，你知道，做那种事的时候。";
case "What, what thing?": return "什么，什么东西？";
case "Hey, you do not feel that?": return "喂，没感觉到吗？";
case "I swear that woman will pay for everything she has done to me.": return "发誓，那女人一定会为对我做的一切付出代价。";
case "*hug* all right, let's get out of here.": return "*拥抱*好吧，我们走。";
case "*clenches his fist in anger* I swear that woman will pay for this.": return "*愤怒地攥紧拳头*发誓，一定要让那女人付出代价。";
case "Line are you ok?": return "莱茵，你没事吧？";
case "I'd better go": return "我还是走吧";
case "And about what you saw, I have no position to ask you to keep silent but if something like this becomes known we could lose everything.": return "至于看到的事，没资格要求保密，不过这种事传出去，我们可能会失去一切。";
case "Then she ended up in the street because of his parents' abandonment.": return "然后，她因为父母的遗弃，流落街头。";
case "Miss Line I beg your pardon, she has an aversion to succubus since her parents were separated by one.": return "莱茵小姐，请见谅。她父母曾被一个魅魔拆散，所以一直厌恶魅魔。";
case "I'm leaving.": return "我要走了。";
case "I will do it for you father, but not for this creature from hell.": return "神父，我是为了您，才这么做，可不是为了这个地狱来的怪物。";
case "NOW, BOTH OF YOU STOP!": return "现在，你们两个都给我停下！";
case "Shut up you racist asshole.": return "闭嘴，种族歧视的混蛋。";
case "Cursed hooker.": return "该死的婊子。";
case "Line, let's get us out of here, remember that Ava needs you.": return "莱茵，走吧，记住，艾娃还需要你。";
case "Enough of both of you!": return "你们两个，都够了！";
case "Now I just need to find him": return "现在只要找到他。";
case "I will get more money extorting him with the contents of the briefcase and I will make much more money than selling it hahaha.": return "拿公文包里的东西勒索他，比直接卖掉，能赚得更多，哈哈哈。";
case "A businessman forgot his briefcase in the bar and ended up taking it to me to sell it, but its contents were much better than I thought.": return "一个商人把公文包落在酒吧，最后被人拿到我这里卖，里面的东西，可比想象中精彩多了。";
case "I ended up selling the key to the secret fight club hidden in the forest.": return "最后，我把钥匙，卖给了藏在森林里的秘密搏击俱乐部。";
case "Luckily it was nighttime and she and what I assume is her bodyguard were distracted going to the bar so I just ran and stole the key, though for some reason they didn't follow me.": return "幸好是晚上，她和那个我猜是保镖的人，忙着去酒吧。我就跑过去，偷了钥匙，可不知道为什么，她们没追我。";
case "On the way to my lair, I saw a Zone-tan celebrity. she was carrying a giant golden key that I simply couldn't resist stealing.": return "回巢穴的路上，看见一位名叫Zone-tan的名人。她拿着一把巨大的金钥匙，实在忍不住，就偷来了。";
case "(is all blank)": return "（里面一片空白）";
case "Exit.": return "离开。";
case "Briefcase Black Mail.": return "公文包勒索。";
case "Giant Gold Key!.": return "巨大的黄金钥匙！";
case "False bridge guards switcheroo.": return "假桥卫兵的掉包计。";
case "Heist book": return "劫案之书";
case "(Line opens the briefcase in two and finds hundreds of pictures)": return "（莱茵把公文包打开，发现里面有几百张照片。）";
case "I-I am doing it!": return "我、我在做了！";
case "Open it! open it now!": return "打开！现在就打开！";
case "Mmmmmm.": return "嗯……";
case "What must be inside for him to be this desperate?": return "到底装了什么，能把他急成这样？";
case "Yes, he looked very desperate.": return "对，他看起来，绝望极了。";
case "Well you found Gilfried's briefcase now we just have to return it.": return "好了，吉尔德弗里德的公文包找到了，接下来只要还回去。";
case "* Line receives the key * ... thanks.": return "*莱茵接过钥匙*……谢谢。";
case "Bring the solid gold key to The Bitch": return "把纯金钥匙交给那个婊子。";
case "B-but, I told you that. Ahh whatever.": return "可、可那明明是我告诉你的。啊，算了。";
case "The Bitch.": return "那个婊子。";
case "On behalf of the secret fight club, I declare the title of.": return "我代表秘密搏击俱乐部，授予你称号：";
case "Yes, yes, whatever.": return "好，好，随便。";
case "Thank you very much,but do not say the B word.": return "太感谢了，不过别说“婊”字。";
case "You are in another level Softy, you beat every single bitch in here.": return "软妹，你都不是一个档次的，这里每个婊子都被你打败了。";
case "AHHHH.": return "啊啊啊！";
case "RWAAAR!": return "嗷——！";
case "RUN!!!": return "快跑！！！";
case "What!?": return "什么！？";
case "Run.": return "跑。";
case "She just hiss at me?": return "她刚才，是在冲我嘶嘶叫？";
case "HiZzZz!": return "嘶嘶！";
case "Hello kitty <3": return "你好，小猫 <3";
case "AAHHHHHH!": return "啊啊啊！";
case "RAWRRRR!": return "嗷——！";
case "Hey isn't that the clothes stolen from smooshers?!": return "喂，那不是从揉揉店偷来的衣服？！";
case "Hello kitty. <3": return "你好，小猫。<3";
case "No! we must help him.": return "不！我们得帮他。";
case "Let's get the fuck out of here line!": return "莱茵，赶紧离开这鬼地方！";
case "You can go Line, it can be a lot for you.": return "莱茵，可以走，这对你来说可能太过了。";
case "I can feel it, it's here.": return "感觉得到，就在这里。";
case "I will not forgive you for all the people you hurt!": return "那些被你伤害的人，我绝不会替他们原谅你！";
case "Come on Line it's time to finish this.": return "来吧，莱茵，该结束这一切了。";
case "I hope you enjoyed your time alive.": return "希望你享受过活着的日子。";
case "I'm going to wipe you completely off the face of existence.": return "我要把你，从存在本身，彻底抹除。";
case "You are wrong I don't want to absorb an inferior version of myself.": return "错了，才不想吸收一个比自己更差的版本。";
case "Your own minions defying your orders, pathetic.": return "连自己的手下都不听命令，可悲。";
case "Do you want me to go back to a pathetic being like you?": return "想让我变回你这种可悲的存在？";
case "Please, Mr. Vasera, let me help you.": return "瓦瑟拉先生，求你让我帮忙。";
case "What are you doing here? You're going to get yourself killed!": return "在这里做什么？会被杀的！";
case "Ohh shut up :s!": return "哦，闭嘴啦 :s！";
case "I thought it was your favorite of the clones, you kept sucking like crazy.": return "我以为，那是你最喜欢的分身呢，你一直吸得像疯了一样。";
case "Do you really want to kill me Line?": return "莱茵，真想杀我？";
case "Thank you Mr. Vasera I will do my best with the armor. <3": return "谢谢，瓦瑟拉先生，会尽力用好这套盔甲。<3";
case "Mmm you are, but you're not just any minion, you're the only one who would go on a suicide mission like trying to stop my clone.": return "嗯，你是，不过不是普通手下。阻止我的克隆体，简直是自杀任务，也只有你敢去。";
case "Oh thank you but why give me this, I thought I was just a simple subditee?": return "哦，谢谢。不过，为什么送我这个？我以为，自己只是个小跟班？";
case "You won't have armor like mine since it is destroyed but it might be of some use to you.": return "给不了你跟我一样的完整盔甲，它已经毁了。不过剩下的这些，也许还有用。";
case "I could observe that your garments absorb different clothes and help you for the combat.": return "我观察到，你的衣物，能够吸收不同服装，帮助你战斗。";
case "I want you to keep it.": return "我想让你留着。";
case "Is the remainder of my clone's armor.": return "这是我分身盔甲剩下的部分。";
case "What is that?": return "那是什么？";
case "Line come.": return "莱茵，过来。";
case "I don't need something as pathetic as you.": return "我不需要，像你这么可悲的东西。";
case "I am stronger than before you need me!": return "我比以前更强，你需要我！";
case "I beg you. Absorb me and you will be much more powerful than before we were divided.": return "求你。吸收我吧，那样你会比我们分开之前更强大。";
case "Please don't kill me.": return "求你别杀我。";
case "Then Show it!": return "那就拿出来吧！";
case "N-no I am not a coward and I'm a succubus!!! *Eat the fruit*": return "不、不是胆小鬼，我可是魅魔！！！*吃下水果*";
case "... I'm sorry Line, the truth is that I don't know if we really should continue with this whole 'looking for your succubus side', it seems that it only attracts more problems than anything else.": return "……对不起，莱茵。说实话，我不知道，该不该再继续这整套“探索魅魔一面”的事。感觉，带来的麻烦，比别的什么都多。";
case "Lili... say.. something .": return "莉莉……说……句话。";
case "You are pathetic get out of here.": return "真可悲，滚吧。";
case "Then I was wrong about you, you're just an elf trying to be a succubus.": return "那就是看错你了，不过是个想假扮魅魔的精灵。";
case "No-no I cannot do it Big sis.": return "不、不行，姐姐，我做不到。";
case "Plus don't worry about the customers, the waitresses keep them sufficiently distracted.": return "客人也不用担心，女招待们已经让他们分不了心。";
case "Well, if you want to be a good succubus you must be prepared to do it everywhere.": return "想做个好魅魔，就得做好随时随地开干的准备。";
case "What?! I am no-not going to do it here, a-are you crazy?": return "什么？！我才不、不会在这里做，你、你疯了吗？";
case "Here Line Eat this.": return "来，莱茵，吃下这个。";
case "Thanks Big Sis <3 and good luck in your work. <3": return "谢谢姐姐<3，祝工作顺利。<3";
case "That's great Line I love that you understand how great one can feel when roles are switched.": return "太好了，莱茵，角色互换能有多爽，你终于懂了，真开心。";
case "To be the one who wants his desire fulfilled and who wants it now.": return "当那个想满足欲望，而且，现在就要的人。";
case "Yes, yes, I can feel it, the rush, the power, I think I just realized what it means.": return "对，对，感觉到了，那股冲劲，那股力量，好像终于理解它意味着什么。";
case "Sometimes you have to be the dominant one.": return "有时候，也得当支配别人的那一个。";
case "I just want you to be more active not everyone likes a scared or shy girl.": return "我只想让你更主动些，不是每个人，都喜欢畏畏缩缩、害羞的姑娘。";
case "I am sorry for what I said before.": return "之前说的那些话，对不起。";
case "Ohhh so strong.": return "哦，好壮。";
case "you can't enter here sorry.": return "抱歉，不能进去。";
case "Line beutiful.": return "莱茵真美。";
case "Be aware of what the clients want, if they want dry kisses or kisses with a lot of saliva and if they are fast or slow <3.": return "留意客人想要什么，是干吻还是口水很多的湿吻，节奏快还是慢<3。";
case "Line you want to earn some money just give some good smoosh <3!": return "莱茵，想赚点钱，给客人来几个舒服的亲亲就行<3！";
case "He tipped you 50 Arcs!": return "他给了你50阿克小费！";
case "You are a natural Smoosher Line!": return "莱茵，你简直是天生的斯慕舍服务员！";
case "At least he tipped you 10 Arcs.": return "至少，他还给了10阿克小费。";
case "Oh... Don't worry Line, you didn't do too bad.": return "哦……别担心，莱茵，做得也没那么差。";
case "Watch out Vasuki!": return "瓦苏基，小心！";
case "I don't know, the guards hired me because they are busy with the relics problem.": return "不知道，卫兵忙着圣遗物的事，就雇了我。";
case "But why are they doing that?": return "可他们为什么那样做？";
case "An abnormal number of slimes have appeared on the island and are attacking women, so far nothing has happened, but it seems that they want to kidnap them.": return "岛上出现大量异常的史莱姆，开始袭击女人。暂时还没出事，不过看起来，想把她们绑走。";
case "Watch out for that slime.": return "小心那只史莱姆。";
case "What, what's wrong?!": return "怎么，怎么了？！";
case "Watch out Line! be on the alert!": return "小心，莱茵，提高警惕！";
case "Vasuki What are you doing here?!": return "瓦苏基，你怎么在这里？！";
case "Regardless of where she got it from, we have to go to the next location!": return "不管她从哪儿弄来的，我们得去下一个地点！";
case "Maybe she stole it": return "也许是她偷的。";
case "Mmmm it had a key inside.": return "嗯，里面有把钥匙。";
case "Yes, look there is something inside the slime.": return "对，看，史莱姆里面有东西。";
case "What's wrong Line?": return "怎么了，莱茵？";
case "Wait!": return "等等！";
case "Okay, the next place will be at the entrance to the town, that's where the guards told me there might be another one.": return "好，下一站是镇子入口，守卫说那里可能还有一个。";
case "Hahaha Line you were awesome. <3": return "哈哈哈，莱茵，你太棒了<3。";
case "No, I insist I could not leave you alone.": return "不，我坚持，不能丢下你一个人。";
case "Don't worry Line, I really do it for what you have done for me, for the problems I gave you with the law by burning all those arcs and also with this work maybe I could improve the house a little bit.": return "别担心，莱茵，我是真心想报答你。之前烧掉那些阿克，让你惹上法律麻烦。而且，有这份工作，也许能把家里改善一下。";
case "Vasuki you work too much let me help you.": return "瓦苏基，你太辛苦了，让我帮忙。";
case "Yes, but the guards should be here any minute now and they will take her to jail before she wakes up with all her energy.": return "对，不过卫兵随时会来，趁她还没恢复全部精力，就能送进监狱。";
case "Then they will get back on their feet and fight with the same energy as before?": return "然后，它们又会站起来，跟刚才一样精力充沛地打架？";
case "Calm down Lili according to the guards when they beat one they end up in a state of recovery.": return "冷静，莉莉，守卫说，打败之后，它们会进入恢复状态。";
case "Hey, is that slime going to be okay? it's kind of lost its shape.": return "喂，这史莱姆没事吧，形状好像都散了。";
case "There is nothing to stop us!": return "没什么能挡住我们！";
case "We did it!": return "我们成功了！";
case "Yes, don't WOOORRRRYYY.": return "对，别——担——心——。";
case "Be careful this place looks in very bad shape we don't know what could happen.": return "小心，这地方破得很，不知道会出什么事。";
case "Y-yes, here we will know more information about Ava.": return "对、对，我们会在这里，知道更多艾娃的消息。";
case "Don't worry Line, for now we could investigate the island, maybe there is more information about Ava.": return "别担心，莱茵，先调查这座岛，也许有更多艾娃的线索。";
case "Do you really want to enter?": return "真想进去？";
case "This gives me a bad vibe.": return "感觉不太妙。";
case "This is the place, I think.": return "应该，就是这里。";
case "For the future, the children and us I will give my best too!": return "为了未来、孩子，还有我们，也一定全力以赴！";
case "You won't be alone in this Red count me in!": return "不会让你独自承担的，雷德，算我一个！";
case "If so, I will give my all and find a job!": return "如果是这样，我会全力以赴，找份工作！";
case "... Ah, look, I can help in getting 3.000 Arcs, but you will have to promise me to work in a noble way.": return "……啊，这样，可以帮忙凑3,000阿克，不过你得答应，以后正正当当地工作。";
case "But they said that since we are children of sin we deserved our destiny.": return "可他们说，我们是罪恶生下的孩子，活该受这样的命运。";
case "It was the first thing we did.": return "这就是我们最先做的事。";
case "Do you think we are idiots?!": return "以为我们是白痴？！";
case "And about this you could give the children to the church and you will have to look for a decent job to earn money legitimately even if it is your last option to go to the VIP area.": return "至于这个，可以把孩子交给教堂，然后找份正经工作，堂堂正正赚钱，就算最后只能去VIP区也好。";
case "... Hey I-I will not turn you over but you all will have to stop stealing.": return "……听着，我、我不会告发你们，可你们得停止偷窃。";
case "We are finished.": return "我们完了。";
case "And now the hero of the island will deliver us to justice.": return "现在，岛上的英雄要把我们绳之以法了。";
case "We are 3.000 Arcs under budget that would give us a little time but not much.": return "还差3000阿克，补上后，能撑一阵子，可也不会太久。";
case "But that doesn't matter anymore, we don't have the money to feed the children or pay for their education.": return "不过，已经不重要了。没有钱给孩子们吃饭，也付不起他们的学费。";
case "We also do not want to work in the VIP area and continue with the cycle.": return "我们也不想去贵宾区工作，把这种循环，继续下去。";
case "I, Naga and Cuevo are one of those children, we wanted to give a future to these children but we don't know how to do anything but steal.": return "我、娜迦和库埃尔沃，曾经也是这些孩子中的一员。想给他们一个未来，却除了偷东西，什么都不会。";
case "Unwanted children born and end up on the streets to survive on its own.": return "没人要的孩子，一出生就流落街头，只能自己想办法活下去。";
case "... Look I opened this orphanage because of the high sexual activity on this island ... Mistakes happen.": return "……我开这家孤儿院，就是因为岛上的性活动，太频繁了……总会出意外。";
case "Lili!.": return "莉莉！";
case "Well they don't do a great job even we live better.": return "看来做得真不怎么样，连我们都过得比这强。";
case "Do not tell me that you were stealing to keep this place alive and these children.": return "别告诉我，你们偷东西，是为了养活这里和这些孩子。";
case "... Well it doesn't matter it's all over now.": return "……算了，无所谓了，一切都结束了。";
case "I could not let you take the crystals, my friends need them to return to their dimensions.": return "不能让你们拿走水晶，朋友们需要它们，才能回到自己的次元。";
case "And you are the hero, who screwed up all our plans.": return "你就是，毁掉我们全部计划的那个英雄。";
case "You are the thieves I've seen them all over the island what is all this?!": return "你们就是小偷，整个岛上都见过你们，这到底怎么回事？！";
case "And to make matters worse, they found our hideout.": return "更糟的是，还让人找到了藏身处。";
case "We were not able to steal any crystal.": return "我们没能偷到，任何一块水晶。";
case "We are running out of money.": return "钱快用光了。";
case "What are we going to do now?": return "现在，该怎么办？";
case "Lili not now, I feel I have been given a big responsibility, now I just want to leave.": return "莉莉，现在别说了。感觉肩上压了很大的责任，现在只想离开。";
case "Hey Line, will you really accept this offe-?": return "喂，莱茵，真要答应这个条——？";
case "Thank you very much, if you can do it we would really appreciate it, even if there is a price to pay.": return "非常感谢。你要是能做到，我们会十分感激，就算得付出代价，也没关系。";
case "... I will try to help in any way I can but each of you must get a job or none of this will help.": return "……会尽可能帮忙。不过每个人都得找份工作，否则这样下去，也无济于事。";
case "The three of us will give you our most precious moment, please help us.": return "我们三个会献上自己最珍贵的时刻，求你帮帮我们。";
case "Stop it, I will give you the same, please help us.": return "别说了，我也会给你一样的，求你帮帮我们。";
case "I-I I really do not know if I have the ability to get-": return "我、我真不知道自己能不能筹——";
case "Wait please, I offer you the same, this is all for us with those 10.000 Arcs I know we will have time to find a job.": return "等等，求求你，条件还是一样，这笔钱就是我们的一切。有那10,000阿克，相信就能撑到找到工作。";
case "Agh, Look I am a succubus yes, but still 10.000 Arcs is a lot, the truth even if I want I do not know if I can get-.": return "唉，听着，我是魅魔没错，可一万阿克，也太多了。说实话，就算我想，也不知道能不能弄——";
case "I-I'll give you my virginity, I know you're a succubus and I'm sure taking the virginity of someone who's been taking care of it for 21 years must be very attractive to you.": return "我、我会把第一次给你。知道你是魅魔，一个守了21年的处女，第一次一定对你很有吸引力。";
case "But you do not have money, what could you give us?": return "可你们没有钱，又能拿什么给我们？";
case "I beg you, if you get another 10.000 Arcs we can pay for the children's education and improve this place, I will repay you.": return "求求你，再弄到一万阿克，我们就能付孩子们的学费，改善这里。我会报答你的。";
case "Wait! all is not lost, we gain some more time with your 3.000 Arcs!": return "等等！还没到绝路，有你那3,000阿克，就能再多撑一阵！";
case "This is a disaster.": return "真是一场灾难。";
case "Basically, we are still at the same point as before...": return "基本上，还是回到了原地……";
case "they didn't give me a job because apparently working with 'bandages' instead of clothes is not appropriate. But what could i do? all my money goes to this place i don't have money to buy clothes :c.": return "人家不给工作，说穿着“绷带”而不是衣服上班，不像样。可还能怎么办？钱全花在这里了，哪有钱买衣服:c。";
case "I tried to be a fortune teller but it seems that you have to learn to be one, it seems that it is not enough just to be a lamia. :p": return "本来想当占卜师，结果，好像得专门学过才行，光是拉米亚，还不够:p。";
case "Look, we have a bad reputation and they just don't want to give us work.": return "我们名声太差了，根本没人肯给工作。";
case "What do you mean it did not work?!": return "什么叫没用？！";
case "Yes, about that it did not work.": return "对，说到那个，没成功。";
case "Well hehe.": return "嗯，嘿嘿。";
case "Ehh...": return "呃……";
case "It's not necessary, as long as the three of you work together now without hurting anyone, it will be fine.": return "不必了，只要你们三个，以后一起努力，不再伤害别人，就很好。";
case "I-I really don't know how to thank you for this.": return "我、我真的不知道怎么感谢。";
case "Wait here girls I think I have the solution to all this.": return "姑娘们，在这里等，觉得有办法了。";
case "And who better for a family than Miss Marael! You are a genius!": return "能给她们一个家的人，谁比玛拉艾尔女士更合适！你是天才！";
case "But you can feel the love and the heart that is here, they are complete strangers to each other but they are still a family.": return "不过，能感受到这里的爱和真心。原本互不相识，却依旧是一家人。";
case "Come on Line just look at this place it's a mess-": return "来嘛，莱茵，看看这里，都乱成什么样了——";
case "What, but who Lili?!": return "什么，可是谁啊，莉莉？！";
case "You know what, I think I know who can help.": return "我想，知道谁能帮忙了。";
case "We will earn worse with these jobs, the money you got will be gone in a few days and we will be back to the same point as before if we don't steal.": return "这些工作，赚得只会更少。你弄来的钱，几天就花完。不偷的话，我们又得回到原点。";
case "What but why?!": return "什么，为什么？！";
case "Thanks for everything Line the money and the second chance, but the truth is that we will continue working and stealing.": return "莱茵，谢谢这一切，谢谢钱和重新开始的机会。不过说实话，我们还会继续工作，也继续偷窃。";
case "What, what's wrong?": return "怎么，怎么了？";
case "hahaha.. ha...": return "哈哈……哈……";
case "I will be a decent guard which is already a lot for this island haha.": return "我会做个称职的守卫，对这座岛来说，已经很难得了，哈哈。";
case "And I will be the best fortune teller!": return "我会成为最棒的占卜师！";
case "I will be the best clown on the island! <3.": return "一定要成为全岛最棒的小丑！<3。";
case "Hehe I am glad I noticed that you all have honorable jobs and you are all role models for these children.": return "嘿嘿，看到你们都有了正经工作，还成了孩子们的榜样，我真高兴。";
case "You will be my role to follow <3.": return "会把你当作榜样<3。";
case "Oh you are the best of all heroes!": return "哦，你是所有英雄里最棒的！";
case "I really meant that you don't really think about giving them 10000 arcs? but mmm well you know it doesn't matter.": return "其实是想问，不会真打算给他们一万阿克吧？不过，嗯，算了，没事。";
case "I see that you really care about this place and Lili I would not mess with someone who is at her most fragile moment.": return "看得出，你真的很关心这里。莉莉，她正是最脆弱的时候，我可不会去招惹。";
case "Hey Line, you really didn't think-": return "嘿，莱茵，你不会真以为——";
case "I only ask to go somewhere else where no one can see us.": return "我只要求，换个没人能看见我们的地方。";
case "We will follow you until the end.": return "我们会追随你，直到最后。";
case "I say the same Red.": return "我也一样，雷德。";
case "You are the best fri-sisters I could have ever had.": return "你们是我这辈子最好的朋、姐妹。";
case "Remember we do this for the children and the future we did not have we can give to them.": return "记住，我们是为了孩子，为了把自己没能拥有的未来，交给她们。";
case "It's more than we deserve.": return "这比我们应得的，还要多。";
case "Thank you very much hero.": return "太感谢了，英雄。";
case "We kept this place as long as we could, thanks to Line this place can be rebuilt.": return "我们尽力撑到现在，多亏莱茵，这里才能重建。";
case "Well it looks like the day has finally arrived girls.": return "好吧，姑娘们，这一天终于来了。";
case "See what you have done here. You are the hero you always wanted to be.": return "看看，你在这里做成了什么。你已经是，自己一直想当的那个英雄。";
case "You will take my place over my filthy, pissing corpse!": return "想取代我，先踩过我这具又脏、又尿淋淋的尸体！";
