case "But why did you have to die. If there is a god in this world, would he be angry with us?": return "可是，为什么非得死呢。如果世界上真有神，他会不会在生我们的气？";
case "Our intention was good, it was to help people.": return "出发点是好的，是想帮别人。";
case "I'll have to ignore it and continue with the research and eventually they will show up I guess.": return "只能先不管，继续研究，最后她们总会出现吧。";
