case "AHHh, WAIT ALDO! Oh no... HE-HeheheHE.": return "啊，等等，阿尔多！哦，不……嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿。";
case "AHH! I CAN FEEL YOUR THICK AND HOT CUM FILLING ME UP!": return "啊！能感觉到，你浓热的精液，正在灌满我！";
case "AH, AH-AH, AHHHH, HAVING SEX WITH MY STEPSON IS THE BEST!!!": return "啊，啊、啊，啊——，跟继子做爱，最棒了！！！";
case "TAKE THIS MAMA ACCEPT MY CHILD IN YOUR WOMB!": return "接好了，妈妈，让我的孩子，住进你的子宫！";
case "More, HARDER Aldo! STRONGEREEEEEEEEEEEEEEE CLAIM ME AS YOURS!": return "再来，用力点，阿尔多！再用力——把我变成你的！";
case "AHh, Ah AHHHH.": return "啊，啊，啊——";
case "Ah.": return "啊。";
case "... Line.": return "……莱茵。";
case "Look, Aldo, the truth is that...": return "听着，阿尔多，其实……";
case "Shit... I'm afraid of what you have to say.": return "妈的……有点怕听到你接下来要说的话。";
case "Yeah, hey we need to talk, it is very serious.": return "嗯，喂，我们得谈谈，很严重的事。";
case "You finally came": return "总算来了。";
case "Excellent work Line <3.": return "莱茵，干得太棒了<3。";
case "... Callie asked where you were, you better go see her.": return "……卡莉刚才在问你去哪儿了，最好去见见她。";
case "Oh nothing Lili why so serious hehe?": return "哦，没什么，莉莉，怎么这么严肃，嘿嘿？";
case "Hey... what were you doing?": return "嘿……刚才在做什么？";
case "... you know very well that this is a lie.": return "……你明知道，那是谎言。";
case "But I assure you we did our best!": return "不过，我保证，我们已经尽力了！";
case "I did what I could with my friend... I am sorry if you know any of those affected.": return "我和朋友已经尽力了……要是认识遇害的人，真的很遗憾。";
case "Hey, i-it's not your fault, I-I am trying to be something of a hero too.": return "嘿，不、不是你的错，我、我也想努力，成为英雄。";
case "Do I really deserve to be alive?": return "我真的配活着吗？";
case "I... am I a hero? I could have saved them... my life is not worth more than anyone else's.": return "我……是个英雄？本可以救她们……我的命，不比任何人更珍贵。";
case "Please listen to me, this is much more than my Eleonor, think of these women's families!": return "求你，听我说，这不仅关乎我的埃莉诺，想想那些女人的家人！";
case "There is no reason to believe you.": return "没有任何理由，相信你。";
case "Enough! You psycho, it ends here!": return "够了，疯子，到此为止！";
case "If I succeed all those women I can revive them as slime, I only need the one who is compatible for my beautiful Eleonor and she will stabilize forever all the women transformed.": return "只要成功，就能让那些女人，全都以史莱姆的形态复活。只差一个，能和我美丽的埃莉诺相容的人，就能让所有被转化的女人，永远稳定下来。";
case "I'm not crazy! All these women's lives were steps to bring my Eleonor back to the way she was!": return "我没疯！这些女人的生命，都是让埃莉诺恢复原样的阶梯！";
case "I think I am going to throw up.": return "我快吐了。";
case "this lunatic has been abducting women and turning them into slime.": return "这个疯子，一直绑架女人，把她们变成史莱姆。";
case "I-it cannot be.": return "不、不可能。";
case "Revive my Love!": return "复活吧，我的爱！";
case "The Slime seekers warned us One of them is compatible with you it's now or never!": return "搜寻型史莱姆提醒我们，有一个和你兼容，就看现在了！";
case "Consume, this means... this blood?!": return "吞噬，这意思是……这些血？！";
case "Eleonor my love Consume them, please, one more time.": return "埃莉诺，我的爱人，吞噬她们，求你了，再来一次。";
case "NOOO! This cannot end here!": return "不——！不能在这里结束！";
case "Raise your hands where I can see them and come with me!": return "举起手，让我看见，跟我走！";
case "You are under arrest by the power granted to me by the great captain of Elira!": return "凭艾莉拉大队长授予的权力，逮捕你！";
case "Hey! You're the one behind all this!": return "喂！原来一切都是你干的！";
case "Wha-what is all this blood?": return "这、这么多血，怎么回事？";
case "CONSUME THEM ELEONOR!": return "吞噬她们，埃莉诺！";
case "Don't you dare talk to my wife like that!": return "不许这么跟我妻子说话！";
case "This thing needs to be taken care of first!": return "先解决这东西！";
case "Ahhhhh ok but we'll go together, maybe this way you'll have more time to drain all the energy from that thing!": return "啊，好，不过我们一起走，这样也许能多给你点时间，把那东西的精力吸干！";
case "Vasuki, if I don't do it we will die anyway.": return "瓦苏基，我不这么做，我们照样会死。";
case "Are you done talking? surrender to Eleonor and bring her back to life!": return "说完了？臣服于埃莉诺，让她复活！";
case "I have no other options.": return "别无选择了。";
case "And if you are compatible you will end up becoming that psychopath's wife.": return "要是相容，最后就会变成那个疯子的妻子。";
case "You are completely crazy if you are not the compatible she will kill you.": return "彻底疯了，如果不兼容，她会杀了你。";
case "Vasuki I have an idea, if I come in contact with her, I can drain her energy and thus defeat her or at least incapacitate her.": return "瓦苏基，有个主意。接触她，就能吸走她的能量，打败她，至少，也能让她失去行动能力。";
case "El-eleonor yo-you changed we are so close to your resurrection.": return "埃、埃莉诺，你、你变了，离复活已经那么近了。";
case "We cannot defeat it": return "我们打不过。";
case "Is too strong!": return "太强了！";
case "The message does not go public because of the scrutiny of one of the parties involved to catch the accused.": return "出于参与抓捕的一方的顾虑，这条留言未向公众公开。";
case "'Do you really think your life is worth more than all those women!?'": return "“难道真觉得，自己的命，比那些女人的命加起来还重要！？”";
case "Before the accused lost all his sanity, he wrote a message in blood on the wall of his cell.": return "被告彻底失去理智之前，在牢房墙上，用血写下一条消息。";
case "The number of missing women associated with the case is in the dozens and growing as the investigation progresses.": return "与此案有关的失踪女性，已多达数十人，随着调查推进，人数仍在增加。";
case "Hours after the mother slime died, all the slimes created by it perished.": return "史莱姆之母死去几小时后，由它创造的所有史莱姆也一并死亡。";
case "Dr. Isic Arumov did not face justice due to his mental state.": return "伊西克·阿鲁莫夫博士，因精神状况，未能接受审判。";
case "The attack of the Slimes has finally ceased and the citizens feel a little safer again.": return "史莱姆的袭击终于停止，市民们重新感到些许安全。";
case "Raise your hands and come with me.": return "举起手，跟我走。";
case "*Read the name on his coat* Doctor Isic Arumov you are under arrest for crimes against humanity.": return "*读出外套上的名字*伊西克·阿鲁莫夫博士，你因反人类罪，被捕了。";
case "Do not let him get into your head Line, he is responsible for all of this.": return "别让他影响你，莱茵，这一切，全是他的责任。";
case "Bu-ut I just wanted to stop this, I-I am a hero I did not want to doom anyone.": return "可、可只是想阻止这事，我、我是英雄，不想害死任何人。";
case "You selfish fool, you condemned all the women who became Slime!": return "自私的蠢货，你让所有变成史莱姆的女人，都没救了！";
case "M-my intention was only t-to incapacitate her, I did not think she woul-": return "只、只是想让她失、失去行动能力，没想到，她会——";
case "I-it seems to have worked.": return "看、看来成功了。";
case "Wha-what have they done to you my love, Eleonor, why... why? you didn't have to die.": return "他、他们对你做了什么，爱人，埃莉诺，为什么……为什么？你本来，不必死的。";
case "If we do everything right, there should be no problems.": return "只要一切做对，就不该出问题。";
case "I will have to accelerate the investigation for Eleonor's sake and mine.": return "为了埃莉诺，也为了自己，得加快研究。";
case "The great captain announced that the happy bad omen sect, after years of not knowing about them, had caused one of the most grotesque crime of the last decade on the island.": return "大队长宣布，消失多年、杳无音信的“欢乐的不祥之兆”教派，犯下了岛上近十年来，最骇人听闻的罪行之一。";
case "They murdered all the women in Big Dream.": return "大梦酒吧里的女人，全被他们杀了。";
case "It's going to be a long night.": return "今晚会很漫长。";
case "In the room there is a chair in front of a table, sit there.": return "房间里有把椅子，就在桌前，坐在那里。";
case "T-Then what do we do?!": return "那、那我们怎么办？！";
case "If you go out now you could run into one of them, you could be possessed or worse so you can't leave that office.": return "现在出去，可能撞上她们，被附身，甚至遭遇更糟的事。所以，不能离开这间办公室。";
case "But at night they become very aggressive.": return "可一到晚上，就会变得非常凶暴。";
case "Thi-this place is cursed at night by... people I hold dear to my heart.": return "夜里，这、这地方被……我心中珍视的人们，诅咒了。";
case "AH decide woman!": return "啊，做个决定吧，女人！";
case "NO, stop! don't leave!": return "不，停下！别走！";
case "Let's go Line I feel that there is something very wrong here!": return "走吧，莱茵，感觉这里，有什么很不对劲！";
case "What? oh no this is very bad I'm so sorry.": return "什么？哦，不，太糟糕了，实在很抱歉。";
case "OH No no no why are they there and at night! this place is closed to the public it is very dangerous!": return "哦，不不不，为什么晚上会在那里！这里不对外开放，很危险！";
case "Alo who is it?": return "喂，哪位？";
case "I think it comes from the ventilation.": return "好像是从通风口传来的。";
case "A-aloooo.": return "喂、喂。";
case "AHHhhHH": return "啊啊啊";
case "AAahHH": return "啊啊";
case "WHO IS THERE?!": return "谁在那里？！";
case "Hey Hey, Don't stand up so fast you've been unconscious for quite a while.": return "喂，喂，别起得这么快，你已经昏迷很久了。";
case "Enough woman! if I had an arc for every time you fall for being distracted I would have 2 arcs wich is not a lot but is weird that it happend twice.": return "够了，女人！每次走神摔倒，都给我一阿克的话，现在就有两阿克了。虽然不多，可居然发生了两次，也挺奇怪的。";
case "This time Uhgg, I do not think so.": return "这次，呃，我觉得不行。";
case "LINE ARE YOU OK?!": return "莱茵，你没事吧？！";
case "AgHHHH SHIKAWAGA.": return "啊啊啊，西卡瓦加。";
case "Quieres empezar?": return "要开始吗？";
case "Best of luck girls...": return "姑娘们，祝你们好运……";
case "Once the sun rises we can talk more.": return "等太阳升起，我们再详谈。";
case "Shit... you watch the cameras and give me the signal to close the doors.": return "妈的……你看监控，给我关门信号。";
case "Lili I am so scared ;c.": return "莉莉，我好害怕;c。";
case "That's the problem you have to last until dawn and I know the energy won't last that long so only close them when it's really necessary!": return "问题就在这里，得撑到天亮。知道能量撑不了那么久，所以，只有真正必要时，才把它们关上！";
case "So much drama just to tell us to close the doors!": return "就是让我们把门关上，搞这么大阵仗！";
case "Watch for ghosts with the cameras and if they get too close, close the doors.": return "用监控盯着鬼魂，太靠近，就把门关上。";
case "What, then what do I do :c?": return "什么，那该怎么办:c？";
case "Unfortunately, this was a long time ago so I don't know how much time you have, with energy.": return "很遗憾，事情过去太久了，剩下的电力，能撑多久，我也不清楚。";
case "Where you are is the safest place there is, the knights of Elira have cordoned off the place and placed generators that activate doors reinforced with magic.": return "你们所在的地方最安全，艾莉拉骑士已经封锁周边，并安装发电机，启动魔法加固的门。";
case "There is not much time this is what you should do.": return "时间不多，听好，该这么做。";
case "Oh, great ehh I guess ;c": return "哦，太好了，呃，大概吧;c。";
case "In spite of all the bad things you are lucky tonight they are very calm but you can't let your guard down.": return "尽管坏事不少，你运气还算好，今晚它们很安静，不过也绝不能放松警惕。";
case "Now listen to me, this is very important.": return "现在，听我说，这非常重要。";
case "It's a bad idea to leave this room.": return "离开这间房，可不是好主意。";
}
return s;
